&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious Minds. Bold Ideas. Extraordinary Impact&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re transforming financial services through bold innovation and relentless execution. You bring the ideas and drive. We&#39;ll build what&#39;s next — together.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Project Manager, you will be part of a high-performing professional services team focused on evaluating how the nCino product can best meet our European clients’ needs and working with the Implementation Consultant to oversee the application of a seven-step implementation process with nCino bank and credit union customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute strategic vision and adoption of nCino across financial institutions by engaging stakeholders at all levels. Foster strong relationships and ensure alignment with organizational goals for project success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take full ownership of the project/program timeline, proactively addressing risks and dependencies. Implement strategies to keep deliverables on track and ensure timely completion of milestones.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leads cross-functional teams using Agile methodologies, ensuring efficient delivery of projects by facilitating sprint planning, daily stand-ups, retrospectives, and ensuring continuous improvement throughout the development lifecycle.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversees large-scale implementations by managing multiple workstreams, ensuring alignment across teams, mitigating risks, and maintaining project timelines to deliver successful, integrated solutions on time and within budget&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manages stakeholder relationships by ensuring clear communication, expectations alignment, and regular updates; oversees resource allocation to optimize team performance and capacity; tracks budget and burn rates to ensure projects stay within financial constraints; and monitors key performance indicators (KPIs) and business value metrics (BVMs) to assess progress, drive decision-making, and ensure delivery of high-impact outcomes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently handle project escalations, maintaining momentum and customer satisfaction. Swiftly address challenges and implement effective problem-solving strategies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exhibit advanced skills in managing nCino project plans and tooling, including task management, resource coordination, and milestone achievement. Ensure alignment with strategic objectives and timely, budget-compliant deliverables.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide comprehensive project status updates and risk assessments to peers and senior management. Ensure transparent communication across all stakeholders, enhancing project visibility and confidence.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seek knowledge, refine domain skills, and work collaboratively for team success. Foster a culture of continuous learning and professional growth, developing advanced technical skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor new employees, interact with leaders across departments, and be sought out for opinions on significant matters. Lead by example, driving organizational excellence and contributing to the refinement of internal processes and tools within our teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and capitalize on whitespace within programs to drive revenue for nCino. This includes assessing additional resourcing needs, exploring cross-sell/up-sell opportunities, and negotiating higher rates based on the value provided by current resources.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI tools and techniques to enhance work efficiency and optimize business operations by automating routine tasks to improve accuracy, save time, and minimize errors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize AI-driven insights to refine decision-making, elevate customer experience, and boost team productivity while ensuring its application provides measurable value, driving innovation and smarter ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay informed on AI advancements to drive continuous learning and scalable growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Required:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undergraduate degree in a relevant field (e.g., Business, Management, Information Technology) or equivalent experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of professional experience in project management or a related field.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Microsoft Office Suite (Word, Excel, PowerPoint).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage complex tasks with precision, leveraging strong organizational, time management, and problem-solving skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicates effectively across all levels, translating complex information into clear, audience-appropriate messaging.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Successfully leads projects with minimal oversight, demonstrating initiative while appropriately escalating issues when needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Builds credibility and influence through transparent communication, collaborative engagement, and consistent follow-through.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively supports organizational change by identifying opportunities for improvement and constructively challenging existing processes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Desired:&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salesforce experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;nCino experience (as an end user or nCino implementation) &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PMP/PMI certification preferred&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position may require travel&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous project management experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in multiple lines of business in banking&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with agile software delivery practices and concepts&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The pay range for this role is based on relative market data and alignment with our compensation philosophy. The range displayed reflects the minimum and maximum of the pay range for each job posting, which is used to determine new hire rates/salaries and takes into consideration multiple factors including but not limited to knowledge, skills, abilities, proficiencies, experience, education, &lt;span class=&quot;WGI1&quot;&gt;licensures/certifications,&lt;/span&gt; as well as business and organizational needs. nCino reserves the right to modify the posted range consistent with our internal practices and external market movement. The recruiter for this job posting can share more compensation details during the recruitment process, as base salary is only one component of the total compensation package per position posted.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The base salary range for this job is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£63,200&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£107,400 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;nCino provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, protected veteran status, disability, genetics or other protected groups. In addition to federal law requirements, nCino complies with applicable state and local laws governing nondiscrimination in employment in every location in which the company has facilities. This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, placement, promotion, termination, layoff, recall, transfer, leaves of absence, compensation and training.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;nCino is committed to the full inclusion of all qualified individuals. As part of this commitment, nCino will ensure that persons with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodations. If reasonable accommodation is needed to participate in the job application or interview process, to perform essential job functions, and/or to receive other benefits and privileges of employment, please contact us at &lt;a ----- -----
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to inclusion and equality includes a strong belief that the diversity of our team is instrumental to our success.&amp;nbsp; We strive to create workplaces where employees are empowered to bring their authentic selves to work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.ncino.com/ncino-applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;Please view our Applicant Privacy Policy here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role in Our Story:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;As a Senior Recruiter at ACT, you will attract and hire commercial talent, primarily -and not alone- for our Front Office teams. You will manage the recruitment process from intake to offer, working closely with hiring managers to understand their business, challenge requirements and turn hiring needs into effective recruitment strategies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You understand our markets and what motivates people working in environmental commodities, energy and trading. You use this knowledge to identify talent, build relationships and give practical advice on how to attract the right candidates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;3 3 []&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the full recruitment cycle, primarily for Front Office positions, including sales, trading and business development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with hiring managers to define role requirements, agree on selection criteria and keep recruitment moving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proactively source and engage candidates, building talent pipelines for current and future hiring needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bring market knowledge into hiring discussions, advising on talent availability, competitor activity and candidate expectations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conduct thorough interviews and support objective, consistent hiring decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliver a positive candidate experience through clear communication, timely feedback and careful follow-up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Keep Greenhouse accurate and up to date, using recruitment data to identify bottlenecks and improve results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work closely with fellow recruiters, HR and Employer Branding, sharing knowledge and contributing to team priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To be successful in this role, we are looking for candidates with the following qualifications and attributes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3–5 years of recruitment experience, with a strong track record of hiring for commercial or Front Office positions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Knowledge of environmental commodities, energy, trading or closely related financial and commodity markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong sourcing skills and experience engaging passive candidates in competitive international markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Confidence working with hiring managers, offering practical advice and respectfully challenging assumptions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An eager, proactive approach: you take initiative, spot opportunities and follow through.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A collaborative mindset: you share insights, support colleagues and take responsibility for team results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong organisational skills, with the ability to manage several vacancies and changing priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience using an ATS, preferably Greenhouse, and an interest in applying recruitment technology and AI effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent communication skills in English and the ability to connect with people across different cultures and backgrounds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you meet these criteria and are ready to contribute your expertise to a dynamic and challenging environment, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;As a Forward Deployed Engineer at Auterion, you will play a pivotal role in the successful development, integration and deployment of Auterion-powered drone systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will collaborate closely with the production, hardware engineering, and firmware/software teams, as well as operations, ensuring that every platform transitions smoothly from an airframe concept into a fully validated flying robot ready for deployment. You will serve as the primary technical interface for partners, work closely with them to understand their technical requirements, configure and adapt existing solutions, contribute to core software development, and ensure successful implementation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for an engineer who enjoys combining hands-on technical work with customer collaboration and system-level problem solving, bridging the gap between hardware, firmware, and real-world flight performance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate in a highly hands-on environment with evolving system requirements, rapidly iterating across hardware and software integration challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage software releases and perform firmware flashing and configuration using PX4 or adjacent autopilot ecosystems, including sensor calibration, ESC tuning, and system bring-up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide deep avionics and airframe expertise, including autopilot tuning, sensor and payload integration, power systems and airworthiness considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work independently to troubleshoot integration and flight-readiness issues while collaborating cross-functionally with hardware engineering, firmware/software teams, operations, and QC engineering to escalate complex challenges when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary technical authority in customer engagements, translating mission requirements into concrete system architectures and demonstrable solutions built on AuterionOS and Skynode.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in flight testing activities to validate platform stability, safety, and mission performance, resolving technical issues often directly in the field during customer trials and demonstrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to technical documentation and continuous improvement of engineering processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed customer and market requirements back into product and engineering teams to influence the roadmap of the Auterion stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Software, Electrical, Mechanical, Aerospace or Robotics Engineering, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working proficiency in C/C++ and Python: you can read, debug and patch existing code and write small tools and scripts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable in Linux environments, including the command line, logs, Docker and basic networking (IP, TCP/UDP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on hardware-software integration: system bring-up, wiring and connectors, and embedded interfaces (UART, CAN, I2C, SPI) at a practical level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured troubleshooting: you can isolate whether a problem is software, hardware, configuration or RF, often under time pressure in the field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communicator: you can explain technical issues clearly to customers and operators, and report findings back to engineering in a way they can act on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to travel and work on-site with customers, including at test ranges and in field environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EU citizenship (required for security clearance and customer requirements)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with PX4 or ArduPilot, MAVLink, QGroundControl or mission planning tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UAV flight testing and validation in operational environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with datalinks and radio systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous customer-facing or field engineering role, especially with defense or government customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;German language skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extended social security package&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Engineer I - Controls Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ASM | Simulation &amp;amp; Modeling Hub | Almere, Netherlands&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design, tune and validate control systems for ASM semiconductor process tools, with an emphasis on precision temperature control. Work with experienced controls engineers and equipment and process teams to translate process requirements into control strategies, then verify their performance on physical tools. The role combines dynamic modeling, controller development and hands-on testing, with opportunities to take ownership of control functions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate process and equipment needs into measurable control requirements for temperature accuracy, stability, uniformity, repeatability and response during recipe changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and tune feedback and feedforward control strategies for heating and cooling systems. Address interactions between zones and account for sensor and actuator limits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and run tests on laboratory and production-representative equipment. Analyze sensor and actuator data, use system identification to develop or calibrate dynamic models, and compare predictions with measured responses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with software, equipment and process engineers to integrate control logic, troubleshoot performance on the tool, and support commissioning and validation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document control logic, test procedures, tuning parameters and validation results so other engineers can reproduce tests and maintain the controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in controls, electrical, mechanical or mechatronics engineering, applied physics, or related discipline, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience designing, testing or tuning closed-loop controls on physical equipment. Relevant industry, laboratory or applied research projects are welcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working proficiency in MATLAB/Simulink or an equivalent environment for dynamic modeling, data analysis and control design. Familiarity with system identification and instrumentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to troubleshoot equipment methodically and communicate results to colleagues across engineering disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Precision temperature control, heat transfer or thermal instrumentation in semiconductor equipment or other precision industrial systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with multizone or cascade control, model-based control, sensor calibration or equipment commissioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Simcenter Amesim or other tools for modeling system dynamics and validating control strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today to be part of what’s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make the tech that enables the chips in devices which improve lives around the world. We do this with an eye to the future, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible through cutting-edge innovation, and driving the next wave of technological breakthroughs that shape how we live, work, and connect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;To learn more about ASM, find us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.asm.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;asm.com&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/asm/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/ASMOfficialCompany&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/asmofficialcompany/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/ASMofficialco&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/c/ASM_Official&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;ASM is an equal opportunity employer and considers qualified applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, age, nationality, social or ethnic origin, sexual orientation, gender, gender identify or expression, marital status, pregnancy, political affiliation, disability, genetic information, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job&#39;s mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking innovative, motivated recent graduates to join our team as Mechanical Engineers. In this role, you will contribute to new product development, sustainment, and engineering design projects. We are looking for someone who enjoys solving challenging problems, is thorough and detail-oriented, and uses experimentation and model-based analysis to identify root causes. You will collaborate effectively with cross-disciplinary teams to solve complex engineering problems and drive new technological advancements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be working on&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design mechanical systems and products supporting ASM process chambers using sound engineering principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interpret and design to gas, water and pneumatic schematics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and manage 3D CAD models (Creo) and 2D drawings with GD&amp;amp;T&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform engineering analysis including structural, thermal, and fluid dynamics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead hardware development from concept through testing and HVM readiness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in design reviews and drive DFx activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with suppliers to resolve fabrication challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare clear, complete engineering documentation to support prototype builds, manufacturing, and testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support cost estimation for new features and enhancements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain product configuration using modern PLM tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Requirements:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master’s degree in mechanical engineering or higher&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;0-3 years of experience in mechanical design using 3D CAD (Creo preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of vacuum and thermal systems, gas/fluid delivery, wafer handling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of materials: QTZ; SiC; metals, surface&amp;nbsp;coatings&amp;nbsp;and surface finishes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of GD&amp;amp;T and engineering drawing standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cleanroom experience of deposition technologies (CVD, ALD, EPI, PVD), hand-on assembly and testing experiences are strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today to be part of what’s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make the tech that enables the chips in devices which improve lives around the world. We do this with an eye to the future, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible through cutting-edge innovation, and driving the next wave of technological breakthroughs that shape how we live, work, and connect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;To learn more about ASM, find us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.asm.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;asm.com&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/asm/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/ASMOfficialCompany&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/asmofficialcompany/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/ASMofficialco&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/c/ASM_Official&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;ASM is an equal opportunity employer and considers qualified applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, age, nationality, social or ethnic origin, sexual orientation, gender, gender identify or expression, marital status, pregnancy, political affiliation, disability, genetic information, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job&#39;s mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking innovative, motivated recent graduates to join our team as Mechanical Engineers. In this role, you will contribute to new product development, sustainment, and engineering design projects. We are looking for someone who enjoys solving challenging problems, is thorough and detail-oriented, and uses experimentation and model-based analysis to identify root causes. You will collaborate effectively with cross-disciplinary teams to solve complex engineering problems and drive new technological advancements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be working on&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design mechanical systems and products supporting ASM process chambers using sound engineering principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interpret and design to gas, water and pneumatic schematics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and manage 3D CAD models (Creo) and 2D drawings with GD&amp;amp;T&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform engineering analysis including structural, thermal, and fluid dynamics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead hardware development from concept through testing and HVM readiness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive data-based design decisions in a cross-functional team environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in design reviews and drive DFx activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with suppliers to resolve fabrication challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare clear, complete engineering documentation to support prototype builds, manufacturing, and testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support cost estimation for new features and enhancements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain product configuration using modern PLM tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Requirements:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master’s degree in mechanical engineering or higher&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in mechanical design using 3D CAD (Creo preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in semiconductor or capital equipment industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of vacuum and thermal systems, gas/fluid delivery, wafer handling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of materials: QTZ; SiC; metals, surface&amp;nbsp;coatings&amp;nbsp;and surface finishes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of GD&amp;amp;T and engineering drawing standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with SEMI standards (e.g., S2)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cleanroom experience of deposition technologies (CVD, ALD, EPI, PVD), hand-on assembly and testing experiences are strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today to be part of what’s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make the tech that enables the chips in devices which improve lives around the world. We do this with an eye to the future, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible through cutting-edge innovation, and driving the next wave of technological breakthroughs that shape how we live, work, and connect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;To learn more about ASM, find us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.asm.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;asm.com&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/asm/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/ASMOfficialCompany&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/asmofficialcompany/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/ASMofficialco&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/c/ASM_Official&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;ASM is an equal opportunity employer and considers qualified applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, age, nationality, social or ethnic origin, sexual orientation, gender, gender identify or expression, marital status, pregnancy, political affiliation, disability, genetic information, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Mavericks Wanted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;When was the last time you achieved the impossible? If that thought feels overwhelming, you might want to pause here, but if it sparks excitement...read on&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;In 2015, we pioneered a “moneyball for biotech” approach, pooling projects and promising early-stage research from academia together under one financial umbrella to reduce risk and unleash innovation. This model allows science and small teams of experts to lead the way. We build bridges to groundbreaking advancements in rare&amp;nbsp;disease, and&amp;nbsp;develop life-changing medicines for patients with unmet needs as fast as humanly possible. &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Together we define white space, push boundaries, and empower people to solve problems. If you&#39;re someone who defies convention, join us and work alongside some of the most respected minds in the industry. Together, we&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;ask&amp;nbsp;&quot;why not?&quot; and help reengineer the future of biopharma. At BridgeBio, we value curiosity and experimentation—including the ethical &amp;amp; thoughtful use of AI to improve clarity, speed, and quality of work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Sr Director, Head of Quality &amp;amp; Responsible Person, International, leads quality for infigratinib, and will be the designated Responsible Person on the entity&#39;s wholesale distribution authorisation. The role reports to the Head of Quality, QED, with a dotted line to local managing director, and is based in the Netherlands. If the entity becomes the marketing authorisation holder for infigratinib, the role also covers the related MAH quality duties. The role holds an unrestricted right of escalation to the entity&#39;s full board and is independent of commercial operations and of manufacturing/supply with EU-GDP guidelines, relevant EU directives (including the Falsified Medicines Directive), Dutch Medicines Act, and public service requirements. This role acts as a QA liaison of BridgeBio&#39;s contract service providers (CSPs), providing oversight of lot release activities. This role includes reviewing and approving batch records, certificates of analysis, and compliance documents, providing quality review of deviations, change controls, and CAPAs related to assigned CSPs, collaborating closely with CSPs and internal teams such as quality control, manufacturing, regulatory affairs, and supply chain. The role builds and leads a small quality team (deputy RP, QA compliance/QMS, QA operations/GDP), owns the quality management system across the Skeletal Dysplasia assets, and leads WDA licensing, inspection readiness and potentially subsequent MIA readiness, if needed in the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Major Responsibilities / Accountabilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the named Responsible Person on the WDA: release for distribution, recall decisions, and GDP compliance of the entity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leads and develops the entity&#39;s quality team: deputy RP, QA compliance/QMS, and QA operations/GDP; and QP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manages and improves the Quality Management System (QMS) across the entity&#39;s assets in alignment with the established QMS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the WDA application and IGJ inspection readiness; prepare subsequent MIA readiness (QP recruitment, import and batch-certification processes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the quality agreement matrix: includes Quality oversight of contract service providers, 3PLs, distributors and intercompany interfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a Quality liaison and provide oversight and quality support of assigned contract service providers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform quality review of assigned quality events such as deviations, change controls, supplier notifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review master manufacturing batch records, including related documents such as specifications, analytical and microbiological methods, stability study protocols, and label proofs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage lot release activities and communication of lot release schedules to key stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate manufacturing deficiencies/non-conformances to management and work with CSPs to ensure timely resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review process and method validation protocols and reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review analytical test results to ensure compliance with approved specifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in updating CMC sections of regulatory and quality documents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in internal and external project team meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Other QA/Responsible Person related responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure accuracy of quality of records per GDP requirements including GDPs are implemented and maintained in the quality management system requirements for WDA license&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and coordinate return, rejected, falsified products, recall operations of medicinal products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide oversight of GDP and GMP activities of active pharmaceutical ingredients (API)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure WDA and API registration is current with commercial supply chain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate and leads EU/ROW regulatory inspections&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate and oversee GMP vendor qualification program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the EU/ROW internal audit program, internal training program and ensure data integrity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and review governing procedures as needed (e.g., SOPs, WIs, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Where You’ll Work&amp;nbsp; &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is a Netherlands based remote role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel 30% of time is expected&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Who you are&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS/MS degree preferably in operations, science, pharmacy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A diploma, certificate, or other evidence of formal qualifications on completion of GDP/GDP-API training required for registration as an RP by the competent authorities in the Netherlands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in pharmaceutical quality, including significant GDP / distribution quality experience; prior appointment as (or eligibility to be) a Responsible Person strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading regulatory inspections with EU competent authorities (IGJ preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience of managing third party vendors (CMOs, CTLs, 3PLs, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior relevant knowledge and experience related to the distribution of medical products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of supply chain concepts, supplier management, inventory management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive knowledge of US/EU GMPs /GDPs and associated guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working in a highly regulated environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven leadership of quality teams; experience building quality functions or systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding the EU and particularly IGJ regulations in relation to the wholesale distribution of medicines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong planning and time management skills with ability to prioritize workload&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical and problem-solving skills, with keen attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in document and presentation office tools (Microsoft Office, Google Docs, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of data concepts and enterprise resource planning (ERP) systems e.g., SAP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ready to embrace company core values and diverse corporate culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Rewarding Those Who Make the Mission Possible&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have high expectations for our team members. We make sure those working hard for patients are rewarded and cared for in return.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market leading compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work model - we value your flexibility in how you work, but encourage time in the office to strengthen our culture, collaboration, and sense of community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We provide career development through regular feedback, continuous education and professional development programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We celebrate strong performance with financial rewards, peer-to-peer recognition, and growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a global company, our comprehensive benefits may vary based on location.&amp;nbsp; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We have high expectations for our team members. We make sure those working hard for patients are rewarded and cared for in return.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
