&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About THG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are THG, a global ecommerce group on a mission to be the global online leader in beauty and sports nutrition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our portfolio of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; leading retailers and brands such as LOOKFANTASTIC, Myprotein, ESPA, Perricone MD, and Cult Beauty form our two core businesses: THG Beauty and THG Nutrition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;From Manchester to New York, we’re powered by a team of over 2500 people who work together, lead by example, and think BIG.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;With us, you’ll go further, faster. What are you waiting for?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Role: Senior Trading Manager&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brand: Myprotein&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting to: Ecommerce Director&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: THG ICON 1, 7-9 Sunbank Lane, WA15 0AF (Fully Office Based)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;As Senior Trading Manager for the UK, you will own the commercial performance of Myprotein&#39;s UK website, driving profitable growth through effective ecommerce trading, customer experience and onsite optimisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will set the UK ecommerce strategy, translating commercial objectives and customer insight into clear trading priorities. Combining strong commercial judgement with data-led decision-making, you will identify opportunities, drive performance and lead cross-functional teams to deliver growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The Details&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own UK website performance across revenue, traffic, conversion, AOV, margin and profitability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and deliver the UK ecommerce trading strategy, translating business targets into clear priorities and action plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive onsite trading and optimisation across merchandising, navigation, search, landing pages and promotional activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage pricing and promotional investment, balancing revenue growth, margin and customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead forecasting and performance reviews, identifying risks, opportunities and actions to maximise trading performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use customer insight, competitor activity and market trends to inform commercial decisions and identify growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Marketing, CRM, Brand, Product, UX, Technology, Supply Chain and Finance to deliver the UK growth agenda.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive improvements across the customer journey, increasing conversion, basket size, retention and customer lifetime value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead testing and optimisation initiatives, using clear hypotheses and measurable commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion AI, automation and analytics to improve decision-making, efficiency and trading effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence senior stakeholders and hold cross-functional teams accountable for delivering commercial priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience in ecommerce, digital trading or online retail, ideally within a fast-paced DTC or consumer business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of owning website performance and delivering profitable commercial growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of ecommerce trading metrics, including revenue, conversion, AOV, margin and customer lifetime value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and executing trading strategies and onsite optimisation plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial judgement, with the ability to balance growth, profitability and customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly analytical and data-driven, able to turn insight into clear commercial actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive and autonomous, with a strong bias for action and personal accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to influence senior stakeholders and lead cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in testing, optimisation and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident using BI and ecommerce analytics tools, with an interest in leveraging AI and automation to improve performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communicator, comfortable challenging thinking and driving decisions at pace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What’s in It for Me?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Career Development&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Access bespoke development programmes designed by our in-house Learning &amp;amp; Development team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop your expertise through our upskilling programme, delivered in partnership with an industry-leading training provider.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Enhanced Leave&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;25 days’ annual leave plus bank holidays.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enjoy your birthday off, on us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enhanced maternity and paternity pay, depending on length of service.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Up to 10 days’ compassionate leave.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Option to buy up to 3 additional days of annual leave each year.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unlock 2 days of volunteer leave after 12 months.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Wellbeing Support&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Access face-to-face and virtual appointments with our in-house GP.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Access our 24/7 Employee Assistance Programme, provided by Bupa.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;State-of-the-art on-site gym.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Access to our on-site physiotherapist.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Other Perks&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Save up to 12% on personal tech through our salary sacrifice scheme.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Subsidised bus pass from Manchester City Centre to our ICON office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Up to 50% staff discount on THG brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On-site staff shop and barber.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Refer someone to THG and receive up to £1,000 when they pass their probation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anniversary gifts when you reach 5 and 10 years of service.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunities employer and welcome applications from people of all backgrounds.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG is proud to be a Disability Confident Committed employer. If you are invited to interview, please let us know if there are any reasonable adjustments we can make to the recruitment process that will enable you to perform to the best of your ability.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG is committed to creating a diverse &amp;amp; inclusive environment and hence welcomes applications from all sections of the community.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Because of the high volumes of applications our opportunities attract, it sometimes takes us time to review and consider them all. We endeavour to respond to every application we receive within 14 days. If you haven&#39;t heard from us within that time frame or should you have any specific questions about this or other applications for positions at THG please contact one of our &lt;span class=&quot;mark75xs2u5gf&quot; data-markjs=&quot;true&quot; data-ogac=&quot;&quot; data-ogab=&quot;&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsb=&quot;&quot;&gt;Talent&lt;/span&gt; team to discuss further.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About THG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are THG, a global ecommerce group on a mission to be the global online leader in beauty and sports nutrition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our portfolio of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; leading retailers and brands such as LOOKFANTASTIC, Myprotein, ESPA, Perricone MD, and Cult Beauty form our two core businesses: THG Beauty and THG Nutrition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;From Manchester to New York, we’re powered by a team of over 2500 people who work together, lead by example, and think BIG.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;With us, you’ll go further, faster. What are you waiting for?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role: Senior Events Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brand / Area: Myprotein&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting to: Head of Social Media&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: THG ICON 1, 7-9 Sunbank Lane, WA15 0AF (Fully Office Based)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at THG Nutrition&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;353&quot; data-end=&quot;578&quot;&gt;THG Nutrition is home to some of the world’s most trusted and best-loved wellbeing and nutrition brands, including Myprotein, the world’s largest online sports nutrition brand, alongside Myvegan, Myvitamins and MP Activewear.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;580&quot; data-end=&quot;776&quot;&gt;Our brands and people exist to break boundaries — to power and empower those who want more. We move fast, challenge convention, and back ourselves to win. These values shape how we work every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;580&quot; data-end=&quot;776&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;580&quot; data-end=&quot;776&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking to hire a Senior Events Manager to join our Brand Marketing team at Myprotein, the world’s largest online sports nutrition brand. In this senior role, you’ll take ownership of our end-to-end events strategy – leading a dynamic events calendar from concept through delivery, managing and developing a team of event professionals, and setting the standard for high-impact, brand-defining activations. With a strong focus on B2B and influencer-led events, you’ll build and maintain relationships with senior industry partners, stakeholders, and clients, shaping how the brand shows up at every touchpoint. You’ll partner closely with senior leadership, internal teams, and external partners to translate business objectives into bold event concepts delivered at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Events and Activations strategy &amp;amp; calendar ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team leadership, coaching &amp;amp; development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Budget ownership per activation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior stakeholder &amp;amp; leadership engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supplier &amp;amp; vendor negotiation at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B2B &amp;amp; flagship event execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On-site event leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Speaker, talent &amp;amp; influencer partnerships (in collaboration with the influencer team)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brand direction for event materials &amp;amp; creative&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-market event roll-out&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Logistics, scheduling &amp;amp; risk management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Permits, compliance &amp;amp; health and safety&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Post-event reporting, ROI analysis &amp;amp; insight sharing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For your Skills, Knowledge and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Events Manager who leads from the front – someone who thrives under pressure, is energised by a fast-paced environment, and brings both strategic thinking and hands-on delivery to everything they do. You’ll have a sharp eye for industry trends, a track record of developing others, and the confidence to represent the brand in front of senior stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience: 5 years of event management experience, including experience operating at a senior or leadership level, ideally within a brand marketing, retail, or corporate environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brand Events: Proven track record delivering large-scale, influencer-focused and PR-driven events (e.g. global brand launches, PR previews, creator activations) end-to-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project Management: Proven ability to manage multiple complex, high-profile events simultaneously, from concept to execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stakeholder Management: Confident operating with senior stakeholders, internal teams, external partners, and vendors, including at exec level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Budgeting &amp;amp; Negotiation: Extensive experience owning event budgets, negotiating high-value contracts, and securing cost-effective, high-quality solutions. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team Leadership: Proven experience leading, developing, and mentoring an events team, delegating effectively and overseeing event staff or external agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Planning: Experience shaping and owning an events strategy that ties directly to broader marketing and business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Crisis &amp;amp; Risk Management: Comfortable managing risk, compliance, and on-the-day issues under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;580&quot; data-end=&quot;776&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What’s in it for me?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
