&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1338&quot; data-end=&quot;1453&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-start=&quot;1338&quot; data-end=&quot;1453&quot;&gt;(Portfolio will be aligned to Cato’s strategic priorities and managed in collaboration with alliance leadership.)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
