&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;En tant qu’AI Builder Manager, vous pilotez des missions et programmes AI Adoption qui font passer l’IA de l’expérimentation à la transformation des métiers. Au contact des dirigeants et des responsables métiers, vous définissez des dispositifs de montée en compétences, de construction d’agents et d’accompagnement au changement. Vous êtes le moteur de nos missions : vous en garantissez la qualité, l’impact et la rentabilité, faites grandir vos équipes et développez vos comptes aux côtés des Directeurs et Partners.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vous partez des défis des utilisateurs métiers, de leurs processus et de leurs irritants pour transformer les possibilités de l’IA en résultats tangibles. Vous restez un maker : vous ne vous arrêtez pas au slide. Vous concevez des expériences d’apprentissage engageantes, challengez et construisez des solutions IA fonctionnelles (no-code, low-code, vibe coding), et mobilisez les équipes pour faire passer ces solutions du prototype à des usages durables.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vous accompagnez les organisations dans la transformation des tâches, des rôles et responsabilités, et des compétences à l’ère de l’IA. Vous articulez les initiatives de terrain (bottom-up) avec les programmes de transformation à grande échelle (top-down), en collaboration avec nos équipes AI Strategy et Engineering. Votre ambition : faire de l’IA un levier de transformation du travail, avec un impact concret, mesurable et durable sur les équipes et leur performance.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Activités &amp;amp; Responsabilités&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;I. Analyse &amp;amp; Cadrage&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Conduire le cadrage avec L&amp;amp;D, RH, sponsors et métiers: définir populations cibles, priorités, objectifs observables et parcours différenciés.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Concevoir une stratégie de démultiplication combinant sessions, contenus digitaux, coaching, champions et transfert aux équipes internes.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Piloter un portefeuille de cas d&#39;usage opérationnels: valeur, faisabilité, risque, capacité de build et séquencement des sprints.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Organiser les ateliers de discovery et faire arbitrer les points de dépendance, d&#39;accès ou de gouvernance par les interlocuteurs habilités.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;II. Développement &amp;amp; Déploiement des Solutions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Piloter budget, planning, staffing, qualité pédagogique et satisfaction ; réaliser les arbitrages nécessaires et faire grandir les équipes.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Superviser les assets pédagogiques, animer les sessions à forte visibilité et garantir l&#39;alignement entre exercices, capacités des plateformes et besoins métier.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Superviser les solutions low-code/no-code, les standards, les jeux de tests, la documentation et les quality gates adaptés au périmètre technique et aux standards de la practice.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Concevoir avec les Analytics Engineers l’architecture de reporting d’un programme, définir les standards de visualisation et de KPIs, coacher les équipes en data storytelling, superviser leurs dashboards et en piloter l’adoption.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;III. Adoption &amp;amp; Animation de Communauté&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Coordonner la mise en usage, la formation des utilisateurs et le handover client: relais managériaux, communautés, rituels et office hours.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Piloter les boucles de feedback, les indicateurs de valeur et, si désigné, le plan de change sur une mission ciblée.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IV. Structuration&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;et Pilotage de la démarche Change&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Définir des indicateurs de compétences, d&#39;autonomie et d&#39;usage; restituer les résultats aux sponsors et ajuster la démarche.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Contribuer aux avant-ventes, estimations, chiffrages et propositions, en identifiant les extensions pertinentes chez les clients.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Qualifier la nécessité d’un co-delivery avec Solutions Engineering ou la DSI, sans empiéter sur leurs autorités techniques.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil recherché&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vous vous reconnaissez si…&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; vous aimez piloter des missions exigeantes de bout en bout, faire grandir une équipe et gagner la confiance de dirigeants, et si vous préférez mettre une démo entre leurs mains plutôt que leur décrire une vision&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;5 à 8 ans d’expérience en conseil, transformation digitale, data / IA ou conduite du changement, avec une formation supérieure de niveau licence ou master issue d’un cursus académique d’excellence.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Une expérience confirmée de pilotage de missions complexes et de management d’équipes, avec une responsabilité sur la qualité des livrables, les délais, les budgets et la satisfaction client.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Une solide maîtrise des usages de l’IA générative et agentique, et un état d’esprit de maker : capacité à concevoir, challenger et faire évoluer des agents et solutions IA fonctionnelles (no-code, low-code, vibe coding), et à guider les équipes dans leur construction.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Une expérience dans la conception et le pilotage de dispositifs de montée en compétences et de programmes d’adoption de l’IA, ainsi que dans la transformation des processus, des rôles et des pratiques de travail.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Une aisance dans la relation avec des interlocuteurs de haut niveau, la capacité à fédérer les parties prenantes, faire grandir les consultants et contribuer au développement commercial.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Une maîtrise parfaite du français et de l’anglais (oral et écrit).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;À propos d’Artefact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Artefact est un cabinet de conseil spécialisé en data et en intelligence artificielle, qui accompagne les entreprises pour transformer ces technologies en impact business concret et mesurable. À la croisée du conseil, de la data et de la technologie, nos 2 500 collaborateurs dans 27 pays mettent leurs expertises en commun pour concevoir, développer et déployer des solutions qui répondent aux enjeux de transformation de nos clients.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Notre accompagnement s&#39;étend sur l&#39;intégralité de la chaîne de valeur : &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Strategize AI&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; (cadrage stratégique, opportunités à fort impact, trajectoires, modèles opérationnels), &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Deploy AI&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; (ingénierie, industrialisation, architectures agentiques, produits data) et &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Adopt AI &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;(conduite du changement, acculturation, usage quotidien de l&#39;IA).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Envie d&#39;en savoir plus ? Découvrez Artefact, nos expertises et notre culture : &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.artefact.com&quot;&gt;https://www.artefact.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pourquoi nous rejoindre?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;De la stratégie à la réalisation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ne pas s’arrêter aux recommandations : participer à la conception et à la concrétisation de solutions IA répondant à de véritables enjeux métiers.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Une collaboration entre expertises&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Occuper un rôle à la croisée de l&#39;humain (AI Adoption), de la stratégie (AI Strategy), de la technologie (AI Engineering).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Piloter ce qui compte&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Des missions de transformation IA de bout en bout, au cœur des enjeux des grands groupes, avec une vraie autonomie, une équipe à faire grandir et des comptes à développer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Une trajectoire qui accélère&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Un parcours clair vers Senior Manager puis Directeur, dans un environnement d’apprentissage continu axé sur la transmission des connaissances et le pragmatisme technologique.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Processus de recrutement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un &lt;strong&gt;entretien de fit RH &lt;/strong&gt;(30 / 45’) avec les RH / Talent Acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un &lt;strong&gt;entretien de fit expert &lt;/strong&gt;(60’) avec un AI Builder Senior ou Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une &lt;strong&gt;présentation d’un cas réel &lt;/strong&gt;(60’) sur lequel le candidat a travaillé par le passé avec un AI Builder Director&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un &lt;strong&gt;role play AI Adoption Manager&lt;/strong&gt; (45 / 60’) avec AI Builder Director ou un AI Builder Partner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;entretien de fit final &lt;/strong&gt;(30’) avec un AI Builder Partner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rémunération : &lt;/strong&gt;66 000€ à 75 000€ brut annuel (fixe) + 10 000€ de variable, selon expérience et séniorité&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Artefact, nous sommes convaincus que la diversité des parcours, des expériences et des perspectives fait la richesse de nos équipes. Nous nous engageons à offrir un environnement inclusif et des opportunités équitables, où chacune et chacun peut évoluer et exprimer pleinement son potentiel. Nos recrutements reposent sur les compétences, le potentiel et l&#39;adéquation avec le rôle.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who is Artefact?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm that transforms organizations through data and AI. With 1,800+ consultants, data scientists, and engineers across 23 countries, we work with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange, and Sanofi. From our Lausanne and Zurich offices, we help leading Swiss and international companies turn data and AI into measurable results, working with the leading data platforms, including Databricks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Main Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will design and deliver the data platforms our clients run their business and their AI on, combining hands-on engineering with client advisory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build modern data platforms:&lt;/strong&gt; End-to-end lakehouse architectures, mainly on Databricks, built for reliability, observability, and cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineer pipelines:&lt;/strong&gt; Batch and streaming pipelines with Python, Spark, and SQL, with data quality built in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Migrate and modernize:&lt;/strong&gt; Move legacy warehouses and ETL to the cloud, from assessment to cut-over.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make data ready for AI:&lt;/strong&gt; Governed data products and semantic layers that analytics and AI agents can rely on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run it properly:&lt;/strong&gt; Data governance, CI/CD, infrastructure as code, monitoring, and cost control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advise and support:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate business needs into roadmaps, coach junior engineers, and support proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Engineer first, consultant second, with a track record of shipping to production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in data engineering, including hands-on Databricks experience in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert Python and SQL, with strong Spark and data modeling skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Databricks Data Engineer Professional certification, or a commitment to obtain it within 6 months (we support you).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience on Azure, AWS, or GCP, plus DataOps (Git, CI/CD, Terraform, testing).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong consulting skills: requirements gathering, documentation, stakeholder management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English plus French or German (both is a plus); eligible to work in Switzerland.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with other data platforms (Snowflake, Microsoft Fabric, BigQuery), dbt, MLOps, and industry experience (consumer goods, pharma, logistics, insurance, manufacturing).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy with a Data Edge:&lt;/strong&gt; Build the platforms behind boardroom priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Swiss Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; High visibility from day one on flagship programs, working directly with senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Tech Ecosystem:&lt;/strong&gt; Certified peers across Artefact and close partnerships with leading data and cloud platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth and Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Certifications, training, international missions, and a team of doers who move fast and support each other.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you don’t meet 100% of the criteria, we still want to hear from you. Tell us about your passion, curiosity, and impact.&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Switzerland on Arbeitnow

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Proton and build a better internet where privacy is the default&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Proton, we believe that privacy is a fundamental human right and the cornerstone of democracy. Since our inception in 2014, founded by a team of scientists from CERN, we have dedicated ourselves to providing free and open-source technology to millions worldwide, ensuring access to privacy, security, and freedom online.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our journey began with Proton Mail, the largest secure email service globally, and has since expanded to include Proton VPN, Proton Calendar, Proton Drive, and Proton Pass. These tools empower individuals and organizations to take control of their personal data, break away from Big Tech’s invasive practices, and defeat censorship. Our work impacts hundreds of millions of lives, from activists on the front lines defending freedom to leaders in governments protecting sensitive information. In some cases, Proton’s services have even been instrumental in saving lives by enabling secure and private communications in high-risk situations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proton today supports over 100 million user accounts with a growing team of over 500 people from over 50 different countries, from the world&#39;s top companies and universities. We value intelligence, learning potential, and ambition in our hiring process. Adaptability is key as we navigate uncharted territories and redefine how business is conducted online. We believe smaller teams of exceptional talent will always prevail over larger teams with lower talent density. Proton has become profitable and reached scale without relying upon VC funding, largely due to superior talent that allows us to do things faster, more creatively, and more efficiently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a global mindset and big ambitions but remain a start-up at heart. We value empowerment and flexibility and keep our structure flat to keep moving fast and avoid unnecessary politics. Tired of blending into the crowd? Join us and do work you can truly be proud of.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXP96911575 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXP96911575 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot; data-ref=&quot;df41d9b1-a4e5-469e-b94c-9c31cb38a786&quot;&gt;Check our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;social media pages&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to learn more about us:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://x.com/ProtonPrivacy&quot;&gt;Twitter&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.reddit.com/r/ProtonMail/&quot;&gt;Reddit&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/protonprivacy/&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;We are looking for an Account Executive to drive new B2B business for Proton in Switzerland. You will own the full sales cycle, from identifying and qualifying opportunities to negotiating and closing deals. You will build relationships with senior decision-makers, develop strategic partnerships across the Swiss business and public-sector ecosystems, and help grow Proton&#39;s presence in its home market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline Creation &amp;amp; Strategic Opportunity Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Identify and develop new strategic opportunities across target segments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Build and manage your own pipeline of high-quality opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Balance long-term opportunity creation with closing deals&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Identify, engage, and develop partnerships with corporates, industry bodies, service providers and ecosystem partners (including co-selling opportunities)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Development (Switzerland Focus)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Leverage your existing network within Swiss corporates and organizations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Expand Proton&#39;s presence within local business and public-sector ecosystems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Identify high-value entry points into target companies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relationship Building&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Build strong relationships with senior stakeholders (IT, security, leadership)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Act as a trusted advisor and entry point into organizations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Navigate complex organizational structures to identify opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Sales Cycle Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Own the full sales cycle, from first contact to signed contract&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Identify and qualify opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Run discovery to understand use case, stakeholders and potential deal scope&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Negotiate and close deals&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Work closely with Sales leadership to align on target segments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Provide feedback on market opportunities and ICP evolution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Share insights from partnerships and market interactions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• 3–7 years in Account Executive, Business Development or Strategic Sales roles, owning the full sales cycle&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Proven experience selling in the Swiss market (required)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Experience in B2B SaaS or technology environments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Proven track record of generating pipeline and closing deals&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Network&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Strong existing network within Swiss companies and/or public-sector ecosystems (highly preferred)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Appetite to develop and grow a network of Swiss customers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Strong relationship-building and networking capabilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Ability to identify and develop strategic opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Strong negotiation and closing skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Strong communication and stakeholder management skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Comfortable operating without a structured playbook&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Fluent in Swiss German and English &lt;strong&gt;(required)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• French is a strong plus&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Hunter mindset focused on opportunity creation and closing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Strategic thinker with strong commercial instincts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Proactive, self-driven, and comfortable operating in ambiguity&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Long-term relationship builder&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Geneva, Zurich or remotely within Switzerland.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We provide all the devices and software you need to excel in your role, ensuring you have the best tools at your disposal to achieve your goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Food:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Lunch and snacks are provided by Proton every day at our offices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transport:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;We will always support our employees with transport costs through subsidizing public transport, bike allowances, or parking spaces based on your office location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stock Options:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;At Proton, we are all owners of the company and you get stock options when you join us.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Working:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;You can define your own working hours as long as it works with team meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning and Development:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We are committed to your professional growth. Proton offers various learning opportunities, including training programs, conferences and events, and continual learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Comprehensive health insurance plans, competitive retirement savings options, generous vacation and leave policies, and wellness programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work that Matters:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Proton is a community-first organization, started with the support of a crowdfunding campaign and built with community input. To this day, Proton’s only source of revenue is user subscriptions. Over 100 million people trust and support Proton, and we put our users and community first in everything we do. Read more about our impact&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://proton.me/impact&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check our social media to learn more about Proton:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/protonprivacy/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;,&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.reddit.com/r/ProtonMail/&quot;&gt;Reddit&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;,&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://x.com/intent/user?screen_name=ProtonPrivacy&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@ProtonAG&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Proton, we believe diversity drives innovation and strengthens our mission to provide privacy as a default for all. We are committed to fostering an inclusive environment where all individuals, regardless of race, ethnicity, gender, age, sexual orientation, physical ability, or socio-economic background, feel valued and empowered. We strive to create equal opportunities, promote open dialogue, and support continuous learning to ensure every voice is heard and respected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any extra support or reasonable adjustments during the hiring process, please let your talent partner know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you apply for a position, refer a candidate, or are considered for a role at Proton Technologies AG (Proton, we, us, or our), your information is stored in Greenhouse, in accordance with their&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.greenhouse.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Service Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;This information is used to evaluate your suitability for the posted position. We also retain this information for consideration for future roles that you may apply for or that we believe may align with your background and skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If we no longer have a legitimate business need to process your information, we will either delete or anonymize it. Should you have any inquiries about how we use or manage your information, or if you wish to access, correct, or delete your data, please contact our privacy team at -----
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Proton does not accept unsolicited resumes from any sources other than directly from candidates. We will not pay a fee for any placement resulting from an unsolicited offer, even if the candidate is subsequently hired by Proton.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;To learn more about our privacy policy, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://boards.eu.greenhouse.io/protongdpr&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;our privacy policy page&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LinkedIn-Onsite&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a hands-on Autonomous Drone Software Engineer to join a swarming programme. As an engineer on a lean, high-impact team, you will have the opportunity to drive development of new features, have a say in architecture and design decisions and have real impact across all the team’s projects.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will not be siloed; this role spans the entire autonomy lifecycle, from developing autonomy capabilities to investigating real-world flight-test data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is someone who’s a self-starter, can work independently, can work with ambiguity, can take decisions on their own and not be afraid to drive and push towards getting the project across the finish line.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership and drive the development of new features across the autonomy stack and partner integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with hardware engineers, product managers, and external partners to define system requirements and translate them into robust software architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement robust distributed state machines, leader election protocols, and fault-tolerant architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver clean, readable and maintainable code while confidently managing complex concurrency and contention scenarios&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and run rigorous tests utilizing SITL/HITL simulation environments to validate code prior to physical deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively participate in code reviews, architectural discussions, and technical documentation to elevate the team&#39;s engineering standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act decisively during flight-test investigations, applying strong engineering judgment to physical failure modes and release safety&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of professional engineering experience in robotics, embedded systems, or distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep proficiency in modern C++, with practical experience designing, reasoning about, and debugging highly concurrent systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embedded systems experience working close to hardware on real-time or safety-critical platforms (e.g., avionics, automotive, robotics).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong architectural understanding of distributed systems, with the ability to deliberately evaluate and select consensus designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with robust release management, versioned artifacts, and pinned dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with PX4, MAVLink, and related drone software ecosystems is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EU citizenship required&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Car parking&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and wellbeing support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Switzerland on Arbeitnow

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About CoLab&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At CoLab, we help mechanical engineering teams bring life-changing products to market years sooner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We build AI for engineers designing cars, medical devices, and jet engines. Products this complex aren&#39;t sketched and sent to production. Teams spend months on iterations, reviews, and tests, predicting how every part performs before anything is built. CoLab is where those reviews happen, and we capture the rationale behind every change. Other tools show what changed between versions. Only CoLab knows why. That&#39;s how our AI helps manufacturers like Bobcat, Triumph Motorcycles, and GE Appliances make better decisions, eliminate rework cycles, and get to market faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proudly based in St. John’s, Newfoundland, CoLab started with one customer in 2018. Since then we’ve raised a&lt;a href=&quot;https://financialpost.com/pmn/business-wire-news-releases-pmn/ai-is-changing-engineering-colab-just-raised-72m-to-lead-the-transformation&quot;&gt; $72M Series C&lt;/a&gt;, been named the 57th fastest growing company in North America by Deloitte (&lt;a href=&quot;https://financialpost.com/pmn/business-wire-news-releases-pmn/colab-ranked-number-57-fastest-growing-company-in-north-america-on-the-2025-deloitte-technology-fast-500&quot;&gt;Fast 500™&lt;/a&gt;), signed multi-year&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theglobeandmail.com/business/article-bombardier-signs-contract-colab-ai-software/&quot;&gt; AI partnerships with companies like Bombardier&lt;/a&gt;, and grown to a team of 250+.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact role that helps define how CoLab delivers technical value to its most strategic customers in Aerospace and Defence. CoLab is a category-creating product, which means adoption isn&#39;t just a rollout. It&#39;s a change in how the organization works.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you&#39;d act as a trusted advisor, leveraging people, process, and technology to help teams rethink how they manage feedback, data, and decision-making across design and PLM. That means getting deep into customer workflows, testing new ways of working, and building repeatable methods the rest of the team can scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work alongside a Customer Success Manager, and use what you learn on the front line to help shape product direction. This role isn&#39;t about selling or pitching. It&#39;s about deeply understanding engineering problems and solving them alongside the customer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a candidate in Switzerland to work regularly on-site with local CoLab customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Ideal Candidate&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re a mechanical engineer by trade and have worked as a designer in an A&amp;amp;D company. You also understand the full product development life cycle: how design, manufacturing, quality, and engineering leadership depend on each other, and where collaboration breaks down. You can coach those teams toward working together better.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You know how to improve that life cycle with technology. Maybe you’ve championed internal tools or created automation or scripts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You also know a process that makes sense on paper won’t get adopted on its own. You can meet people where they are, including the stakeholders who don’t want to change.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don’t need to be the loudest voice in the room, but you can run a sprint and lead a cross-functional project. If the average person might find this job too undefined or complex, that probably excites you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Job Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mapping a customer&#39;s current-state design review and engineering workflows, and defining the target-state process their teams will actually adopt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploying and tuning CoLab&#39;s AI capabilities against a customer&#39;s own standards, drawing checklists, and design guidelines, and diagnosing what&#39;s working and what isn&#39;t.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing mechanical engineering expertise to validate AI-generated results and ensure engineering rigor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigating and solving complex engineering data and integration challenges across PLM, ERP, QMS, and traditional design feedback tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expanding adoption into new teams, programs, and sites within the account, partnering with the Customer Success Manager on where the next opportunity sits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with product teams to identify feature gaps, improve capabilities, and refine AutoReview.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-haves:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in mechanical design engineering, ideally in a medium- to large-sized organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of PLM &amp;amp; ERP systems and enterprise engineering data architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead technical projects and cross-functional collaborations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working directly with customers or internal stakeholders to solve technical problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working in fast-changing, ambiguous environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written communication and documentation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of high-level AI architecture, specifically LLMs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with APIs, data integrations, and enterprise architecture concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Located in Switzerland&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-haves:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with internal tool development, scripting, or automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to AI/ML tools applied to engineering workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior work in design consulting or product development at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel Expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While this is a fully remote role, travel is a consistent part of the job. There are two primary types of travel you can expect:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Weeks:&lt;/strong&gt; Once per quarter, the sales team or entire company gets together in person. These typically involve traveling out on a Monday and returning on a Thursday or Friday. Two of these each year are held at our headquarters in St. John&#39;s, Newfoundland, Canada and the others take place in more central locations that evolve as the team grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;On-sites:&lt;/strong&gt; This role will work closely with a local customer with expectations to be on site with that customer, so there will likely be far less travel than our typical MFDE roll. That being said, in the event the local customer were to no longer work with us, the following is our standard MFDE travel expectations: “For most of our large deployment customers, we will visit on-site during kick-off and key expansion opportunities. Most on-sites involve 2-3 days with the customer, with travel on either side. Travel is primarily within North America, and you can expect 4 customer on-sites per quarter.”&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Extra Details&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is a full-time, permanent position with a competitive compensation package that includes stock options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited paid vacation and extended health benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Equity Note&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Frequently cited statistics show that people who identify with historically marginalized groups are likely to apply to jobs only if they meet 100% of the qualifications. We encourage you to help us break that statistic and apply even if you don&#39;t meet every single qualification. Your potential is what matters most to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Switzerland on Arbeitnow

&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-intro-section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section-inner&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;entry-intro&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;In a nutshell&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a hands-on, creative Content Creator Working Student to help tell our story. You’ll own our employer branding organic social content from start to finish brainstorming bold concepts, shooting, editing, and hitting the publish button. Working alongside recruiters, campaign managers, and designers, you’ll turn daily life behind the scenes into engaging content that stops top-talent scroll and gets them excited to join our ride.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Master the End-to-End Creative Process:&lt;/strong&gt; Pitch bold ideas, direct colleagues on camera, shoot mobile-first, and cut the final edit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn Raw Stories into High-Engagement Assets:&lt;/strong&gt; Capture real, behind-the-scenes moments and turn everyday footage into clips that our target persona actually wants to watch on LinkedIn and Instagram.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Refine Visual Craft &amp;amp; Brand Consistency:&lt;/strong&gt; Sharpen your eye for pacing, color, and smart branding to make every piece of content look pro and cohesive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Your superpowers&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Currently enrolled student:&lt;/strong&gt; Currently pursuing a Bachelor’s or Master’s in Media, Film, Communication, Design, or a related creative field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong short-form editing chops:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience with Adobe Suite and CapCut, with a strong feel for hooks, retention editing, tempo, sound design, and color grading/color theory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfortable behind the lens:&lt;/strong&gt; Confident shooting content on both a smartphone and a camera, with a solid eye for framing, lighting, and composition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems thinker:&lt;/strong&gt; You know how to build organized project files that can be easily adapted and reused across different social platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language &amp;amp; Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent in English (Dutch, French, or German is a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bonus: Working knowledge of After Effects for animations/graphics, or photography skills.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Don’t tick all the boxes yet? Picnic is the perfect learning environment for the highly ambitious and the deeply curious. If you align with Picnic’s mission, please feel free to send your application through.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Picnic Perks&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;🚀&lt;strong&gt;Every expert was once a beginner!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You’ll have plenty of chances to grow, whether it&#39;s through our casual Lunch &amp;amp; Learn sessions or team specific trainings. We&#39;re especially keen on keeping great talent around; perform well as a working student, and we would love to explore transitioning you into a full-time role.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;🌍&lt;strong&gt;Make a difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You’ll work in an awesome startup environment with the freedom to drive your own projects and create a visible impact. Our fully electric vehicles and sustainable business model mean you’ll also be contributing to making the world a better place!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;🤝&lt;strong&gt;Teamwork makes the dream work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;With more than 80 nationalities across 3 countries, you’ll be part of a diverse company with plenty of cool stuff to get involved with, from board game evenings to after-work drinks to our company ski trip and more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🥗Fresh Lunch, coffee, and snacks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;Our offices are equipped with fully-fledged coffee bars and a kitchen and chefs. They prepare delicious fresh and warm lunches every day so you can keep your energy up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;💪&lt;strong&gt;Stay healthy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Mental health is important. As well as having the option to speak with Picnic colleagues who act as confidential advisors, our collaboration with OpenUp gives you easy access to professional psychologists, along with workshops and materials.&lt;br&gt;There are plenty of sports communities and events to get involved with, from tennis to yoga to climbing!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;💰&lt;strong&gt;Attractive package&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll receive a gross hourly wage of €16,75 (incl. holiday pay) along with a laptop to support your work. Travel costs can also be reimbursed, depending on your location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

Job Description
Heb jij geen last van hoogtevrees, maar wél gevoel voor leidinggeven? En durf jij jouw team iedere dag naar een hoger niveau te tillen?

Jouw baan als Meewerkend Voorman bij RECO
Als Meewerkend Voorman ben jij de spil op de werkvloer. Je coördineert de steigerbouwwerkzaamheden op verschillende locaties en zorgt dat alle processen efficiënt, veilig en volgens planning verlopen. Je hebt nauw contact met uitvoerders, collega’s en opdrachtgevers en zorgt ervoor dat jouw team gemotiveerd blijft en dat het werk op tijd en volgens de afgesproken normen wordt opgeleverd.
Jouw belangrijkste werkzaamheden bestaan uit:
✅ Actief meewerken op projecten: jij staat zelf op de steiger en draagt bij aan de montage en demontage van steigers op verschillende locaties.
✅ Coördineren van je team: je begeleidt een vast team van steigermonteurs, zorgt dat iedereen weet wat er moet gebeuren en houdt de voortgang en kwaliteit in de gaten.
✅ Samenwerken met de Uitvoerder: je overlegt regelmatig over planning, veiligheid en kwaliteit en bent het aanspreekpunt op de werkvloer.
✅ Veiligheid voorop: je ziet toe op een veilige werkplek en dat alle werkzaamheden voldoen aan de geldende veiligheidsnormen.
✅ Afstemming met betrokkenen: je houdt contact met collega’s, opdrachtgevers en (onder)aannemers, zodat alles soepel en volgens plan verloopt.
Requirements

Wat breng jij mee?
👍 Je bent 40 uur per week beschikbaar;
👍 Je bezit een rijbewijs B;
👍 Je bent bij voorkeur in bezit van een geldig VCA certificaat en een certificaat (1e) Monteur Steigerbouw;
👍 Je hebt een goede beheersing van de Nederlandse taal;
👍 Hands-on mentaliteit: je bent niet bang om zelf de handen uit de mouwen te steken.
Bij RECO willen we jou blij maken met:
✅ Een goed salaris;
✅ 28 vakantiedagen per jaar, oplopend tot 31 dagen als waardering voor geen ziekteverzuim;
✅ Overwerkvergoeding;
✅ Buitendienstvergoeding;
✅ Een collectieve zorgverzekering én goede pensioenregeling met maar 3,3% eigen bijdrage, de rest betaalt RECO;
✅ Een moderne werkbus gevuld met het nieuwste gereedschap;
✅ Een mobiele telefoon van de zaak;
✅ Veel opleidings- en ontwikkelmogelijkheden via onze RECO Academy;
✅ Werken in een hechte organisatie: iedereen kent elkaar bij naam, de lijnen zijn kort en je loopt gemakkelijk bij elkaar binnen. Daarnaast organiseren we een goed verzorgde zomerbarbecue en een groots eindejaarspersoneelsfeest! Klik hier voor een kijkje in onze .
