&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Very good knowledge of practice with APQP and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;ISO 9145 is advantageous&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
