&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3117&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0b374d8670aa&quot;&gt;An inclusive company culture, ability to join our Community Guilds (Datadog employee resource groups)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3222&quot; data-local-id=&quot;817490810646&quot;&gt;Access to Inclusion Talks, our Internal panel discussions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3283&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3a31e6f14035&quot;&gt;Free, global mental health benefits for employees and dependents age 6+&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3358&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ad927e0ec303&quot;&gt;Competitive global benefits&lt;/p&gt;
