&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Data Mesh and governance: domain ownership, data products, federated governance, data contracts, catalogues and lineage (e.g. Unity Catalog, OpenMetadata, Collibra).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Cloud: data and AI PaaS services on at least one of Azure, AWS and GCP; security, networking and FinOps principles.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Databricks: Lakehouse, Delta Lake, Unity Catalog, Workflows; ability to assess design and cost.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;GenAI: RAG and agentic architectures, LLMOps, model evaluation, platforms such as Azure AI Foundry, Vertex AI and Bedrock.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Operating model: Data/AI organization, CoE, roles (data owner, data steward, product owner), demand and portfolio processes.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Requirements and delivery: requirements gathering, user stories, process modelling, agile methods, programme governance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Business: business cases, TCO, value tracking, and the ability to translate technical choices into economic impact.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;German not strictly required.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience with clients in pharma sector.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Cloud or Databricks certifications (e.g. Azure Solutions Architect, Databricks Data Engineer or Solutions Architect).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience in tech due diligence or post-merger transformation projects.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Prior technical background as an engineer or developer.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A role bridging strategy and technology, with direct impact on client decisions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;International projects on Data Mesh, data platforms and GenAI.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Close collaboration with the Project Lead and a growth path towards programme leadership roles.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Location and working model: (Hybrid) Zurich or Lausanne.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly competitive compensation package&lt;/li&gt;
