&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who/What is Artefact?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm dedicated to transforming&amp;nbsp;organizations through data and AI. We combine the rigor of top-tier strategy consulting&amp;nbsp;with deep expertise in data, digital, and analytics to help clients achieve tangible&lt;br&gt;business impact.&lt;br&gt;With 1,800+ consultants, data scientists, and engineers across 23 countries, we work&amp;nbsp;with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange, and Sanofi. Our Zurich office is&amp;nbsp;at the heart of Artefact’s growth, advising clients on their most pressing strategic&amp;nbsp;challenges — from AI strategy and governance to digital transformation roadmaps and&amp;nbsp;new business model design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We are looking for a Manager who leads strategy and architecture projects focused on GenAI solutions. You will own the design of architectures and solutions end to end, balancing business value, technology choices and economics across every dimension of the decision.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;You will lead development teams, present solutions to C-level stakeholders and run technical and strategic workshops independently.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Project and programme leadership&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lead strategy and architecture projects on GenAI, from scoping and business case through to solution design and rollout oversight.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own project plans, budgets, risks and quality, ensuring delivery against client objectives.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Shape proposals, estimates and demos, and identify follow-on opportunities with clients.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;GenAI architecture and solution design&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Design GenAI architectures and solutions: RAG, agentic systems, multi-agent orchestration, MCP and A2A integration, copilots and assistants.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Select and combine cloud-native AI services (e.g. Azure AI Foundry, Copilot Studio, Vertex AI, Bedrock, Databricks) with third-party and custom components.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Apply GenAI to support functions such as HR, Procurement, Legal, Finance and IT, redesigning processes and operating models around the new solutions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Cross-dimension optimization and trade-offs&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Orchestrate decisions across make, buy and customization options, weighing capex against opex and total cost of ownership.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Assess the impact of tool and architecture choices on vendor lock-in, performance, latency, scalability, security and compliance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Translate these trade-offs into clear recommendations that business and IT leaders can act on.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Team and stakeholder leadership&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Guide development teams technically: set the architecture, review solutions and unblock delivery.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Present solutions and recommendations to C-level audiences.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Run technical and strategic workshops independently, from discovery to design and prioritization.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Coach and develop consultants and architects in the team.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At least 8 years of professional experience in IT.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At least 3 years on AI/GenAI architecture and solution design projects.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Prior hands-on background as an engineer or developer.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Proven experience applying GenAI to support functions (HR, Procurement, Legal, Finance or IT).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Consulting experience, ideally in strategy consulting, combined with experience at a system integrator or delivery firm.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Track record of managing projects and leading teams, including development teams.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience presenting to C-level stakeholders and running workshops independently.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Excellent written and spoken English.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Technical and functional skills:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;GenAI architectures: RAG, agentic and multi-agent patterns, LLMOps, model evaluation, guardrails and responsible AI.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Agent protocols and copilots: MCP, A2A, Microsoft Copilot and Copilot Studio, custom assistants and their integration with enterprise systems.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Cloud AI platforms: Azure AI Foundry, Vertex AI, Bedrock, Databricks and the native data and AI services of Azure, AWS and GCP.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Architecture trade-offs: make vs buy vs customize, capex vs opex, TCO, lock-in, performance, latency, scalability, security and compliance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Support functions: processes and operating models in HR, Procurement, Legal, Finance and IT, and how GenAI changes them.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Delivery leadership: agile methods, technical team guidance, solution review, programme governance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Business: business cases, value tracking, and the ability to translate technical choices into economic impact for executives.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;German not strictly required.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Cloud or AI certifications (e.g. Azure AI Engineer, Azure Solutions Architect, AWS Machine Learning).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A leadership role bridging strategy, architecture and GenAI delivery, with direct impact on client decisions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;International projects on GenAI, agentic systems and support function transformation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A growth path towards senior programme and practice leadership roles.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Location and working model: (Hybrid) Zurich or Lausanne.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly competitive compensation package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is based in &lt;strong&gt;Zürich&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Don’t worry if you don’t meet all the criteria! We value motivation, pragmatic problem-solving, and potential above all else. We’d love to hear from you and learn more about your passion for driving the AI revolution.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Account Executive, Strategic Deals - Attribute™&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;This is a &lt;strong&gt;fully remote&lt;/strong&gt; opportunity based out of any of the following with travel as needed: UK, Ireland, Netherlands, Sweden, Estonia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Become part of the team behind&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.doit.com/blog/why-we-are-launching-attribute?_gl=1*j8dlue*_up*MQ..*_ga*MTUwMzU2OTc0NS4xNzgzNDEzMDIx*_ga_Y90QRD61TR*czE3ODM0MTMwMjAkbzEkZzEkdDE3ODM0MTMwMzMkajQ3JGwwJGg2MjkyMjk4OTAkZDN4YlFHcnJpZVVJUzJiV2JORC02QXZmOGtLLWJzczczelE&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Attribute™&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;. Following our recent acquisition, we&#39;re bringing together visionary engineers and go-to-market leaders to disrupt cloud management with real-time, tagless cost visibility across cloud and AI workloads. As an Account Executive focused on Strategic Deals, you&#39;ll join a founding GTM movement inside an established market leader trusted by over 4,500 global customers, unlocking high-impact opportunities through top-tier strategic partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DoiT empowers cloud-native organizations to scale faster and innovate with confidence. By combining our Cloud Intelligence technology with Forward Deployed Engineers and deep specialization across AWS, Google Cloud, and Azure, we help tech-forward companies navigate their toughest infrastructure and cost governance challenges end to end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;As an Account Executive, Strategic Deals for &lt;strong&gt;Attribute™&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be at the forefront of building a brand-new region from scratch and introducing a groundbreaking solution to a fundamental business problem in modern FinOps. You will work on Strategic Deals, leveraging strategic partnerships with AWS, OpenAI, Top Private Equity firms, and our global current install base. A strong focus will be placed on co-selling and unlocking strategic deal opportunities with AWS, ISVs, and channel partners. Traditional cloud cost allocation methods rely heavily on static tagging—an approach that becomes obsolete in modern, shared cloud and AI infrastructure. When multi-tenant clusters, shared GPUs, microservices, and dynamic AI workloads dominate, organizations face severe blind spots: they cannot accurately determine the true cost-to-serve for specific applications, autonomous agents, or business teams, making it impossible to calculate true gross margins at a granular customer level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Attribute™ solves this by taking a completely different approach. Leveraging runtime eBPF technology, Attribute™ captures real-time network traffic signals and kernel-level observability without requiring engineering teams to manually tag or instrument code. By analyzing actual runtime consumption across CPU, GPU, memory, network, and AI model API requests, it provides accurate total cost of ownership (TCO) and unit economics based on real usage. Organizations finally get precise cost governance and gross margin visibility across complex cloud and AI environments with zero developer overhead.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Account Executive building this region from scratch, you will establish a high-potential greenfield territory. You will drive sales end-to-end with a heavy emphasis on net-new logo acquisition, defining the regional go-to-market strategy and creating the foundational customer success stories that define this category.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own full-cycle deal execution across Startup, Digital Native, and Enterprise segments—prospecting new accounts, running compelling solution pitches, navigating complex technical evaluations alongside engineering partners, and closing strategic partnerships end to end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll have the rest of the Cloud Intelligence portfolio behind you: 4,500 customers, AWS/Google Cloud/Azure partnerships, and Forward Deployed Engineers who solve problems other vendors walk away from. But the product you&#39;ll carry every day is Attribute™, and the market is only just learning it exists. That&#39;s the opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Expect to travel 10–15% of the time to meet customers, engage with hyperscale teams, and show up at industry events that matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full sales cycle from first conversation to closed deal, consistently hitting and exceeding quota and pipeline targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a high-volume pipeline and establish the region from scratch with a hunter mindset, driving outbound prospecting and net-new logo acquisition across EMEA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the first wave of reference customers and case studies the rest of the GTM org will run on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute a regional strategy that identifies high-growth opportunities and untapped markets across EMEA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build deep, mutually valuable relationships with AWS Sales Leaders and Partner Managers to co-sell and expand market share&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Forward Deployed Engineers and Solutions Architects to solve the toughest technical challenges prospects face&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain rigorous forecast accuracy in Salesforce and ensure every proposal reflects the quality of what we actually deliver&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide customers from initial curiosity through contract execution, setting them up for a world-class onboarding experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed real customer signal back to product and marketing every week — in a founding team, that loop is the job&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate your own pipeline through prospecting, networking, and creative outreach — not just working what&#39;s handed to you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of full-cycle B2B SaaS sales experience with a strong emphasis on net-new logo acquisition and building a regional territory from scratch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of selling cloud services and understanding how consumption-based models work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hunting mentality: demonstrated drive to self-generate pipeline, prospect into target accounts, and close new business independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling to platform engineering / DevOps teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort selling something new — you&#39;ve sold a product before there was a Gartner quadrant for it, and you preferred it that way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical curiosity: you understand the cloud computing market and can hold your own in conversations about AWS, Google Cloud, or Azure products and architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine interest in FinOps and how engineering organisations actually consume the cloud — you don&#39;t need to be a practitioner, but you need to care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build influential relationships across matrixed organisations and turn professional networks into real partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&quot;Roll up your sleeves&quot; attitude that pervades both sales and business development activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience at AWS, ISVs, or in strategic partnerships is a big plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are You a Doer?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Be your truest self. Work on your terms. Make a difference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are home to a global team of incredible talent who work remotely and have the flexibility to have a schedule that balances your work and home life. We embrace and support leveling up your skills professionally and personally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What does being a Do&#39;er mean? We&#39;re all about being entrepreneurial, pursuing knowledge, and having fun!&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doit.com/life-at-doit/&quot;&gt; Click here to learn more about our Life at DoiT&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sounds too good to be true? Check out our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.glassdoor.com/Overview/Working-at-DoiT-International-EI_IE1972488.11,29.htm&quot;&gt; Glassdoor reviews&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We thought so too, but we&#39;re here and happy we hit that &#39;apply&#39; button.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Full-time employee benefits include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited PTO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Working Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Stock Option Plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional Development Stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Peer Recognition Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Many Doers, One Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;DoiT unites as Many Do&#39;ers, One Team, where diversity is more than a goal — it&#39;s our strength. We actively cultivate an inclusive, equitable workplace, recognizing that each unique perspective enhances our innovation. By celebrating differences, we create an environment where every individual feels valued, contributing to our collective success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior People Tech Specialist, you will be responsible for enhancing the user experience within the Workday platform. This responsibility includes Workday configuration, conducting thorough Workday testing, sharing insights and providing end-user support for Workday-related inquiries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join our dynamic People Tech team, which primarily manages the Workday - Human Capital Management (HCM) system. Reporting to the People Tech Manager, you will collaborate with other People Tech team members. Our team is accountable for configuring Workday, adopting new functionalities, integrating with other systems, and tailoring the system to meet the company&#39;s needs. We strive to make Workday a user-friendly, self-service tool that caters to our organization&#39;s specific requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a fixed-term position approximately 2 years.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot Workday technical problems and deficiencies in a timely manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Audit for data integrity, accuracy and timeliness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for the use of technology and automation across people processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do unit testing and create test plans, coordinate end-to-end testing until resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop system documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive / support implementation of additional Workday modules&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide end user support on more complex issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to interdependent HR wide projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Suggest and implement Workday enhancements, process improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform Workday Release testing and adopt improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with HR and other stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support other projects and ad hoc requests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience with Workday configuration within Compensation and Advanced Compensation functional areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence with Workday Security, Business Processes, Reporting, Calculated Fields, Condition Rules, EIBs, Custom Organization hierarchies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Excel / Gsheet skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in updating and maintaining project plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple projects simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent at communicating in spoken and written English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capability of handling confidential information discreetly and demonstrate a strong work ethic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Digital mental and emotional health support and Employee Assistant Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch benefit per working day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company bike leasing scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly budget for a flexible benefits platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from Home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collective Defined Contribution Pension plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NS Business Card for your commute to the office by public transport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hybrid model, with 2 recommended office days a week, gives you and your team the flexibility to decide if and when you want to work from home, and when to catch up in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position excluding 8% holiday pay is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€63.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€85.200 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;758&quot; data-local-id=&quot;349f5d1d97ae&quot;&gt;We are seeking a Staff Applied AI Researcher to join a fast-growing team building an agent-native search platform - the web access layer for AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;912&quot; data-local-id=&quot;52da8de25c65&quot;&gt;You can think of this as Google search, but for AI agents: a system designed for machines, not humans. We are building agentic search, where AI systems actively plan, retrieve, evaluate, and refine information rather than simply returning results. As AI becomes the primary interface to the web, this layer will replace the role of traditional search engines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1273&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8ba2f733eb98&quot;&gt;We are designing these systems to search and reason over web data in real time, under strict latency and reliability constraints. This means solving retrieval, ranking and passage extraction under entirely new access patterns and at significant scale, with systems operating over constantly changing, unstructured data and serving tens of thousands of production workloads 24/7.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1653&quot; data-local-id=&quot;dc8aefa0b2c5&quot;&gt;This role comes with ownership over key parts of our applied AI research direction and system design, with a strong expectation of defining new approaches and shipping measurable impact in production. In the first year, you will own a specific part of the search stack, e.g. ranking or iterative retrieval.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1961&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3a68defafc73&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll work on:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b2d49ed7-2072-4623-afb5-0f3e46fb9eff&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1985&quot; data-local-id=&quot;dbde4a36f318&quot;&gt;Designing an agent-native search system that handles everything from low-latency single-hop search to complex deep search tasks requiring iterative planning, querying, refinement and reasoning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2182&quot; data-local-id=&quot;330562c2b43d&quot;&gt;Training ranking and retrieval models optimized for agent-driven workflows under real world constraints&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2289&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a80b20c7f5e2&quot;&gt;Bringing the latest advances from the research community to our search stack and ship it to production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2396&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c5f3d6d01f8e&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ca556365-56d6-4b18-a6ab-e96d32aada2a&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2422&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ba12fa15e8c5&quot;&gt;Drive applied research and technical direction across retrieval and ranking systems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2509&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0ac01c95d3f6&quot;&gt;Design and evolve multi-stage retrieval architectures (query understanding, rewriting, retrieval, reranking and iterative retrieval)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2645&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bdd93b58a974&quot;&gt;Lead experimentation on modern retrieval approaches (embedding research, sparse and hybrid retrieval, reranking, context compression) and bring them into production&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2813&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5d99bb2639e8&quot;&gt;Develop methods for grounding LLMs in real-time web data at scale, using trust, quality and freshness signals to surface reliable sources&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2954&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5b539cf905a3&quot;&gt;Partner with the evaluation team to define new metrics for agentic systems, where correctness is not reducible to clicks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3078&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7f6ed1a6999b&quot;&gt;Analyze trade-offs across relevance, latency, and cost, and work closely with engineering to deploy systems that operate at web scale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3215&quot; data-local-id=&quot;98cbe59fe7ce&quot;&gt;Mentor researchers and engineers and help raise the technical bar of the team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3296&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4e7298218846&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Must haves:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;288927ca-3161-4538-89a9-be6a7978542a&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3311&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3c107fbda2c8&quot;&gt;8+ years of experience in applied AI, ML, or software engineering&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3380&quot; data-local-id=&quot;529c36f68cf3&quot;&gt;Proven track record of shipping ML or AI systems to production at scale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3455&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a88ee0b3e468&quot;&gt;Deep experience with search, retrieval, ranking or building RAG-based assistants&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3539&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9b58081ace33&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of modern deep learning, especially transformers and embeddings&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3627&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3af7b74609d8&quot;&gt;Experience with LLM-integrated or knowledge-intensive systems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3692&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f5f3ac6c678b&quot;&gt;Experience designing evaluation frameworks and metrics for ML systems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3765&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e298f34817b3&quot;&gt;Strong programming skills in Python&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3804&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f3f98b81e4cd&quot;&gt;Top-tier publications (&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;ICLR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;ICML&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, NeurIPS, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;AAAI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;EMNLP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;ACL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3869&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f4b4b274060d&quot;&gt;Ability to operate in a fast-moving, product-driven environment with high ownership and autonomy&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3969&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6863daca2e3d&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Nice to haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1277d9a5-56c4-4baf-b433-51bc8e50a5e5&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3986&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6710586b568c&quot;&gt;Background in agentic AI systems (agents, tool use, autonomous workflows)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4063&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c8279fe831c2&quot;&gt;Experience with &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;RL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; post-training of LLMs or VLMs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;blockquote&gt;Shape our offensive security services&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ready to immerse yourself in the world of securing critical IT by thinking and acting like a real adversary? Join our security team at Schuberg Philis! We are an engineering company with a people-centric approach and a focus on customer satisfaction, dedicated to delivering mission critical IT solutions to our customers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As an offensive security specialist, you will collaborate with about 30 customer-oriented teams managing critical system environments. Your role is pivotal in ensuring the security of Schuberg Philis and its customers by identifying and exploiting realistic paths in our complex, one-of-a-kind environments. You will scope, execute, and report on penetration tests, purple and red teaming engagements, and threat modeling assessments tailored to our unique and complex mission-critical environments. We focus on what real-world adversaries search for and abuse, not compliance-driven checks that look good on paper but don&#39;t raise resilience.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will engage closely with engineers, customer teams, external experts, vendors, and stakeholders to define and drive work that measurably strengthens these environments. The engagements are hands-on and technical, and we want someone who can own an engagement end-to-end: from a customer saying &quot;we want to test something, can you help us figure out what?&quot; all the way to presenting the results of a bespoke engagement to their board.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Schuberg Philis, we thrive on growth and innovation, offering an exciting environment for security enthusiasts. We are actively seeking security professionals at various seniority levels to join our security team. We provide a challenging and rewarding atmosphere where autonomy in your day-to-day operations is valued.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a small team and we are part of the team that works on our value propositions for security. This means we have a lot of mandate to define and shape offensive security services within Schuberg Philis. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In this role, you will work with cutting-edge technologies, spanning private and public clouds and VMs to serverless - all highly automated. As an offensive security specialist your skills will be put to the test in a diverse technological landscape.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Success in this role requires a unique blend of skills and traits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience (the more the better) in an offensive security role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A security mindset aimed at identifying realistic attack paths from a real-world adversaries&#39; perspective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Giving security advice that fits the unique and challenging mission-critical environments we manage to help our teams set up strong defense-in-depth. Recommendations should fit the environment in front of you, not a textbook fix that can&#39;t be applied there.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will have the experience and judgment to run engagements on your own, and the collaborative instinct to tackle the hardest problems together. Our teams will love you if you can take them by the hand through the entire process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience and understanding at least one of the major clouds (AWS, Azure, GCP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong risk management thinking, sense of ownership, and a solid BS radar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eagerness to learn, coupled with a stubborn determination to make things happen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with building solid tools that support our activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in IT engineering and IT engineering heavy environments preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will be your focus?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help scope, lead, execute, and report on various types of complex offensive security engagements. Every environment is unique, and we expect our engagements to treat them as such as well.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain tools to help scale our offensive security services well beyond a small team. As an example: by building and maintaining a secure AI penetration testing methodology and toolkit that can be used by our customer teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with all customer teams, offering guidance on security-related topics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluating and improving the security resilience of Schuberg Philis itself through red and purple teaming engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using your technical and soft skills to guide the organization in adopting security measures along with the broader security team. We show impact, and can help limit it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where we would love to grow as a team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We care more about mindset, experience, and being calm under pressure than a checklist of specific technologies. Our best work comes from people who can rely on experience and the right mindset to tackle the unfamiliar. However, if you bring depth in advanced malware development, Kubernetes, or OT security, you&#39;ll find eager sparring partners and plenty of room to make those areas your own.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Everyone we work with and consider working with has a right to equal treatment. The hiring and appraisal process at Schuberg Philis is designed to be thorough and equitable, implementing fair payment, benefits, and opportunities across all demographics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;It is our desire to be a company that brings together multiple nationalities, cultures, religions, genders, abilities, and talents within and across our teams. We welcome colleagues from diverse backgrounds to join Schuberg Philis and actively support diversity and inclusion in the tech industry.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Account Executive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Account Executive (AE) on our Commercial Sales team, you will assist in Datadog’s overall business growth by strategically engaging and closing net-new customers across small to midsize markets. Sellers follow a well-defined methodology, collaborate with internal stakeholders, identify the customer&#39;s unique needs, and clearly convey the value of the Datadog product. AEs have the opportunity to grow their careers in Sales and continue contributing to Datadog team success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture - the relationships and collaboration it builds and the creativity it brings to the table. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our Datadogs can create a work-life harmony that best fits them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on net-new logo acquisition via outbound activity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become a Datadog expert through continued product and sales trainings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the full sales cycle, including technical demonstrations and negotiation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Sales Development Representatives to drive top of funnel activity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategically prospect into Chief Technology Officers, Engineering/IT Leaders, and technical end-users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, driven, and motivated as a sales person&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have is Dutch or French but not a requirement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative in how you map and break into accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to learn from feedback and champion a growth mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in a highly technical, fast paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in carrying quota, with a proven track record of success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Datadog values people from all walks of life. We understand not everyone will meet all the above qualifications on day one. That&#39;s okay. If you’re passionate about technology and want to grow your experience, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits and Growth:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High income earning opportunities based on self performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New hire stock equity (RSU) and employee stock purchase plan (ESPP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous professional development, product training, and career pathing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales training in MEDDIC and Command of the Message&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intra-departmental mentor and buddy program for in-house networking&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive company culture, opportunity to join our Community Guilds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous global benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits and Growth listed above may vary based on the country of your employment and the nature of your employment with Datadog.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Datadog:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is the leading observability and security platform for the AI era, providing businesses with unified visibility across the technology stack to manage complexity at scale. It brings applications, infrastructure, data, models, and security into one place, using AI to detect and resolve issues before they impact customers. Trusted globally by Fortune 500 companies and high-growth AI leaders, Datadog enables businesses to move faster with clarity and confidence. Learn more about #DatadogLife on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/datadoghq/?hl=en&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/datadog&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn,&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.datadoghq.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Datadog Learning Center. &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;215&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity at Datadog:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is proud to offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;equal employment opportunity&lt;/a&gt; to everyone regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity, veteran status, and other characteristics protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements. Here are our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/candidate-legal-notices/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Legal Notices&lt;/a&gt; for your reference.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog endeavors to make our Careers Page accessible to all users. If you would like to contact us regarding the accessibility of our website or need assistance completing the application process, please complete &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeoJeduEZ2NdZF_65uZmWUrCM-zee7yADXX1s6Xr9zAGq8iKA/viewform&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;this form&lt;/a&gt;. This form is for accommodation requests only and cannot be used to inquire about the status of applications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Privacy and AI Guidelines:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;Any information you submit to Datadog as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Datadog’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. For information on our AI policy, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/interviewing-at-datadog-ai-guidelines/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Interviewing at Datadog AI Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At ASM, the Software Engineering team works on delivering software that has immediate, tangible results visible in the operation of semiconductor processing equipment hardware. The hardware includes robotics, gas valves, temperature controllers and other hardware. Based in Singapore, the Senior QA Engineer will have the opportunity to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test and Qualify Advance software for cutting edge tech&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test SW features containing AI/ML/Advanced Algorithms/Data Science&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate / streamline / maintain the QA Process to work alongside with our CI/CD development process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;See your work have real results by driving the most advanced HW in the SEMI industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gain knowledge beyond just SW to control our ASM products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with a global team full of talented Software/QA Engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part to the team that leads the next generation of SEMI manufacture control Software technology and trends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of ASM&#39;s investment in expanding software engineering capabilities in Singapore and help establish ASM Singapore hub for semiconductor software development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Working On &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt; Design, develop, test, deploy, maintain, document, and improve software test suites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform manual and automated testing of software in simulation and on physical semiconductor manufacturing equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute and analyze the functionality of engineering designs compared to intended outcomes, providing feedback on the quality, eAectiveness, and performance of the designs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate, streamline, and maintain QA processes to integrate seamlessly with CI/CD development workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize and implement existing quality standards, methods, and procedures with existing business processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement new quality standards, methods, and procedures not encompassed by existing business processes both internal and external to the software Engineering group.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn the system operation that includes mechanical, electrical, and software functionality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and manage tests plans and test cases, ensuring thorough validation of software enhancements and defect fixes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Process Engineering in testing the system, finding appropriate usage to achieve results, define enhancements, or quality improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage individual project priorities, deadlines, and deliverables&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS or MS in Computer Science, Computer Engineering, or related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in software development, software testing or test automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in at least one programming language/test case management/issue tracking software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working experience in the field of System Quality Assurance, System Quality Engineering with “hands on” experience as a Quality Engineer or a software developer in test with a company engaged in the manufacture of complex electromechanical equipment with integrated software controls, preferably in semiconductor equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills for interacting with senior leadership and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel up to 10-25% of the time&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Sets You Apart &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Jira/Confluence/Git/other test tools such as Test Complete or TestRail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in one or more of: Python, C++ or C#&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with semiconductor equipment preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a role configuring software applications, managing software versioning, or providing configuration management responsibilities in a software development environment a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with CI/CD pipeline creation, execution and maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI-assisted development tools, large language models (LLMs), and modern software engineering practices leveraging generative AI.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today to be part of what’s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make the tech that enables the chips in devices which improve lives around the world. We do this with an eye to the future, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible through cutting-edge innovation, and driving the next wave of technological breakthroughs that shape how we live, work, and connect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;To learn more about ASM, find us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.asm.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;asm.com&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/asm/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/ASMOfficialCompany&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/asmofficialcompany/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/ASMofficialco&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/c/ASM_Official&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;ASM is an equal opportunity employer and considers qualified applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, age, nationality, social or ethnic origin, sexual orientation, gender, gender identify or expression, marital status, pregnancy, political affiliation, disability, genetic information, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer at ASM, you&#39;ll work at the intersection of advanced software, complex hardware systems, and real-world customer impact. Based in Singapore, you will serve as a technical leader, solving challenging software issues that improve the reliability, safety, and performance of semiconductor manufacturing equipment used by customers around the globe. In this role, you&#39;ll lead complex investigations, influence system architecture decisions, and drive long-term software improvements that support next-generation semiconductor manufacturing technology. You will play a key role in advancing ASM&#39;s software engineering capabilities through the responsible adoption of AI enabled development, helping teams accelerate problem resolution, improve software quality, and scale engineering excellence across global product platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Working On&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical investigations involving software-related safety interlocks and validate corrective and preventive actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze interactions across multiple subsystems to gain end-to-end understanding of platform behavior and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Root Cause and Corrective Action (RCCA) eAorts using packet captures, log analysis, and system-level troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, evaluate, and improve subsystem architectures, including multi-threaded applications and scheduler interactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, deploy, maintain, and enhance software for advanced semiconductor manufacturing equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot complex software issues, including real-time control systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a technical escalation point for field engineers and customers worldwide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Quality Assurance and Support teams to reproduce field issues and improve regression test coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Author and review software specifications, design documents, and test plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate technical inquiries and provide clear analysis with actionable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and influence software engineering tools, processes, and design decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate rapid software fixes and deployments in high-impact customer environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present technical findings, project updates, and data-driven insights to internal teams and customers, including DOE analysis results.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science or a related field with 7+ years of relevant experience, Master&#39;s degree with 4+ years, or PhD with 3+ years of relevant experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software development experience using C++ and/or C#.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of multi-threaded application development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with software specifications, technical documentation, and APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of software memory architecture, debugging, and performance analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to eAectively communicate complex technical concepts to cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI-assisted development tools, large language models (LLMs), and modern software engineering practices leveraging generative AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel 10-25% domestically and internationally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Sets You Apart &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced degree (Master&#39;s or PhD).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with software architecture, machine control systems, or semiconductor manufacturing equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with GUI development, device drivers, and interrupt-driven software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of networking, data communications, and EtherCAT.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding dynamic scheduling algorithms and deadlock avoidance techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with debuggers, build systems, and configuration management tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to troubleshoot software, electrical, and mechanical issues from a system-level perspective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and analyzing complex Design of Experiments (DOE), including multivariate analysis or Principal Component Analysis (PCA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience integrating AI, machine learning, or data-driven solutions into production software systems or engineering workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today to be part of what’s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make the tech that enables the chips in devices which improve lives around the world. We do this with an eye to the future, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible through cutting-edge innovation, and driving the next wave of technological breakthroughs that shape how we live, work, and connect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;To learn more about ASM, find us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.asm.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;asm.com&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/asm/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/ASMOfficialCompany&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/asmofficialcompany/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/ASMofficialco&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/c/ASM_Official&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;ASM is an equal opportunity employer and considers qualified applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, age, nationality, social or ethnic origin, sexual orientation, gender, gender identify or expression, marital status, pregnancy, political affiliation, disability, genetic information, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

About Finom
&nbsp;
Finom is a European tech startup headquartered in Amsterdam, and we’re on a journey towards revolutionizing the financial landscape for entrepreneurs worldwide. Our mission is to develop an all-in-one financial B2B solution that integrates banking functions, accounting, financial management, and invoicing into a seamless, mobile-first platform.
&nbsp;
We recently closed a €115 million Series C equity round (around $133 million), bringing our total funding to approximately $346 million. This significant investment follows a $105 million growth funding round from General Catalyst, a long-term backer since 2021 known for supporting companies like Airbnb, HubSpot, KAYAK, and Stripe.
&nbsp;
Finom's platform goes beyond traditional banking, offering invoicing and a growing suite of features, including AI-enabled accounting, aiming to simplify financial management for entrepreneurs. We're actively expanding our reach across key EU markets like Germany, France, the Netherlands, Italy, and Spain.
&nbsp;
At Finom, we’re not just redefining the entrepreneurial experience — we’re empowering our employees to make a real difference. Your work matters, and your impact extends far beyond product metrics. We nurture innovation and an inspiring work environment where bold ideas thrive, prioritizing thorough research, swift implementation of solutions, and ensuring that every effort we make benefits our users, employees, partners, and our business as a whole.
&nbsp;
Maintaining our start-up spirit, we prioritize thorough research, swift implementation of solutions, and ensuring that every effort we make benefits our users, employees, partners, and, of course, our business.About The Role
About the role
We are looking for a Senior Data Analyst, Lifecycle to own measurement and experimentation for how new customers activate and existing ones stay.The metrics are yours whatever the lever: CRM campaigns, promos and incentives, onboarding changes in the product, and a next best action layer that decides what each customer should see next. You decide what we test, how we test it and what we do with the answer. You also bring your own hypotheses on where the next win is.
&nbsp;
What You'll Do
What you'll do
Join activation and retention initiatives before anything is built, whether they come from CRM, growth or product. Define the primary metric, check against historical data whether the effect is detectable at our volumes, and turn solution-shaped requests into problem-shaped ones.
Design and analyse experiments end to end: hypothesis, guardrails, audience split, MDE and power, stopping rule, and a readout that ends in ship, iterate or kill.&nbsp;
Correct for channel and engagement bias (not everyone opens email, and open and click populations are self-selected). When a clean A/B is impossible, use causal inference: diff-in-diff, matching, synthetic control or geo designs.
Bring hypotheses of your own. Launch a few new experiments across onboarding and the customer lifecycle, and turn one-off wins into recurring segmented flows.
Build deliberately simple models: segmentation, propensity, churn and dormancy scoring. They feed audiences, personalisation and incentive targeting. Over time these come together into next best action: for a given customer, which offer, feature nudge or message to send next, through which channel, and whether to send anything at all. You own the logic and the measurement of whether it beats the current rules.
Automate your own recurring work: audience refresh jobs, readout templates, dashboards for Activation, Onboarding and Retention. Ship models the Databricks way (scheduled jobs write tables, tables map into downstream tools such as Braze) and bring engagement data back into the warehouse to close the loop.
What You Bring
What you bring


Strong SQL and Python, and a Git-based warehouse workflow with code review.


Experiment design, statistics and metric design you can defend.


BI experience, Power BI/Tableau or similar.


Stakeholder management and business sense: you can push back, reframe a request and land a recommendation with a non-technical audience.


Curiosity and ownership. You run your area without waiting to be asked.


&nbsp;
Nice To Have
Nice to have


Causal inference methods and a clear sense of when each one is valid.


Clustering and segmentation that ends up in use, not in a slide.


Predictive modelling with honest validation. Uplift modelling is a plus.


Braze or a comparable CRM platform: audiences, canvases, native split testing, channel mechanics and their biases.


What You Will Get In Return
&nbsp;
Make a genuine impact on the product
&nbsp;
Join our upward trajectory, and grow with us. We provide the resources and opportunities for continuous personal and professional development, empowering you to make a genuine impact on our evolving product.
&nbsp;
Work in the EU
&nbsp;
Embark on this exciting journey with us and enjoy the flexibility of traveling and working remotely or in a hybrid model across Europe.
&nbsp;
Become a stock options holder
&nbsp;
Unlock your inner entrepreneur and align your aspirations with ours through our Stock Options Program. This exciting opportunity is available to every team member, from junior team members to our founders.
&nbsp;
Receive unwavering support and care
&nbsp;
Finom stands by you at every step, embodying our commitment to your well-being and success reflected in our modern, friendly, and eco-conscious corporate culture. We offer constant support and care to ensure your Finom experience is successful and fulfilling.
&nbsp;
Work &amp; Swim program
&nbsp;
Immerse yourself in our exclusive Work &amp; Swim Program. Spend one month in a comfortable corporate apartment in enchanting Cyprus. It's the ideal opportunity to strike the perfect work-life balance while enjoying breathtaking Mediterranean views.
&nbsp;
Equal Opportunity Statement&nbsp;
&nbsp;
At Finom, we're an equal opportunity employer and value diversity at our company. We embrace diversity and invite applications from all walks of life. We do not discriminate based on race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, disability status, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Factor&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Factor is the #1 ready-to-eat brand for people who see personal health as a key ingredient to achieving their goals. Developed by chefs and dietitians, Factor makes healthy eating effortless, enjoyable, and full of flavor. Part of the HelloFresh Group, Factor is the fastest-growing business in the group, and we are now building the next chapter in Europe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a senior marketing leader to own Factor&#39;s European growth. You will run the full marketing agenda across multiple markets: acquiring new customers efficiently, owning the P&amp;amp;L across countries, and building the partnerships and channels that will take Factor beyond direct-to-consumer. This is a lean, flat team that moves fast. You will have full accountability for European decisions, and you will work directly with the leadership team to shape where the business goes next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale new customer acquisition at efficient CAC.&lt;/strong&gt; Own the social-first growth engine (Meta, influencers, and partnerships) and keep it efficient as spend grows significantly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the P&amp;amp;L across multiple markets.&lt;/strong&gt; Set and deliver marketing plans, targets, and budgets, and make the trade-offs between markets and channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow the partnerships network.&lt;/strong&gt; Expand our rolodex of influencers and strategic partners that feed the acquisition engine.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead creative with a clear point of view.&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee creative functions and set a direction for how Factor shows up for customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with finance.&lt;/strong&gt; Work with finance on business planning, forecasting, and end-to-end customer retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prepare new growth channels.&lt;/strong&gt; Build toward new distribution channels such as retail and B2B over the next 12 to 18 months, establishing revenue lines beyond direct-to-consumer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and lead a lean, high-performing team.&lt;/strong&gt; Create clear accountability and keep the organization flat, adding capacity only where the opportunity is clear.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior marketing leadership at a scaled European subscription or e-commerce brand&lt;/strong&gt;, with a track record of growing new customer volume at efficient acquisition costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;P&amp;amp;L ownership across several countries.&lt;/strong&gt; You have been accountable for results, not only for marketing activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;General management experience.&lt;/strong&gt; This can come from business, strategy, or consulting roles, or from end-to-end management, including at a smaller company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-market exposure.&lt;/strong&gt; You have led or covered several markets as part of your scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on leadership.&lt;/strong&gt; You are comfortable diving deep yourself and are not only a manager of managers. Earlier-stage or high-growth experience is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-driven judgment.&lt;/strong&gt; You are fluent in data and use it to make fast, clear decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Speed and agility, relentless prioritization, and a growth mindset.&lt;/strong&gt; You thrive in fast-moving environments and focus on what moves the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer centricity.&lt;/strong&gt; You put the customer at the center and work well across functions, including operations and finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy 20% off HelloFresh and 40% off Factor_ subscriptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access the &quot;Benefits at Work&quot; platform for discounts on brands like Nike, Bol.com, and IKEA.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll receive a HelloFresh laptop and phone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build your future with a pension plan through Aegon Cappital (age-based rates, 50/50 split).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive a 7,5% discount on additional health insurance at Zilveren Kruis (2026), plus free access to Headspace and OpenUp.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get discounts on ClassPass and gym memberships via Bedrijfsfitness Nederland, plus free bootcamp classes (Amsterdam).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefit from a flexible hybrid work setup with a €2.45 daily remote work allowance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start with 24 days of annual leave (pro-rata), plus one additional day per year of service (up to 30 days total).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full reimbursement for 2nd-class public transport to the office, and €0.23 per km for car/bicycle travel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate internal/external opportunities aligned with our Job Framework, and join our cross-market mentoring program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy fresh homemade lunches in the office (€20/month), weekly &lt;em&gt;vrij-mi-bo&lt;/em&gt; (Friday drinks), quarterly strategy sessions, and team events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;P-1626&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Designer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we design tools that make complex data and AI workflows intuitive and powerful. Our mission is to simplify how data is connected, understood, and activated so organizations can turn information into business outcomes. Designers at Databricks combine strong visual craft with systems thinking. They shape products used by some of the most advanced data teams in the world, and increasingly by the business users and AI agents working alongside them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring Product Designers to join our design team and own design for an area of the Databricks Platform. Teams span the platform, from data engineering and analytics to databases, apps, and AI agents. We match each designer to the area where their skills and interests will have the most impact. You&#39;ll design for both technical and business users of data, making powerful capabilities feel clear, controllable, and trustworthy for enterprise customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own your area end to end.&lt;/strong&gt; Sharpen the problem, set the design direction, and carry the work from framing and interaction models through visual polish and shipped detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set the quality bar.&lt;/strong&gt; Make the critical design decisions in your area, review work from designers, PM, engineering, and AI tools, and have the hands-on skill to improve it yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advocate with evidence.&lt;/strong&gt; Stay in regular contact with customers, choose research methods that fit the decision, and turn research into insights others can act on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Show the experience got better.&lt;/strong&gt; Define what success looks like for the key tasks users need to get done, and show the improvement through usability testing, research, and how people actually use what shipped.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence through the work.&lt;/strong&gt; Move product and engineering decisions with prototypes, keep design reviews focused, and communicate clearly in writing and in person.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prototype to explore and align.&lt;/strong&gt; Use interactive prototypes as a primary thinking tool to explore ambiguous problems, reduce risk, and align the team on a direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design directly in the codebase with coding agents.&lt;/strong&gt; Use AI coding agents to ship well-scoped design changes alongside engineers, rather than handing off static mocks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define reusable UX principles.&lt;/strong&gt; Create interaction patterns and frameworks other teams reuse, and drive consistency through a strong, cross-platform design system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the level of critique.&lt;/strong&gt; Give and invite high-quality feedback, and help make clear decisions together with product and engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of product design work experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bachelor&#39;s or master&#39;s degree in design, computer science, human-computer interaction, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio demonstrating your end-to-end design process, from inception to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead large and complex design projects and balance the needs of diverse stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A systems thinker who has the vision to design the big picture, and the tactical ability to break it down so that engineering can succeed in building it incrementally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A deep understanding of business goals, customer needs, emerging AI capabilities, and the evolving data and technology landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-directed and comfortable in ambiguity. You help shape product direction when the path isn&#39;t defined.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Beautiful visual and interaction work rooted in a data-driven, well-researched UX process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing developer tools, data/analytics products, AI/ML products, or enterprise software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing products that bridge the gap between technical and business users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The strongest candidates have demonstrated experience using modern development and AI-assisted coding tools to prototype ideas, understand implementation tradeoffs, and collaborate deeply with engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Engineer - FDE (Forward Deployed Engineer)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Req ID: CSQ427R334&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: Location: Amsterdam, Netherlands - Candidates to be based in the Netherlands region only (no remote working available from any other country)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The AI Forward Deployed Engineering (AI FDE) team is a highly specialised customer-facing AI team at Databricks. We deliver professional services engagements to help our customers build and productionize first-of-its-kind AI applications. We work cross-functionally to shape long-term strategic priorities and initiatives alongside engineering, product, and developer relations, as well as support internal subject matter expert (SME) teams. We view our team as an ensemble: we look for individuals with strong, unique specialisations to improve the overall strength of the team. This team is the right fit for you if you love working with customers, teammates, and fueling your curiosity for the latest trends in GenAI, LLMOps, and ML more broadly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to: Senior Manager - AI FDE, EMEA&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop cutting-edge GenAI solutions, incorporating the latest techniques from &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.databricks.com/blog/category/databricks-ai?categories=databricks-ai%2Cai-research%2Cai-engineering&quot;&gt;Databricks AI research&lt;/a&gt; to solve customer problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own production rollouts of consumer and internally facing GenAI applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted technical advisor to customers across a variety of domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present at conferences such as Data + AI Summit, recognized as a thought leader internally and externally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with the product and engineering teams to influence priorities and shape the product roadmap&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Min 4 years&#39; experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building GenAI applications, including RAG, multi-agent systems, Text2SQL, fine-tuning, etc., with tools such as HuggingFace, LangChain, and DSPy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in deploying production-grade GenAI applications, including evaluation and optimisations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive years of hands-on industry data science experience, leveraging common machine learning and data science tools, i.e. pandas, scikit-learn, PyTorch, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building production-grade machine learning deployments on AWS, Azure, or GCP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Graduate degree in a quantitative discipline (Computer Science, Engineering, Statistics, Operations Research, etc.) or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience communicating and/or teaching technical concepts to non-technical and technical audiences alike&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for collaboration, life-long learning, and driving business value through AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Preferred] Experience using the Databricks Intelligence Platform and Apache Spark™ to process large-scale distributed datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to travel once every 4-8 weeks to see customers (as needed)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Note: for this role it is necessary to speak and write fluently Dutch.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hey toekomstige media-expert! Klaar om je stempel te drukken in de dynamische wereld van digitale marketing? Bij WPP Media, onderdeel van het wereldwijde WPP mediacollectief, bouwen we aan de toekomst van media in het AI-tijdperk. We brengen het beste platform, de meest getalenteerde mensen en de sterkste partners samen om baanbrekende oplossingen te creëren die merken laten groeien. Onze kernwaarden? We zijn&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Extraordinary&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Open&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;en&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Optimistic&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;– altijd op zoek naar nieuwe kansen en klaar om grenzen te verleggen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Jouw Digitale Marketing Avontuur Begint Hier!&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Klaar om de collegebanken in te ruilen voor de frontlinie van digital marketing? Start dan in januari/februari 2027 als stagiaire(e) Campaign Operations bij WPP Media in Eindhoven! Je gaat campagnes managen voor A-merken, werkt met partners als Google en optimaliseert op basis van data. We waarderen jouw frisse blik en scherpe analyses enorm. Daarnaast werken we natuurlijk hard en leren non-stop, maar gezelligheid staat net zo hoog op de agenda!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Waarom is dit dé stage voor jou?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deze stage is speciaal ontworpen om jou in korte tijd enorm veel te leren en te laten groeien. De focus ligt op jouw ontwikkeling!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meewerken &amp;amp; Direct Leren:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Geen saaie theorie, maar direct aan de slag in een van onze klantteams! Je duikt in de data, analyseert campagnes, spot trends en leert hoe we deze optimaal laten presteren met behulp van AI. Je werkt actief mee aan lopende projecten en krijgt de kans om direct waardevolle bijdragen te leveren.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ontdek je Passie &amp;amp; Verdiep je:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Maak kennis met diverse specialismen binnen online marketing, zoals Social Media Advertising, Online Video, SEO, SEA, Programmatic Advertising en meer. Onder begeleiding van ervaren specialisten leer je de kneepjes van het vak en krijg je de mogelijkheid om je te verdiepen in de gebieden die jou het meest aanspreken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Word een Online Marketing &amp;amp; AI Expert:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;CPM&#39;s, CPC&#39;s, attributie, machine learning... klinkt nog ingewikkeld? Geen probleem! Wij leren je alles wat je moet weten én hoe je deze kennis dagelijks inzet om campagnes te optimaliseren met de nieuwste tools en AI-technieken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Jouw Ontwikkeling Staat Centraal:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Wij geloven in jouw potentieel! Je krijgt de ruimte om te leren, te experimenteren en nieuwe ideeën in te brengen, altijd met aandacht voor de nieuwste AI-ontwikkelingen en persoonlijke begeleiding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wie ben jij? &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent een 3e- of 4e-jaars hbo/wo-student in een relevante richting zoals Marketing, Communicatie, Commerciële Economie of Business Innovation;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent beschikbaar vanaf januari/februari 2027 voor een periode van minimaal 5 maanden;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je kunt minimaal 4 dagen per week meewerken;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent zelfstandig, communicatief vaardig en je floreert in een dynamische omgeving;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent integer, betrouwbaar en hebt een open, proactieve houding;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je werkt nauwkeurig, gestructureerd en beheerst de Nederlandse en Engelse taal uitstekend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat bieden wij?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Een stagevergoeding van €450 per maand op basis van een fulltime stage;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Persoonlijke 1-op 1 begeleiding van een ervaren collega om jezelf optimaal te ontwikkelen;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Een open, informele werksfeer waarin iedereen zichzelf kan zijn en waar jouw input telt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Toegang tot een groot internationaal netwerk vol kansen;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Een dynamische werkplek waar je kunt samenwerken op onze bruisende kantoren in Eindhoven en Amsterdam.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ben jij klaar voor een leerzame en &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;uitdagende&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;stage&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;waarin&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;je&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;écht&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;impact&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;kunt&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;maken?&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;We&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;maken&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;graag&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;kennis&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;met&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;je.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;Solliciteer&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;nu!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let op: voor al onze stages geldt dat je gedurende jouw gehele stageperiode ingeschreven moet staan bij een opleidingsinstituut.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Samsara (NYSE: IOT) is the pioneer of the Connected Operations™ Cloud, which is a platform that enables organizations that depend on physical operations to harness Internet of Things (IoT) data to develop actionable insights and improve their operations. At Samsara, we are helping improve the safety, efficiency and sustainability of the physical operations that power our global economy. Representing more than 40% of global GDP, these industries are the infrastructure of our planet, including agriculture, construction, field services, transportation, and manufacturing — and we are excited to help digitally transform their operations at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Working at Samsara means you’ll help define the future of physical operations and be on a team that’s shaping an exciting array of product solutions, including Video-Based Safety, Vehicle Telematics, Apps and Driver Workflows, and Equipment Monitoring. As part of a recently public company, you’ll have the autonomy and support to make an impact as we build for the long term.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Samsara is a leader in a dynamic market. As a public company listed on the NYSE with $2.1B in ARR, we deliver mission-critical solutions to physical operations globally. This position is tailored for high-performing professionals seeking to accelerate their professional growth. We are seeking account managers to oversee deal sizes ranging from €10k to €300k across a comprehensive suite of 15+ product solutions, engaging key decision-makers including Finance Directors and Managing Directors. Joining our team offers the autonomy and support to tackle challenging objectives and drive impactful results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While this position offers remote flexibility across the Netherlands, periodic travel to meet clients on-site is expected (typically bi-weekly).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You should apply if:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want to help define the future of physical operations: Your contributions will directly enable real-world impact—supporting critical infrastructure, streamlining supply chains, and advancing workforce safety.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You prioritize continuous prospecting: Physical operations encompass wide-ranging sectors where contacts are often mobile. Top sales reps actively identify prospective organizations and build meaningful pipeline connection points.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess deep curiosity about diverse business models: You will explore various physical sectors, from field services to manufacturing and food distribution, striving to understand operational details at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are committed to continuous learning: Navigating our cloud platform involves mastering new operational domains and solutions, requiring dedicated focus to achieve long-term growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You foster authentic long-term partnerships: Many target organizations are transitioning from legacy methods to modern cloud technology. Earning long-term trust is core to helping them digitally transform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive on high-performing teams: Working at Samsara means being part of a team dedicated to excellence and pushing boundaries as we build for the future.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive revenue acquisition: Take ownership of net-new customer growth by generating 80-90% of your opportunity pipeline through outbound efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expand key regional markets: Contribute to the growth of our mid-market segment across the Benelux region, leveraging expanding regional momentum.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage structured methodologies: Utilize professional sales frameworks such as MEDDPICC and Command the Message to effectively guide customer engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Requirements for the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales background: Minimum. 18 months closing experience within a proactive SaaS outreach model, demonstrating independent PG/pipeline generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistent quota achievement: Demonstrated performance exceeding targets within complex technology environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complex deal navigation: Ability to manage multi-stakeholder evaluations and technical proofs-of-concept effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language proficiency: Native-level fluency in Dutch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advantageous:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operational interest: Eagerness to discover how physical operations function across sectors to better address customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured methodology: A disciplined sales practice focused on consistent activity execution to produce predictable results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical focus: A data-informed mindset toward managing pipeline volume, discovery quality, and multi-threading for accurate forecasting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptability and growth: A proactive focus on continuous learning, incorporating feedback, and refining tactics over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;The compensation range shown spans approved pay zones for this role. Your primary work location determines the range applicable to you, which may be narrower than the full range displayed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Annual on-target earnings (OTE) range for full-time employees for this position is below and depends on your city of residence. Learn more about our total rewards and benefits below.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual OTE Salary&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€132.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€132.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Total Rewards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Samsara, we build for the people who keep the global economy moving. We want owners, not passengers, which is why &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.samsara.com/company/careers/benefits&quot;&gt;our rewards&lt;/a&gt; are designed to fuel high-impact builders. Our compensation program delivers above-market total compensation through a combination of base salary, performance-based bonus/variable pay, and equity (for eligible roles) in a high-growth public company. We meaningfully differentiate pay for our top performers, who have the opportunity to earn above-market compensation that can outpace the broader market over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond compensation, we provide the foundations that enable long-term success: a flexible, employee-led remote model, a professional development stipend, comprehensive health and parental leave plans, and more. If you’re ready to build for the long term and own the outcome, your journey starts here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Working&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Samsara, we embrace a flexible working model that caters to the diverse needs of our teams. Our offices are open for those who prefer to work in-person and we also support remote work where it aligns with our operational requirements. For certain positions, being close to one of our offices or within a specific geographic area is important to facilitate collaboration, access to resources, or alignment with our service regions. In these cases, the job description will clearly indicate any working location requirements. Our goal is to ensure that all members of our team can contribute effectively, whether they are working on-site, in a hybrid model, or fully remotely. All offers of employment are contingent upon an individual’s ability to secure and maintain the legal right to work at the company and in the specified work location, if applicable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Belonging at Samsara&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Samsara, we welcome everyone regardless of their background. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, national origin, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, protected veteran status, disability, age, and other characteristics protected by law. We depend on the unique approaches of our team members to help us solve complex problems and want to ensure that Samsara is a place where people from all backgrounds can make an impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Samsara is an inclusive work environment, and we are committed to ensuring equal opportunity in employment for qualified persons with disabilities. Please email &lt;a ---------- or &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/DrM6DFQUiSgfPtCVA&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; if you require any reasonable accommodations throughout the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Authenticity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use &lt;a href=&quot;https://hiretofu.com/privacyPolicy&quot;&gt;Tofu&lt;/a&gt;, a fraud detection tool, to validate the authenticity of applications and protect against identity fraud. This ensures we are connecting with real people and allows us to prioritize genuine candidates. Please see Samsara’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.samsara.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraudulent Employment Offers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Samsara is aware of scams involving fake job interviews and offers. Please know we do not charge fees to applicants at any stage of the hiring process. Official communication about your application will only come from emails ending in ----- ----- or ----- For more information regarding fraudulent employment offers, please visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://samsara.com/blog/avoiding-fake-job-offers&quot;&gt;blog post here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Afgestudeerd? What’s next? Stap in bij het HSO Young Professional Program! Kickstart je IT-carrière ! Klaar voor de reis? Join the journey to explore!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Start jouw carrière als Functioneel Consultant bij HSO en geef je toekomst een vliegende start op 1 maart 2027. In ons Young Professional Program ontwikkel je jezelf razendsnel tot een specialist in Microsoft Dynamics 365 Customer Engagement (CE), met AI als jouw versnellingsmotor.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Jouw start bij HSO&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Je begint met een vijfweekse Masterclass waarin je alles leert over Dynamics 365 CE, Microsoft-technologie en de nieuwste ontwikkelingen op het gebied van AI en automatisering. Je traint op zowel technische vaardigheden als soft skills, zoals klantgericht adviseren, samenwerken en communiceren. Na afronding behaal je je officiële Microsoft-certificering.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Snel aan de slag bij topklanten&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Na de Masterclass ga je direct aan de slag binnen een ervaren projectteam. Je werkt mee aan digitale transformaties bij klanten als Rituals, Royal BAM en Heineken. Als Functioneel Consultant analyseer je bedrijfsprocessen, vertaal je klantbehoeften naar slimme oplossingen, implementeer je Dynamics 365 CE en begeleid je klanten bij adoptie en optimalisatie van AI-tools zoals Copilot. Jij bent de verbindende schakel tussen business en technologie.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Groei in je eigen tempo&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Je staat er nooit alleen voor. Je krijgt begeleiding van een senior consultant, ondersteuning van je manager en een leertraject via de HSO Academy. Je groeit van Trainee naar Junior Consultant en kunt daarna doorgroeien naar Medior of zelfs Lead Consultant – afhankelijk van jouw ambitie, bijvoorbeeld richting AI-integratie, procesoptimalisatie of klantstrategie.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat breng jij mee?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Een afgeronde hbo- of wo-opleiding (bijv. in bedrijfskunde, bedrijfseconomie of ICT);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Affiniteit met technologie en interesse in AI;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sterke analytische en communicatieve vaardigheden;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nieuwsgierigheid, leergierigheid en ambitie;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Goede beheersing van zowel Nederlands als Engels;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Beschikbaarheid per 1 maart 2027.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat krijg je van ons?&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Een goede startsalaris;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leaseauto of mobiliteitsvergoeding van €675;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Laptop en smartphone van de zaak;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybride werken: thuis, op kantoor of zelfs tijdens een workation;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vitaliteitsbudget (€65 netto), deelname aan het leasefietsplan en 25 vakantiedagen (plus de optie om 10 extra dagen bij te kopen);&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pensioenregeling bij BeFrank;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Onbeperkte groeimogelijkheden via de HSO Academy en GoodHabitz.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Waarom HSO?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Bij HSO werk je in een internationale en innovatieve omgeving waar initiatief wordt gewaardeerd. Je leert verschillende sectoren kennen, werkt met collega’s van diverse nationaliteiten en bouwt aan échte impact. En natuurlijk is er ook ruimte voor plezier: teamuitjes, zomerborrels op het dakterras, sportactiviteiten en maatschappelijk betrokken initiatieven.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solliciteren &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Enthousiast? Heb je vragen vooraf? &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Neem contact op met Joseph via&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----- -----
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Workato&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;Workato is the leading Control and Execution Platform for Enterprise AI — the neutral platform enterprises trust to put AI to work across their business. Workato unifies data, applications, and processes into a single platform so AI can reliably orchestrate business processes in production at enterprise scale. Built on more than a decade of running mission-critical processes for over half the Fortune 500 — including Nasdaq, Amazon, Cisco, Vodafone, Atlassian, and Lucid Motors — Workato turns over 14,000 enterprise systems AI needs to act on into one governed execution layer. For more information, visit &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.workato.com/&quot; data-tooltip-link-label=&quot;undefined&quot;&gt;workato.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;Ultimately, Workato believes in fostering a &lt;strong&gt;flexible, trust-oriented culture that empowers everyone to take full ownership of their roles&lt;/strong&gt;. We are driven by &lt;strong&gt;innovation &lt;/strong&gt;and looking for&lt;strong&gt; team players &lt;/strong&gt;who want to actively build our company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;But, we also believe in &lt;strong&gt;balancing productivity with self-care&lt;/strong&gt;. That’s why we offer all of our employees a vibrant and dynamic work environment &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot; href=&quot;http://www.workato.com/careers&quot;&gt;along with a multitude of benefits&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; they can enjoy inside and outside of their work lives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;If this sounds right up your alley, please submit an application. We look forward to getting to know you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;Also, feel free to check out why:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.businessinsider.com/47-enterprise-startups-to-bet-your-career-on-in-2020-2019-12&quot;&gt;Business Insider&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; named us an “enterprise startup to bet your career on”&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.forbes.com/cloud100/#a57477b5f941&quot;&gt;Forbes’ Cloud 100&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; recognized us as one of the top 100 private cloud companies in the world&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot; href=&quot;https://www2.deloitte.com/us/en/pages/technology-media-and-telecommunications/articles/fast500-winners.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;Deloitte Tech Fast 500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; ranked us as the 17th fastest growing tech company in the Bay Area, and 96th in North America&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot; href=&quot;https://qz.com/work/2053446/the-best-companies-for-working-from-home/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;Quartz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; ranked us the #1 best company for remote workers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re growing quickly in the Benelux, and we’re hiring Account Executives to grow with us. You’d be joining a team that’s still working out how the region should look, so there’s a lot of room to shape it. You’ll have real say in how we approach accounts, who we work with, and how we build our presence here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work closely with colleagues across sales, solutions, partnerships and customer success, and with our GSI partners. If you like building relationships that last, and you’d rather help shape a plan than follow one handed to you, we’d love to talk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ve done&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve spent around 8 years selling to businesses, ideally enterprise SaaS or technology, and you know how a complex deal moves through a big organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You hit your number, and you can talk through how you did it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve owned customer relationships beyond the signature, and you still hear from your customers years later.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve worked alongside GSIs and know that a good partner relationship takes time, trust and being useful to each other.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve found new business in tech without waiting for leads to arrive, through outbound, community, or whichever route worked.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re at home in Salesforce and LinkedIn Sales Navigator, and you use your tools to save time rather than to fill a dashboard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Can you relate to the above?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in the Netherlands, with fluent Dutch and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we hope you’re like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;You are an enthusiastic, energetic team player who is comfortable working in a fast-paced and evolving environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You care about doing good work and you’re consistent about it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’d like to help build something new and see your impact, rather than slot into a big company with fixed ways of doing things&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re curious and like working through a problem with others to find a good way forward&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You stay calm and organised when priorities pull in different directions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can work well with a large team spread across locations to win and grow enterprise accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re honest and thoughtful in how you treat prospects and customers, and you bring your values to the way you work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our process has four stages, including a panel interview, so you’ll meet several of the people you’d be working with. We’ll explain what to expect at each step, and you’re welcome to ask us anything along the way. This is a hybrid position, does require you to attend our Amsterdam office&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WeWork - Strawinskylaan 4117, 1077 &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;ZX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Amsterdam, Netherlands&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is a full time position&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Veeam is the Data and AI Trust Company, specializing in helping organizations ensure their data and AI are fully understood, secured, and resilient to enable the acceleration of safe AI at scale. As the market leader in both data resilience and data security posture management, Veeam is built for the convergence of identity, data, security, and AI risk. Headquartered in Seattle with offices in more than 30 countries, Veeam protects over 550,000 customers worldwide, who trust Veeam to keep their businesses running. Join us as we go fearlessly forward together, growing, learning, and making a real impact for some of the world’s biggest brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;About the Role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Senior Account Executive, Enterprise &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;will be responsible for developing/closing business with a number of private / public accounts in their assigned account list through working with the partner sales community. The primary focus is aimed at closing sales opportunities and is achieved by collaborating with partners to identify, develop, accelerate, up-sell and close transactions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Develop and close business with within the public sector &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Leverage partners to close sales with their end customers&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Cold calls to develop sales activities with a large number of new mid-market and high-segment accounts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Up-sell and cross-sell to the existing private customer base&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Forecasts and account/opportunity details in Salesforce&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Propose, coordinate and participate to marketing activities in the territory&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
