&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programming:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Software engineering proficiency in Python sufficient to build production-grade, reliable systems rather than research prototypes; familiarity with C++ is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems-Level Thinking:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Ability to reason about how a decision at one pipeline stage — what data is collected — affects outcomes at another, such as model performance or evaluation results, and to design across those boundaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
