&lt;li&gt;Fluent &lt;strong&gt;English and French, &lt;/strong&gt;another European language would be highly appreciated.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;expertise&lt;/strong&gt; in one of the following domains is a plus: Electronic Trading, Pricing, Low Latency, Market Making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Salary Range : €70,000 - €90,000 gross annual fixed salary, depending on profile and experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
