&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join our &lt;strong&gt;London&lt;/strong&gt; team. In this role, you’ll lead initiatives within our Network Efficiency area, turning complex logistics challenges into competitive advantages that speed up deliveries and fuel global growth.&lt;/p&gt;
