&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Agility:&lt;/strong&gt; A proactive approach to problem-solving and the ability to thrive in a dynamic, fast-paced setting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; A team player who can work across functions to deliver complex, multi-layered projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
