&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;As a Senior Security Engineer at Capco, you&#39;ll lead hands-on security engineering delivery for clients across financial services and other complex environments. Depending on the engagement, you&#39;ll lead a technical workstream or operate independently as a Principal specialist. Your focus will span Application &amp;amp; Product Security, Cloud &amp;amp; Platform Security and DevSecOps, underpinned by strong security automation. You&#39;ll combine specialist depth with cross-domain judgement, client engagement and secure-by-design engineering.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
