&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;Any information you submit to Datadog as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Datadog’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. For information on our AI policy, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/interviewing-at-datadog-ai-guidelines/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Interviewing at Datadog AI Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;215&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9c03ffd59c47&quot;&gt;Datadog&#39;s client SDKs run inside our customers&#39; mobile apps and websites, and every Datadog client-side product depends on them, including Real User Monitoring, Session Replay, Product Analytics, and Feature Flags. We maintain 11 open source SDKs across Browser, iOS, Android, React Native, Flutter, Kotlin Multiplatform, Unity, and more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;556&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8f8d86b9cd1f&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;558&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d4b51c5266b7&quot;&gt;As the Engineering Manager for Client SDKs, you&#39;ll build and lead the team that makes it easy for any team at Datadog to ship into those SDKs safely: fast CI, predictable releases, a shared spec across SDKs, and tooling that lets engineers and coding agents contribute without waiting on a review queue. It&#39;s a rare chance to own a developer platform that ships in public, at a scale where small decisions reach a lot of customers, and to shape how Datadog builds client-side products in the AI-native era. Both the team and its scope are expanding, so there&#39;s plenty of room to grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1144&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c6a69a6751f3&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1146&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7aef1bb028d2&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture - the relationships and collaboration it builds and the creativity it brings to the table. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our Datadogs can create a work-life harmony that best fits them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1395&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2018ed9e7108&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1397&quot; data-local-id=&quot;19ac52ea1d4c&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;141c414110d1&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1416&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c0fdb6d9afd1&quot;&gt;Build, lead, and grow a team of mostly senior software engineers, hiring well and helping senior and staff engineers grow their impact and careers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1566&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4a242ca8649a&quot;&gt;Own CI and test infrastructure across the SDK repositories: set health targets, detect and quarantine flaky tests, and provide test frameworks that engineers and coding agents can run locally&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1761&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7485705fd393&quot;&gt;Define release cadences and help customers adopt updates, managing breaking changes in SDKs that can&#39;t be rolled back once they&#39;re installed in customers&#39; apps&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1924&quot; data-local-id=&quot;910ec1935dd3&quot;&gt;Keep SDKs consistent through a shared specification, and remove the review bottleneck so product teams can ship SDK changes without waiting on a small group of experts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2095&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a941ea74f856&quot;&gt;Partner with product teams such as Session Replay, Product Analytics, and Feature Flags, along with our SDK guilds and server SDK teams, to guide SDK changes from design to release&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2279&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fde46df16714&quot;&gt;Build feature sets for new product capabilities and bring that to all partner teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2366&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2c15a2e5b523&quot;&gt;Bring AI coding agents into how the team builds, tests, and ships, and take part in business-hours release, hotfix, and support escalation duty (no 24/7 pager)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2529&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a154eb3d9162&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2531&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e7336f270387&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bd5f1f663f52&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2547&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d18e4c59eab6&quot;&gt;Experienced in managing a team of software engineers, including senior engineers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2631&quot; data-local-id=&quot;91c82112ab4d&quot;&gt;Someone who has shipped and maintained SDKs, libraries, or developer tools that other engineers depend on&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2740&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0f502495afba&quot;&gt;Strong in at least one of Mobile Platforms, including iOS (Swift), Android (Kotlin) , or Browser (TypeScript), and able to hold a technical conversation about applications development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2928&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0bacffec9a99&quot;&gt;Knowledgeable in release engineering, CI/CD, versioning, and backwards compatibility&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3016&quot; data-local-id=&quot;94160173fd68&quot;&gt;Able to influence other teams without formal authority and build alignment across product teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3115&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f587adedd83c&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3117&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c98fe3fc2480&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bef6e5397bc7&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3134&quot; data-local-id=&quot;25713b294804&quot;&gt;Open source maintainer experience, especially working with outside contributors&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3217&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ef825088643d&quot;&gt;Experience with observability, crash reporting, analytics, or OpenTelemetry SDKs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3301&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c9b9946205e4&quot;&gt;Familiarity with cross-platform frameworks such as React Native, Flutter, or Kotlin Multiplatform&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3402&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ce33da2914cf&quot;&gt;Experience leading a platform or developer experience team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3464&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bd27dcb74eb7&quot;&gt;Experience using AI coding agents in your team&#39;s workflow&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3525&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d106fa4dc176&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3527&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e27094c5e265&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Datadog values people from all walks of life. We understand not everyone will meet all the above qualifications on day one. That&#39;s okay. If you&#39;re passionate about technology and want to grow your skills, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3760&quot; data-local-id=&quot;98c851609893&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3762&quot; data-local-id=&quot;74f111f0c8b0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Benefits and Growth:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b13c1d91020d&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3786&quot; data-local-id=&quot;25cbf3d64113&quot;&gt;New hire stock equity (RSUs) and employee stock purchase plan (ESPP)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3858&quot; data-local-id=&quot;542e5be0e979&quot;&gt;Continuous professional development, product training, and career pathing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3935&quot; data-local-id=&quot;63c0f0599d45&quot;&gt;Intradepartmental mentor and buddy program for in-house networking&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4005&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ca2d33d5b4c8&quot;&gt;An inclusive company culture, ability to join our Community Guilds (Datadog employee resource groups)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4110&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fa41c9647038&quot;&gt;Access to Inclusion Talks, our internal panel discussions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4171&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7eb8187d4a2c&quot;&gt;Free, global mental health benefits for employees and dependents age 6+&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4246&quot; data-local-id=&quot;cdde6437677e&quot;&gt;Competitive global benefits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4277&quot; data-local-id=&quot;96a4fec5882c&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4279&quot; data-local-id=&quot;aa89bb81a3a4&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Benefits and Growth listed above may vary based on the country of your employment and the nature of your employment with Datadog.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: white;&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Datadog:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is the leading observability and security platform for the AI era, providing businesses with unified visibility across the technology stack to manage complexity at scale. It brings applications, infrastructure, data, models, and security into one place, using AI to detect and resolve issues before they impact customers. Trusted globally by Fortune 500 companies and high-growth AI leaders, Datadog enables businesses to move faster with clarity and confidence. Learn more about #DatadogLife on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/datadoghq/?hl=en&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/datadog&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn,&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.datadoghq.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Datadog Learning Center. &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;215&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity at Datadog:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is proud to offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;equal employment opportunity&lt;/a&gt; to everyone regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity, veteran status, and other characteristics protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements. Here are our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/candidate-legal-notices/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Legal Notices&lt;/a&gt; for your reference.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog endeavors to make our Careers Page accessible to all users. If you would like to contact us regarding the accessibility of our website or need assistance completing the application process, please complete &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeoJeduEZ2NdZF_65uZmWUrCM-zee7yADXX1s6Xr9zAGq8iKA/viewform&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;this form&lt;/a&gt;. This form is for accommodation requests only and cannot be used to inquire about the status of applications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Privacy and AI Guidelines:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;Any information you submit to Datadog as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Datadog’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. For information on our AI policy, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/interviewing-at-datadog-ai-guidelines/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Interviewing at Datadog AI Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;Why Verifone&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more than 40 years Verifone has established a remarkable record of leadership in the electronic payment technology industry. Verifone has one of the leading electronic payment solutions brands and is one of the largest providers of electronic payment systems worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verifone has a diverse, dynamic and fast paced work environment in which employees are focused on results and have opportunities to excel. We take pride in the fact that we work with leading retailers, merchants, banks, and third party partners to invent and deliver innovative payments solution around the world. We strive for excellence in our products and services, and are obsessed with customer happiness. Across the globe, Verifone employees are leading the payments industry through experience, innovation, and an ambitious spirit. Whether it’s developing the next platform of secure payment systems or searching for new ways to bring electronic payments to new markets, the team at Verifone is dedicated to the success of our customers, partners and investors. It is this passion for innovation that drives each one of our employees for personal and professional success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Verifone is proudly an in-office work culture as we see immense benefits to career development and business results from our colleagues being physically co-located. Currently,&amp;nbsp;we do allow a hybrid work schedule but we regularly revisit our attendance policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;What&#39;s Exciting About The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re searching a &lt;strong&gt;Marketing Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to execute Verifone’s marketing strategy in France and play a pivotal role in accelerating our growth in one of Europe’s most dynamic payments markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Marketing Manager, you’ll be the engine behind France’s marketing performance: building the systems, dashboards, and processes that power smarter decisions, stronger campaigns, and measurable commercial impact. You’ll lead both day‑to‑day execution and long‑term strategy, ensuring our brand, messaging, and demand generation efforts land with precision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll own the full marketing funnel - from awareness and acquisition to retention and installed‑base growth and you’ll bring hands‑on expertise in marketing automation, lead nurturing, and multi‑channel campaign orchestration. Email, digital, content, events… you know how to blend them into high‑performing programs that generate qualified leads and fuel sales momentum.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role carries clear accountability: hitting France’s lead targets, elevating lead quality and conversion, enriching data, automating processes, and delivering sharp reporting across programs and channels. Your work will directly influence pipeline, performance, and ROI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, manage and implement marketing programs and strategies for Verifone France and Paybox&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and update the Verifone Regional websites (Including Paybox): website maintenance, supervising the creation and development of websites, including creating specification documents to improve the website and other online projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the advertising campaigns and the relationship with the agency, including creating lists of keywords that define campaigns, creating and testing ads/banners specific for targeted verticals, set-up and monitor end to end lead tracking (sources/channels)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Obsess about results: analyze site traffic and website flows, conversion optimization campaign results, analyze and report program performance; report metrics appropriately and flag issues for internal stakeholders, provide recommendations for improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Propose new marketing strategies and implement new ideas that can improve overall funnel performance, from brand awareness to client retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and manage email nurture flows and/or drip programs for both prospects and existing customers to support sales growth and retention, and implement the tracking of these flows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with multiple teams for developing an effective strategy and new programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;Skills and Experience We Desire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native French speaker with advanced English proficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in marketing, business, or a related field, with strong foundations in modern digital marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience leading integrated, multi‑channel marketing campaigns across digital, content, email, and events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands‑on mastery of key platforms, including &lt;span data-url=&quot;ca://s?q=Explain_marketing_automation_tools&quot;&gt;marketing automation tools&lt;/span&gt; (Pardot, Marketo, etc.), &lt;span data-url=&quot;ca://s?q=What_is_a_CRM_and_how_is_it_used&quot;&gt;CRMs&lt;/span&gt; such as Salesforce or Pipedrive, Google Analytics, social platforms (Facebook, Instagram), and email marketing systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced analytical capability to manage complex lead lifecycles, optimize funnel performance, and extract insights from data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills to coordinate cross‑functional initiatives and deliver high‑impact marketing programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up‑to‑date knowledge of industry trends, emerging technologies, and modern marketing best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SEM‑focused copywriting skills to craft compelling, conversion‑driven search content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of HTML for landing page and email optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert‑level Excel skills, including large dataset handling and macro‑based automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive in suggesting new concepts/ideas, self-motivated, fast learner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-oriented and problem-solving attitude (use analytical and creative thinking to find solutions)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Results-oriented, great attention to detail, openness to testing and analyzing large volumes of data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication: ability to cooperate and work fairly with others, at all levels, within and outside the company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple projects and work under tight deadlines when necessary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;Our Commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verifone is committed to creating a diverse environment and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetics, disability, age, or veteran status. Verifone is also committed to compliance with all fair employment practices regarding citizenship and immigration status.&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JOB RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain tool uptime and ensure excellent execution of installation and support of hardware issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, maintain, and ensure the relevance of technical information used by internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand and build long-term innovative global technology systems that enable enhanced customer relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure communication vehicles, e.g. telephone, email, and presentation, etc. are able to facilitate efficient and consistent customer follow-up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive continuous improvement of the customer experience through team, hardware, software, and support tool development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive and manage new product installs and subsequent hardware development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Projects manage new evaluations and ensure the success of the project.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional assigned tasks when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business travel is required when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;REQUIREMENTS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Engineering discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success in building collaborative partnerships with customers and internal stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in a team environment with tight deadlines and multiple priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;English language fluency is required as you will be working with international clients and customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today to be part of what’s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make the tech that enables the chips in devices which improve lives around the world. We do this with an eye to the future, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible through cutting-edge innovation, and driving the next wave of technological breakthroughs that shape how we live, work, and connect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;To learn more about ASM, find us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.asm.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;asm.com&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/asm/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/ASMOfficialCompany&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/asmofficialcompany/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/ASMofficialco&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/c/ASM_Official&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;ASM is an equal opportunity employer and considers qualified applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, age, nationality, social or ethnic origin, sexual orientation, gender, gender identify or expression, marital status, pregnancy, political affiliation, disability, genetic information, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://foundation.mozilla.org/en/&quot;&gt;Mozilla Foundation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;is a non-profit building a better technology future — powered by people, open by design, fueled by imagination.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We deliver people-first alternatives to today’s extractive systems. We build side by side with developers, innovators and advocates, united in the belief that a better technology future is not only possible — it’s ours to create!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mozillafoundation.org/en/meet-mozilla/nabiha-syed/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our CEO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; is increasingly focused outward on the Board, funders, partners, and public conversations that will shape the Foundation’s next chapter. This newly created Chief of Staff role exists to extend the CEO’s reach inside the organization and make that outward focus possible.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Reporting directly to the CEO, you’ll serve as the CEO’s strategic partner, internal proxy and trusted extension of their leadership. You’ll hold the CEO’s strategic agenda, translate the CEO’s priorities into organizational alignment, represent the CEO internally where needed, and make decisions on the CEO’s behalf within clearly delegated authority. You’ll determine what reaches the CEO, prepare the CEO for consequential moments, and escalate only what requires the CEO’s judgment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;As a member of the Executive Leadership Team, you’ll partner strategically with other members of the ELT and work closely with the CEO’s Executive Program Manager to make sure the CEO’s time, priorities, and commitments stay aligned and moving.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You’ll also partner with the Foundation’s Investment Committee and its technical and strategic advisors, keeping their focus on the right questions, their recommendations aligned with the Foundation’s strategic priorities, and decisions moving efficiently from evaluation to funding.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Here’s what you’ll likely be focused on for the &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;first 6 months&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Building a strong working partnership with the CEO, aligning on priorities, ways of working and clearly defining the scope of your delegated authority.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Establishing a trusted partnership with each member of the Executive Leadership Team, learning their priorities, pressures and ways of working.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Developing a deep, cross-functional understanding of the Foundation’s work and how each function connects to the CEO’s priorities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Translating the CEO’s priorities into a concise, clear set of strategic outcomes that leaders understand and can use to guide the decisions they own, with a current view of what’s changing and which decisions are approaching.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Defining with the CEO what truly requires their attention, and ensuring issues reach them decision-ready, with context, options and a recommendation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Getting up to speed with the Investment Committee and its advisors, and helping keep their focus on the right questions so decisions move efficiently from evaluation to funding.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As the Chief of Staff to Mozilla Foundation’s CEO, you will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Serve as the CEO’s thought partner in developing, pressure-testing and refining strategic priorities, synthesizing executive insight and external developments to anticipate what will need to be known or decided in the next 30, 60 and 90 days.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Direct the CEO’s time toward strategy, external relationships, development, Board leadership and the Foundation’s highest-consequence decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Filter rather than forward, so significant shifts in strategy, material risks, major budget decisions and Board-level matters reach the CEO early, with context, options and a recommendation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Maintain a current view of the CEO’s top priorities, identify where work is drifting from strategic intent, and surface conflicts in priorities, resources or attention before they become emergencies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Enable the Executive Leadership Team to operate as one team around the CEO’s priorities, so the right issues reach the ELT at the right level and decisions and commitments are followed through.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Partner with ELT members on cross-functional issues that need CEO-level alignment but not the CEO’s direct involvement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Represent the CEO’s position in internal discussions and make decisions on the CEO’s behalf within delegated authority, bringing anything beyond it back to the CEO promptly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Ensure the CEO enters every Board meeting, funder and partner conversation, speech and public engagement fully prepared, with concise briefings, organizational context and answers to likely questions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Identify external opportunities that warrant the CEO’s attention, and ensure commitments the CEO makes externally translate into clear internal follow-through.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Steward alignment between the Investment Committee’s work and the Foundation’s strategy: keep its technical and strategic advisors focused on the right questions, surface gaps, risks or competing views, and bring forward matters that need the CEO’s judgment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What this role is not&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This is a role of influence. It exists to ensure the CEO can lead effectively through the Executive Leadership Team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The Chief of Staff does not manage the Executive Leadership Team or run the Foundation’s operations. Each executive leader owns execution and decisions within their area.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This role does not make decisions beyond the authority the CEO has delegated. Anything outside that authority returns to the CEO.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This role does not have any direct reports and also doesn’t manage the CEO’s calendar, scheduling or administrative support.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Professional Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Significant, verifiable experience as a strategic partner at CEO or executive-team level, with a track record of leading high-stakes work and turning ambiguity into structure and action.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Experience working across multiple legal entities is a plus, including navigating differences, building influence, and coordinating work across entities where relevant.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A proven record of driving complex, cross-functional priorities from idea to execution by defining outcomes, ownership, milestones and decision points.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Exceptional judgment and discretion, including handling confidential information and navigating complex executive dynamics with integrity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to influence without formal authority, build trust across functions and at the most senior levels, and give direct feedback with care.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Outstanding written and verbal communication, with experience distilling complex information into decision-ready briefs, recommendations, presentations and executive communications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Strong analytical and strategic problem-solving skills: you frame the right question, gather the right information, test assumptions and recommend a practical path forward.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Disciplined prioritization, with the agility to move between long-term priorities and time-sensitive issues without losing the thread.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Direct experience supporting Board governance, fundraising or other high-stakes external relationships at an executive level.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A track record of doing high-impact work out of the spotlight, measuring your success by the CEO’s and the team’s, and acting in the best interests of the CEO and the organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A demonstrated commitment to Mozilla Foundation’s mission and to building an open, accessible and trustworthy internet.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The ability to work across time zones and occasionally outside standard working hours for Board meetings, major events or urgent organizational needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comfortable traveling for Board meetings, leadership gatherings and major events.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We Are Excited To See Any Additional Experience With:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Senior roles in nonprofit, philanthropic, technology or public-interest organizations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Supporting or advising investment, grantmaking or funding committees.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A few things that are true about how we work at Mozilla Foundation. Here&#39;s a summary along with our expectation of how these should show up in this role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Move toward the hard thing&lt;/strong&gt;: you surface conflicts in priorities, resources or attention early, and give the CEO and executives direct, actionable input, including what they may not want to hear. You disagree constructively in the room, not afterward, and you don’t wait for someone else to raise it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay curious and current&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;you stay close to what executives are seeing and what’s happening in our fields and communities, and turn it into the context the CEO needs. You pressure-test assumptions, including your own.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work in the open&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;you document decisions and the reasoning behind them, so executives and teams can follow how and why priorities are set. You favor shared channels over side conversations wherever appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Focus and finish&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;you keep the CEO’s agenda focused on what matters most, make deliberate choices about what does and doesn’t need the CEO, and make sure decisions and commitments are seen through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flex with purpose&lt;/strong&gt;: you move between long-term priorities and time-sensitive issues as context shifts, and adapt how you work with each executive. Flexibility isn’t about being agreeable; it’s staying responsive while holding to the mission and the CEO’s priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead with care&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;you hold a high bar for the work while treating people as whole humans. You extend good faith to fellow executives, respect that each owns their area, and talk directly to the person who can solve the problem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Salary and Benefits Information&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mozilla Foundation is dedicated to fair and equitable compensation for our staff. We aim to pay a competitive and market-based salary based on the responsibilities and requirements of the role. We do not ask for, or take into account, salary histories in our offer process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The starting salary ranges for this role are listed below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Germany: €206,448.00 – €232,253.22&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UK: £181,764.00 – £204,483.81&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Canada: $356,400.00 – $400,948.65&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;US: $264,000.00 – $296,999.00&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also offer the following benefits:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extended Sick Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global Employee Assistance Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement Plan contributions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid Time Off: 20 days annual leave + sick days and your birthday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company Holidays + EOY Shutdown&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional Development budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Top up program for Pregnancy and Parental leaves&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits are subject to change at any time at the discretion of Mozilla Foundation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Mozilla Foundation Hiring Practices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mozilla understands that valuing diverse creative practices and forms of knowledge are crucial to and enrich the company’s core mission. We encourage applications from everyone, including members of all equity-seeking communities, such as (but certainly not limited to) women, racialized and Indigenous persons, persons with disabilities, and persons of all sexual orientations and gender identities and expressions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will ensure that individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodation to participate in the job application or interview process, to perform essential job functions, and to receive other benefits and privileges of employment. Please contact us to request accommodation at -----
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-REMOTE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Cresta unlocks the true potential of the customer experience, turning every conversation into a competitive advantage. Cresta’s unified AI platform combines conversational AI agents, real-time human agent augmentation, and comprehensive conversation intelligence to drive revenue and efficiency gains across every channel. The world’s leading companies, including United Airlines, Cox Communications, and Marriott, use Cresta to power world-class customer experiences every day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Born from the Stanford AI Lab, Cresta has raised more than $270 million from the world’s leading investors, including a16z, Greylock, and Sequoia. Cresta’s leadership includes some of the leading minds in AI today. Our CEO, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/in/pingwu/&quot;&gt;Ping Wu&lt;/a&gt;, founded and led Google&#39;s Contact Center AI and Vertex AI platforms before joining Cresta to build the future of AI-driven customer experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over the next few years, AI is going to redefine how people all over the world interact with businesses every day. Come build that future at Cresta.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot; data-qa=&quot;job-description&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a diligent and detail-oriented Software Engineer in Test to join our engineering team in Berlin, Germany. This role will be crucial in ensuring the robustness, scalability, and high quality of our software solutions and will be highly focused on building, expanding, and maintaining our automated testing ecosystem.&amp;nbsp;While strong manual testing instincts are important, this role is designed for someone who will spend the majority of their time writing code, advancing automation, and developing internal tools. The ideal candidate is someone who can independently identify what and how to test, take ownership of impactful projects, and help elevate quality across the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Design, develop, and execute comprehensive test plans and test cases for new and existing features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Identify ambiguities or gaps in product specifications and propose improvements to ensure testability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Automate key scenarios using our Playwright-based test framework (TypeScript), with a focus on reliability and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Perform manual exploratory testing, particularly for complex, high-impact features or areas with low automation ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Analyze and communicate test results, triaging issues with clear, actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Maintain and evolve testing standards, procedures, and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Set up and manage testing environments to mirror production usage patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Investigate customer-reported issues, including log analysis (e.g., from Datadog/Grafana), reproduction steps, and severity assessment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Collaborate with developers and product managers to drive quality from feature design through release.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Contribute to release decisions with risk assessments and test coverage summaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Partner with cross-functional teams to elevate quality across the SDLC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Identify and advocate for opportunities to expand test coverage across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;BS/MS in Computer Science, Engineering, or equivalent technical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience in software QA within SaaS, preferably in customer engagement or contact center platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strong track record in creating and executing both manual and automated test strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Proficiency in automation frameworks (e.g., Playwright, Cypress) and modern development workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of QA methodologies, processes, and CI/CD practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Attention to detail with a bias toward risk-based testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strong problem-solving and debugging skills, including backend and frontend issue investigation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Ability to think like an end-user and test accordingly, especially when product requirements are minimal or evolving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Excellent communication skills and the confidence to constructively advocate for quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience mentoring peers or contributing to testing infrastructure is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compensation for this position includes a base salary, equity, and a variety of benefits. Actual salaries will be based on candidate-specific factors, including experience, skills, and location, as well as applicable local minimum pay requirements. We are actively hiring for this role in Berlin. For further details, please consult your recruiter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our use of AI in recruiting:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; We may use AI tools in our recruiting process, which require human review and oversight. If you have questions about our use of AI or wish to opt out, please contact &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a ----- ----- (if you are opting out, please use the subject ‘Opt-Out’ in your email).&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Recording &amp;amp; AI transcription:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; We do not authorize candidates to record or use AI transcription of any interview by phone, notetaker app, AI glasses, or other device. Candidates may request an exception or accommodation for review during the interview process as needed.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Recruiting impersonation scams:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; We have noticed a rise in recruiting impersonations across the industry, where scammers attempt to access candidates&#39; personal and financial information through fake interviews and offers. All Cresta recruiting email communications will always come from the ----- domain. Any outreach claiming to be from Cresta via other sources should be ignored.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Cresta unlocks the true potential of the customer experience, turning every conversation into a competitive advantage. Cresta’s unified AI platform combines conversational AI agents, real-time human agent augmentation, and comprehensive conversation intelligence to drive revenue and efficiency gains across every channel. The world’s leading companies, including United Airlines, Cox Communications, and Marriott, use Cresta to power world-class customer experiences every day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Born from the Stanford AI Lab, Cresta has raised more than $270 million from the world’s leading investors, including a16z, Greylock, and Sequoia. Cresta’s leadership includes some of the leading minds in AI today. Our CEO, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/in/pingwu/&quot;&gt;Ping Wu&lt;/a&gt;, founded and led Google&#39;s Contact Center AI and Vertex AI platforms before joining Cresta to build the future of AI-driven customer experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over the next few years, AI is going to redefine how people all over the world interact with businesses every day. Come build that future at Cresta.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;About the role:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior full-stack engineer, with a backend focus, you will be at the forefront of shaping the future of customer engagement! As we work towards our vision, you&#39;ll be instrumental in delivering timely, actionable insights that drive business growth from day one. We&#39;re building a state-of-the-art Customer Data Platform, visualizing relevant insights for businesses post-onboarding and guiding customer engagement across all touch-points. Be part of the team that&#39;s redefining the way businesses connect with their customers!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, implement, and maintain backend services and APIs to support applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and optimize data storage solutions using &lt;strong&gt;Postgres&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;ClickHouse&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Elasticsearch&lt;/strong&gt; to ensure high performance and scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams, including frontend engineers, data scientists, and machine learning engineers, to deliver end-to-end solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and troubleshoot performance issues in distributed systems and databases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clean, maintainable, and efficient code following best practices for backend development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in code reviews, testing, and continuous integration efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure security, scalability, and reliability of backend services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze and improve system architecture, focusing on performance bottlenecks, scaling, and security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications We Value:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience as a &lt;strong&gt;Backend Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; with a focus on database design and system architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in &lt;strong&gt;ClickHouse&lt;/strong&gt; or similar columnar databases for managing large-scale, real-time analytical queries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with &lt;strong&gt;Elasticsearch&lt;/strong&gt; for indexing and searching large datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in backend programming languages such as &lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Go&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with RESTful API design and development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of distributed systems, microservices architecture, and cloud infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with performance tuning, data modeling, and query optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and teamwork abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks &amp;amp; Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave to support you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly Health &amp;amp; Wellness allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from home office stipend to help you succeed in a remote environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch reimbursement for in-office employees&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PTO: 28 days in Germany&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compensation for this position includes a base salary, equity, and a variety of benefits. Actual base salaries will be based on candidate-specific factors, including experience, skillset, and location, and local minimum pay requirements as applicable. Your recruiter can provide further details.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our use of AI in recruiting:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; We may use AI tools in our recruiting process, which require human review and oversight. If you have questions about our use of AI or wish to opt out, please contact &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a ----- ----- (if you are opting out, please use the subject ‘Opt-Out’ in your email).&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Recording &amp;amp; AI transcription:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; We do not authorize candidates to record or use AI transcription of any interview by phone, notetaker app, AI glasses, or other device. Candidates may request an exception or accommodation for review during the interview process as needed.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Recruiting impersonation scams:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; We have noticed a rise in recruiting impersonations across the industry, where scammers attempt to access candidates&#39; personal and financial information through fake interviews and offers. All Cresta recruiting email communications will always come from the ----- domain. Any outreach claiming to be from Cresta via other sources should be ignored.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Cresta unlocks the true potential of the customer experience, turning every conversation into a competitive advantage. Cresta’s unified AI platform combines conversational AI agents, real-time human agent augmentation, and comprehensive conversation intelligence to drive revenue and efficiency gains across every channel. The world’s leading companies, including United Airlines, Cox Communications, and Marriott, use Cresta to power world-class customer experiences every day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Born from the Stanford AI Lab, Cresta has raised more than $270 million from the world’s leading investors, including a16z, Greylock, and Sequoia. Cresta’s leadership includes some of the leading minds in AI today. Our CEO, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/in/pingwu/&quot;&gt;Ping Wu&lt;/a&gt;, founded and led Google&#39;s Contact Center AI and Vertex AI platforms before joining Cresta to build the future of AI-driven customer experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over the next few years, AI is going to redefine how people all over the world interact with businesses every day. Come build that future at Cresta.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;About the role:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Cresta, the AI Agent team is on a mission to create state-of-the-art AI Agents that solve practical problems for our customers. We are focused on leveraging the latest technologies in Large Language Models (LLMs) and AI Agent systems, while ensuring that the solutions we develop are cost-effective, secure, and reliable.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an &lt;strong&gt;AI Agent Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll be at the forefront of deploying AI agents that address real-world challenges. In this role, you will work closely with customers as well as our software and machine learning engineers, ensuring high-impact AI Agent deployments and contributing to the continuous improvement of our core AI platform. You’ll develop intelligent AI agents, integrate them seamlessly with external systems and offer hands-on technical expertise to ensure successful deployments.. This position requires strong engineering skills, adaptability, and customer engagement. If you are self-driven, analytical, and eager to leverage AI in practical applications, this role is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do &lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Agent Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop, configure, deploy, and optimize AI agents using Cresta’s AI platform and tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Build AI agent integrations with external systems (APIs, databases, CRMs, etc.) to ensure seamless workflow integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Optimize AI agent performance (e.g. fine-tune prompts and configurations) and troubleshoot issues in complex enterprise environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements Gathering:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with customers and internal stakeholders to gather technical requirements and translate business needs into AI Agent solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demos &amp;amp; Iteration:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct interactive demos and present compelling proof-of-concepts to prospective customers, proactively gather feedback, and iteratively refine solutions to meet objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Coordination:&lt;/strong&gt; Define project milestones, create implementation plans, and coordinate execution with internal teams to ensure on-time delivery. Provide a tight feedback loop to our product and engineering teams — identifying gaps, building custom tooling, and influencing the roadmap through real-world deployment learnings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Cross-Functionally:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with PMs to define agent goals, iterate rapidly based on customer feedback, and shape product capabilities that maximize customer ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Guidance:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as a trusted technical advisor for the customer, guiding best practices for AI agent adoption and usage. Provide technical guidance on AI agent best practices, including architecture design, security considerations, and scalability planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education: &lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;3+ years of experience of full time working experience in software development/ consulting, AI/ML engineering, or system integration, or as FDE&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programming Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency in Python and Golang, with the ability to write clean, efficient code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI/ML Knowledge: &lt;/strong&gt;Familiarity with AI/ML concepts. Hands-on experience with large language models (LLMs), and prompt engineering techniques are strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Agent Frameworks: &lt;/strong&gt;Strong understanding of general AI agent frameworks, function calling, and retrieval-augmented generation (RAG). Hands-on experience of building such a system is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud &amp;amp; DevOps: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience with cloud platforms (AWS, GCP, or Azure) and DevOps practices (CI/CD, containerization, monitoring).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integration Expertise: &lt;/strong&gt;Hands-on experience with integrating systems via APIs, webhooks, and data pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent communication and project management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Approach: &lt;/strong&gt;Ability to use data-driven decision-making, including A/B testing and performance monitoring, to refine solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative Builder:&lt;/strong&gt; You thrive in cross-functional environments, working hand-in-hand with PMs and engineers to turn real customer problems into scalable AI solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compensation for this position includes a base salary, equity, and a variety of benefits. Actual base salaries will be based on candidate-specific factors, including experience, skillset, and location, and local minimum pay requirements as applicable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;This posting will be used to fill a newly-created role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our use of AI in recruiting:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; We may use AI tools in our recruiting process, which require human review and oversight. If you have questions about our use of AI or wish to opt out, please contact &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a ----- ----- (if you are opting out, please use the subject ‘Opt-Out’ in your email).&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Recording &amp;amp; AI transcription:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; We do not authorize candidates to record or use AI transcription of any interview by phone, notetaker app, AI glasses, or other device. Candidates may request an exception or accommodation for review during the interview process as needed.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Recruiting impersonation scams:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; We have noticed a rise in recruiting impersonations across the industry, where scammers attempt to access candidates&#39; personal and financial information through fake interviews and offers. All Cresta recruiting email communications will always come from the ----- domain. Any outreach claiming to be from Cresta via other sources should be ignored.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Grafana Labs is the company behind Grafana Cloud, the fully managed observability platform trusted by more than 10,000 organizations to ensure reliability, resolve incidents faster, and optimize telemetry at scale. Built on open source and open standards and designed for interoperability across any stack, Grafana Cloud brings AI to observability and observability to AI, giving teams (and their agents) unified visibility so they can see, understand, and act on all their disparate data, wherever it lives, and move at the speed of their ambitions. Customers, including Anthropic, Bloomberg, NVIDIA, Microsoft, and Salesforce, rely on Grafana Labs. We are a 100% remote company with team members across 40+ countries, backed by leading investors including Lightspeed Venture Partners, Sequoia Capital, GIC, Coatue, J.P. Morgan, CapitalG, and Lead Edge Capital. Learn more at &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://grafana.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;grafana.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt; and follow us on &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/grafana-labs/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt; and &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/grafana&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re scaling fast and staying true to what makes us different: an open-source legacy, a global collaborative culture, and a passion for meaningful work. Our team thrives in an innovation-driven environment where transparency, autonomy, and trust fuel everything we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You may not meet every requirement, and that’s okay. If this role excites you, we’d love you to raise your hand for what could be a truly career-defining opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a remote opportunity and we would be interested in applications from Germany, UK, Ireland and Spain.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grafana Cloud is our composable observability platform that integrates metrics, logs, and traces with Grafana. It allows our customers to leverage the best open source observability software – including Prometheus, Mimir, Loki, and Tempo – without the overhead of installing, maintaining and scaling their own observability stack&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Observability department is focused on enabling developers to understand the health and performance of their applications and infrastructure in any environment by providing tools to instrument their code, ingest observability data into Grafana Cloud and visualize and explore it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The OpenTelemetry SDKs team&#39;s mission is to make sure our users succeed in instrumenting their software with OpenTelemetry. We work closely with the &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/open-telemetry/community#special-interest-groups&quot;&gt;OpenTelemetry SIGs&lt;/a&gt; to make OpenTelemetry SDKs and instrumentation libraries a success. Members of this team are experts in at least one programming language and have a broad knowledge of various other programming languages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will focus on a language-specific implementation of &lt;a href=&quot;https://opentelemetry.io/docs/languages/python/&quot;&gt;OpenTelemetry in Python&lt;/a&gt;, with an emphasis on &lt;a href=&quot;https://opentelemetry.io/blog/2024/otel-generative-ai/&quot;&gt;OpenTelemetry for Generative AI&lt;/a&gt;. You will get to work in an upstream-first approach, helping accelerate the OpenTelemetry project while bringing the innovations to Grafana labs products and offerings.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a company we are remote-first and global, we embrace people of different experiences and backgrounds to build diverse teams where every person brings a unique perspective to the software. We are looking for Engineers that are passionate about communicating with data and providing seamless experiences for our customers to join our growing team! Engineers at Grafana also have the opportunity to contribute to Open Source communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Grafana Labs, ICs have a dedicated career path and do not have to become managers to progress in their career. Staff Software Engineers at Grafana have a large amount of experience across multiple areas.&amp;nbsp; They are able to estimate, plan, coordinate and deliver large tasks spanning multiple systems.&amp;nbsp; They actively coach and mentor other team members in their team and are able to identify and resolve issues with technology and product processes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will bring your software engineering expertise to develop improvements to the OpenTelemetry Python SDK and instrumentation libraries, with a strong focus on AI applications and agent workflows. This is a hands-on role for someone with deep Python expertise and an interest in AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate in open-source communities. You will develop and maintain the OpenTelemetry Python SDK and instrumentation libraries, working with maintainers and other vendors on specifications, APIs, and implementation decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build Python instrumentation for AI agents. Build instrumentation that connects agent runs, model calls, and tool execution, including across asynchronous code. Contribute to evolving OpenTelemetry conventions for generative AI, with care for sensitive data and metric cardinality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve Python SDK performance. Use profiling and benchmarks to evaluate implementation approaches with the upstream community. Make sound tradeoffs around runtime overhead, compatibility, and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be visible as an OpenTelemetry expert. Teach others, promote best practices around OpenTelemetry, semantic conventions, and various technologies and frameworks. Both within Grafana Labs and in the broader OpenTelemetry community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the technical direction and vision of the team, and contribute to business conversations on the OpenTelemetry strategy at Grafana Labs. Own projects from an ambiguous problem through design, implementation, testing, documentation, and release.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner in an open and respectful way. Lend your knowledge and skills to our GTM, Product and Support teams. Join customer conversations, investigate instrumentation issues, and turn what you learn into fixes and practical guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we are remote-first and our engineering organization is largely remote, we provide guidance and meet regularly using video calls, so high agency and good communication skills are a must.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes You a Great Fit:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Grafana Labs, Staff Engineers are defined by the impact they have and the people they enable. You take ownership of complex problems, set technical direction, and help others deliver improvements that matter to customers and the OpenTelemetry community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in software development, with strong proficiency in Python and experience debugging production software, language internals, libraries, and asynchronous code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An interest in AI applications and agent systems, and curiosity about how to instrument and troubleshoot them. Prior experience building AI systems is helpful, but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in open-source communities. You are eager to become an active member of the OpenTelemetry community, collaborate with maintainers and users, and keep learning across languages, frameworks, and the wider observability ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with observability tooling such as Grafana, Prometheus, and OpenTelemetry, alongside experience with cloud-based software or systems engineering. You understand production environments and can assess operational risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience working on open source observability projects, ideally in OpenTelemetry or Prometheus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Python instrumentation techniques, profiling, runtime diagnostics, or asynchronous context propagation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a hands-on technical leadership role, setting technical direction and leading project teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience instrumenting AI frameworks or agent workflows, or working with OpenTelemetry semantic conventions for generative AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to or maintaining Open Source projects, with evidence of successful pull requests and community collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rust experience is a plus for exploring potential Python SDK performance improvements, including Rust-backed implementations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Rewards:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In Germany, the compensation range for this role is&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;EUR 113,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt; - EUR 141,000&lt;/span&gt;. Actual compensation may vary based on level, experience, and skillset as assessed throughout the interview process. All of our roles include Restricted Stock Units (RSUs), giving every team member ownership in Grafana Labs&#39; success. We believe in shared outcomes—RSUs help us stay aligned and invested as we scale globally.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;*Compensation ranges are country specific. If you are applying for this role from a different location than listed above, your recruiter will discuss your specific market’s defined pay range &amp;amp; benefits at the beginning of the process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You’ll Thrive at Grafana Labs:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;100% Remote, Global Culture -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;As a remote-only company, we bring together talent from around the world, united by a culture of collaboration and shared purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scaling Organization&lt;/strong&gt; – Tackle meaningful work in a high-growth, ever-evolving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transparent Communication&lt;/strong&gt; – Expect open decision-making and regular company-wide updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation-Driven&lt;/strong&gt; – Autonomy and support to ship great work and try new things.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Open Source Roots&lt;/strong&gt; – Built on community-driven values that shape how we work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empowered Teams&lt;/strong&gt; – High trust, low ego culture that values outcomes over optics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career Growth Pathways&lt;/strong&gt; – Defined opportunities to grow and develop your career.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Approachable Leadership&lt;/strong&gt; – Transparent execs who are involved, visible, and human.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passionate People&lt;/strong&gt; – Join a team of smart, supportive folks who care deeply about what they do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In-Person onboarding &lt;/strong&gt;- We want you to thrive from day 1 with your fellow new ‘Grafanistas’ to learn all about what we do and how we do it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Balance is Key&lt;/strong&gt; - We operate a global annual leave policy of 30 days per annum. 3 days of your annual leave entitlement are reserved for Grafana Shutdown Days to allow the team to really disconnect. &lt;em&gt;*We will comply with local legislation where applicable.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;Grafana Labs is an equal opportunities employer. We welcome applications from everyone regardless of race, colour, nationality, origin, caste, sex, gender reassignment identity or expression, sexual orientation, age, religion or belief, disability, veteran status, genetic information, pregnancy, maternity, marital, family or carer status, or any other characteristic which is protected by local law. We believe that equality and diversity build a strong organisation, and we work hard to ensure that is the foundation of our organisation as we grow.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Grafana Labs may utilize AI tools in its recruitment process to assist in matching information provided in CVs to job postings. The recruitment team will continue to review inbound CVs manually to identify alignment with current openings.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;For information about how your personal data is used once you’ve applied to a job, check out our &lt;a href=&quot;https://grafana.com/legal/applicant-and-candidate-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
