&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BOUT TIDE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tide, we help SMEs save time and money in the running of their businesses by not only offering business accounts and related banking services, but also a comprehensive set of highly usable and connected administrative solutions, from invoicing to accounting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tide is transforming the small business banking market and now supports over 2 million members globally across the UK, India, Germany and France.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Using advanced technology, all solutions are designed with SMEs in mind. With quick onboarding, low fees and innovative features, we thrive on making data driven decisions to serve our mission: to help SMEs save time and money so they can get back to doing what they love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tide facts:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tide is available for UK, Indian, German and French SMEs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over 2 million members globally and rapidly growing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over $300 million raised in funding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3,000 Tideans globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognised with Great Place to Work certification three years in a row, and among India’s Top 50 Best Workplaces in Banking, Financial Services, and Insurance in 2026&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have offices in Central London, with a member support and technology centre in Sofia, Bulgaria, technology centres in Serbia, Romania, Lithuania and Hyderabad and offices in Gurugram, New Delhi, Berlin, Paris and Luxembourg&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;44&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are hiring across multiple locations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;46&quot; data-end=&quot;145&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;46&quot; data-end=&quot;56&quot;&gt;India:&lt;/strong&gt; Hyderabad, Delhi NCR, Bengaluru&lt;br data-start=&quot;88&quot; data-end=&quot;91&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;91&quot; data-end=&quot;102&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Europe:&lt;/strong&gt; London, Serbia, Sofia, Lithuania, Berlin&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;ABOUT TIDE&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tide we help SMEs save time (and money) in the running of their businesses by not only offering business accounts and related banking services, but also a comprehensive set of highly usable and connected administrative solutions from invoicing to accounting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tide is transforming the small business banking market with over 1.8 million members globally across the UK, India, Germany and France.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Using advanced technology, all solutions are designed with SMEs in mind. With quick onboarding, low fees and innovative features, we thrive on making data-driven decisions to serve our mission: to help SMEs save both time (and money) so they can get back to doing what they love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tide facts:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tide is available for UK, Indian, German and French SMEs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over 1.8 million members: 800,000 UK and 1,000,000 in India and growing rapidly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over $300 million raised in funding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over 2,500 Tideans globally - we’re diversity champions!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have offices in Central London, with a member support and technology centre in Sofia, Bulgaria, technology centres in Serbia, Romania, Lithuania and Hyderabad and offices in Gurugram and New Delhi, and in Berlin, Paris and Luxembourg.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tide is hiring a Senior Staff Software Engineer to lead the architecture of our agentic platform. You will shape the shared capabilities that allow AI systems to operate safely, reliably, and at scale across Tide. That includes context, orchestration, tool execution, trust controls, observability, and evaluation. You will participate in key build versus buy decisions, integrate external components where they accelerate us, and ensure we own the parts that matter most for Tide’s trust, data advantage, and long-term platform leverage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a Senior Staff Engineer you’ll:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the architecture for Tide’s agentic platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the design of shared services such as context APIs, tool layers, policy controls, and auditability&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product, data, security, and engineering teams to turn use cases into reusable platform capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set standards for reliability, safety, scalability, and developer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical leadership across teams and unblock critical decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement cost-management and routing logic to optimize LLM spend across different providers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build automated evaluation pipelines to measure agent reasoning accuracy and safety trajectories&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;WHAT WE ARE LOOKING FOR:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience building platform or infrastructure systems at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong judgement across APIs, distributed systems, data, and cloud-native architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of leading complex cross-team technical problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating third-party platforms without losing control of core architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of reliability, security, and observability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI platform components is valuable, but not essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in highly regulated industries (Fintech, Healthtech, etc.) where safety and compliance are core to the product is highly desirable&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our Tech Stack:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Java, Spring Boot and JOOQ to build the RESTful APIs of our microservices (but we welcome people who are used to any strongly typed general purpose programming language!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Event-driven architecture with messages over SNS+SQS and Kafka to make them reliable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Primary datastores are MySQL and PostgreSQL via RDS or Aurora (we are heavy AWS users)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Docker, Terraform, EKS used by the Cloud team to run the platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DataDog and Rollbar to keep it running&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GitHub with Sonarcloud, Semgrep and solid testing to power the CI/CD pipelines - new joiners are encouraged to have something deployed to production in their first 2 weeks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Angular 2+ with ngrx on Web, Flutter for the Mobile App&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fivetran/Snowflake/Looker for the BI insights and Python/Faust/Flask/Tecton + some ML libs for the automated decisioning and risk management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;TIDE IS A PLACE FOR EVERYONE&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tide, we believe that we can only succeed if we let our differences enrich our culture. Our Tideans come from a variety of backgrounds and experience levels. We consider everyone irrespective of their ethnicity, religion, sexual orientation, gender identity, family or parental status, national origin, veteran, neurodiversity or differently-abled status. We celebrate diversity in our workforce as a cornerstone of our success. Our commitment to a broad spectrum of ideas and backgrounds is what enables us to build products that resonate with our members’ diverse needs and lives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are One Team and foster a transparent and inclusive environment, where everyone’s voice is heard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Tide, we thrive on diversity, embracing various backgrounds and experiences. We welcome all individuals regardless of ethnicity, religion, sexual orientation, gender identity, or disability. Our inclusive culture is key to our success, helping us build products that meet our members&#39; diverse needs. We are One Team, committed to transparency and ensuring everyone’s voice is heard.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disclaimer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;It has come to our attention that individuals or agencies are falsely claiming to represent Tide and are reaching out to candidates regarding job opportunities. Please be aware that:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tide does&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;charge any fees at any stage of the recruitment process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;All official Tide job opportunities are listed exclusively on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.tide.co/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Careers Page&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and applications should be submitted through this channel.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Communication from Tide will only come from an official&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;@tide&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;.co&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tide does not work with agencies or recruiters without prior formal engagement, and we do not authorize third parties to make job offers on our behalf.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you are contacted by anyone misrepresenting Tide or requesting payment, please treat it as fraudulent and report it to us immediately at &lt;a ----- ----- safety and trust are important to us, and we are committed to ensuring a fair and transparent recruitment process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Tide leverages AI to enhance our hiring experience. You can read more about how we use AI in our recruitment process in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://assets.ctfassets.net/3h69mkdgxn20/5MFtWSdG8YLKq3jZkK52NY/3f18633073e6cdbd03bba4b9791c64f4/Using_AI_throughout_the_Hiring_Process.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AI Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Your personal data will be processed by Tide for recruitment purposes and in accordance with &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://assets.ctfassets.net/3h69mkdgxn20/30JAUcDJMlaCwUKt4zoW0j/dd541981a67b6838d6e54537704bc8aa/Tide_Recruitment_Privacy_Notice_Job_Post_Version.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://assets.ctfassets.net/3h69mkdgxn20/1MYf6q4ZMWugpeaROVETBN/526e9c160a2de03576413c81657c6466/Recruitment_Privacy_Notice__Final_Draft__Sep_2024_.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Tide&#39;s Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is looking for a Senior / Lead Program Manager to help develop and execute our asset-light model for expanding AI infrastructure through partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work at the intersection of strategy, finance, commercial negotiations and execution. Your focus will be to turn complex partnership opportunities into clear business cases, workable commercial terms and agreements that support the needs of Nebius, our partners and our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role suits someone who combines structured problem-solving with strong financial understanding and the ability to move work forward across multiple teams. You should be comfortable assessing commercial trade-offs, bringing clarity to ambiguous problems and taking responsibility for progress.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an individual contributor role with significant cross-functional responsibility. You will lead projects and influence stakeholders without direct line-management responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop commercial frameworks and term sheets.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Define proposed terms for asset-light partnerships, balancing financial returns, risk, responsibilities and the interests of Nebius and its partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support the partnership team&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;Build the operational framework, track and report progress, develop commercial guidelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build business cases with Finance.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Coordinate the analysis supporting partnership proposals, working through financial models, testing assumptions and assessing how different commercial terms affect the economics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape contractual and legal structures.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Partner with Legal and relevant business teams to translate the commercial model into practical structures and agreements for partners and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive cross-functional execution.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Bring together Finance, Legal, commercial, technical and operational stakeholders, establishing clear ownership, resolving dependencies and maintaining momentum.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prepare decisions and recommendations.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Turn complex information into clear options, explain trade-offs and help stakeholders reach informed decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop repeatable ways of working.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Capture lessons from individual partnerships and improve the frameworks, templates and processes that support the model as it grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in management consulting or a strategy and operations role within a technology business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with the ability to break down unfamiliar, complex problems and develop practical recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial fluency: you can read and work with financial models, challenge assumptions and explain the commercial implications of the numbers. A specialist financial analyst background is not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing business cases, assessing commercial opportunities or supporting complex transactions and partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence working with commercial terms and contracts alongside finance and legal specialists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management skills, including the ability to align teams with different priorities and influence without formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The initiative and judgment to drive projects independently, manage ambiguity and recognise when a decision needs wider input.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written and verbal communication, particularly when presenting analysis and recommendations to senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Revenue operations background: Supporting sales or partnership teams with clear processes, compensation structure etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience that would be valuable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on large, complex projects in data centres, digital infrastructure, real estate, power or related sectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Revenue operations background: supporting sales or partnership teams with clear processes, compensation structure etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to partnership models, infrastructure economics or arrangements involving several commercial counterparties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience taking a strategic recommendation through negotiation and into implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sector experience is valuable, but we are also interested in strong generalists who can learn a new business model quickly and apply sound commercial judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Why join Nebius&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is scaling a new generation of AI infrastructure across EMEA. You will have genuine ownership of how that infrastructure is designed, standardised and delivered, working on complex projects where technical judgement has a direct impact on speed, capacity and long-term operational performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation and benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth and continuous learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility, trust and real ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An international environment with highly experienced technical teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to shape infrastructure that powers the next generation of AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is an equal opportunity employer committed to an inclusive workplace. We provide equal employment opportunities and do not discriminate on any characteristic protected by applicable law. Please tell us if you need an accommodation during the application process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility and ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and innovative culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work on impactful AI projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International environment and talented teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s it like to work at Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fast moving&amp;nbsp;- Bold thinking&amp;nbsp;- Constant growth&amp;nbsp;- Meaningful impact&amp;nbsp;- Trust and real ownership&amp;nbsp;- Opportunity to shape the future of AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is an equal opportunity employer. We are committed to fostering an inclusive and diverse workplace and to providing equal employment opportunities in all aspects of employment. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, ancestry, age, disability, genetic information, marital status, veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must be authorized to work in the country in which they apply and will be required to provide proof of employment eligibility as a condition of hire.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need accommodations during the application process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

Efficio is the world's largest specialist procurement and supply chain consultancy. Headquartered in London, we have offices across Europe, the Americas, East Asia, and the Middle East. We're a diverse team of more than 1,300 people, representing 60+ nationalities and speaking 40+ languages – and we're still growing!
&nbsp;
What sets us apart? We’re committed to delivering sustainable, measurable value for our clients. Our specialist focus means you'll develop deep expertise, while our hands-on approach to partnering with clients from strategy to implementation means you'll see the impact of your work. You'll have the opportunity to work on projects around the world in a wide variety of sectors, collaborating with colleagues from across our global offices.
&nbsp;
We are currently recruiting new team members across Germany, where you'll join a growing team of 50+ people.&nbsp;Our consultants work on a range of engagements, from rapid assessments to short-term savings programmes to long-term partnerships to help clients achieve lasting value.
&nbsp;
Consultants based in Germany work with clients across the country and Europe, with opportunities to take on projects beyond Europe as well.&nbsp;Your responsibilities:
Leading consulting engagements from initial analysis and strategy development through to implementation and delivery.
Identifying opportunities for cost optimisation, procurement transformation and supply chain improvement.
Managing project teams, ensuring high-quality deliverables, effective collaboration and successful project outcomes.
Building trusted relationships with senior client stakeholders, understanding their business priorities and translating these into actionable solutions.
Supporting the development and mentoring of consultants, helping them grow professionally and deliver strong results.
Contributing to business development activities, including identifying new opportunities and supporting client proposals.

&nbsp;
For Senior Manager positions, there will be an increased emphasis on managing complex engagements, developing client relationships and contributing to the growth of our business.What you'll bring:We're interested in experienced professionals who enjoy solving complex business challenges, building strong client relationships and delivering tangible results.&nbsp;
&nbsp;

Fluency in both German and English.
Previous management consulting experience, with strong expertise in Strategic sourcing, procurement transformation or supply chain management.
Experience managing projects and leading teams, including responsibility for project delivery and client relationships.
Strong analytical, problem-solving and communication skills.
Experience working with senior stakeholders and navigating complex business environments.
A strong academic background.
Previous business development experience would be particularly valuable, especially for Senior Manager positions.
Location & Work Arrangements
We welcome applications from candidates based across Germany.
&nbsp;
While Efficio's German office is located in Düsseldorf, you'll be part of our wider Germany consulting team, collaborating with colleagues locally and across our international offices.
&nbsp;
Our hybrid working model combines flexibility with regular in-person collaboration. We expect colleagues to spend approximately 10 working days per month in person, either at our Düsseldorf office or at client sites, depending on project requirements.
&nbsp;
Outside of these commitments, you'll have the flexibility to work remotely from your home location, subject to client and project needs.
Why Join Efficio?
At Efficio, we offer the opportunity to develop your expertise, make a tangible impact and grow as part of a truly global team.
&nbsp;
Deep Expertise: Work alongside experienced specialists, deepen your knowledge of procurement and supply chain, and continue developing your skills through challenging projects, mentorship and career development opportunities.
&nbsp;
Real World Impact: Go beyond recommendations and take ownership of delivering meaningful change. From strategy through implementation, you'll work closely with clients to solve complex challenges and achieve measurable, lasting results.
&nbsp;
One Global Team: Be part of a collaborative and international environment where diverse perspectives are valued. Work with colleagues across different countries, industries and backgrounds, sharing knowledge and learning from one another.
&nbsp;
If you're looking to deepen your expertise, make a real difference for clients and grow your career within a global team, we'd love to hear from you.Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

