&nbsp;
What sets us apart? We’re committed to delivering sustainable, measurable value for our clients. Our specialist focus means you'll develop deep expertise, while our hands-on approach to partnering with clients from strategy to implementation means you'll see the impact of your work. You'll have the opportunity to work on projects around the world in a wide variety of sectors, collaborating with colleagues from across our global offices.
&nbsp;
We are currently recruiting new team members across Germany, where you'll join a growing team of 50+ people.&nbsp;Our consultants work on a range of engagements, from rapid assessments to short-term savings programmes to long-term partnerships to help clients achieve lasting value.
&nbsp;
Consultants based in Germany work with clients across the country and Europe, with opportunities to take on projects beyond Europe as well.&nbsp;Your responsibilities:

Leading consulting engagements from initial analysis and strategy development through to implementation and delivery.
Identifying opportunities for cost optimisation, procurement transformation and supply chain improvement.
Managing project teams, ensuring high-quality deliverables, effective collaboration and successful project outcomes.
Building trusted relationships with senior client stakeholders, understanding their business priorities and translating these into actionable solutions.
Supporting the development and mentoring of consultants, helping them grow professionally and deliver strong results.
Contributing to business development activities, including identifying new opportunities and supporting client proposals.

&nbsp;
For Senior Manager positions, there will be an increased emphasis on managing complex engagements, developing client relationships and contributing to the growth of our business.
What you'll bring:
We're interested in experienced professionals who enjoy solving complex business challenges, building strong client relationships and delivering tangible results.&nbsp;
&nbsp;

Fluency in both German and English.
Previous management consulting experience, with strong expertise in Strategic sourcing, procurement transformation or supply chain management.
Experience managing projects and leading teams, including responsibility for project delivery and client relationships.
Strong analytical, problem-solving and communication skills.
Experience working with senior stakeholders and navigating complex business environments.
A strong academic background.
Previous business development experience would be particularly valuable, especially for Senior Manager positions.

Location & Work Arrangements
We welcome applications from candidates based across Germany.
&nbsp;
While Efficio's German office is located in Düsseldorf, you'll be part of our wider Germany consulting team, collaborating with colleagues locally and across our international offices.
&nbsp;
Our hybrid working model combines flexibility with regular in-person collaboration. We expect colleagues to spend approximately 10 working days per month in person, either at our Düsseldorf office or at client sites, depending on project requirements.
&nbsp;
Outside of these commitments, you'll have the flexibility to work remotely from your home location, subject to client and project needs.
Why Join Efficio?
At Efficio, we offer the opportunity to develop your expertise, make a tangible impact and grow as part of a truly global team.
&nbsp;
Deep Expertise: Work alongside experienced specialists, deepen your knowledge of procurement and supply chain, and continue developing your skills through challenging projects, mentorship and career development opportunities.
&nbsp;
Real World Impact: Go beyond recommendations and take ownership of delivering meaningful change. From strategy through implementation, you'll work closely with clients to solve complex challenges and achieve measurable, lasting results.
&nbsp;
One Global Team: Be part of a collaborative and international environment where diverse perspectives are valued. Work with colleagues across different countries, industries and backgrounds, sharing knowledge and learning from one another.
&nbsp;
If you're looking to deepen your expertise, make a real difference for clients and grow your career within a global team, we'd love to hear from you.Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About Clear Street: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Clear Street is modernizing the brokerage ecosystem. Founded in 2018, Clear Street is a diversified financial services firm replacing the legacy infrastructure used across capital markets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We started from scratch by building a completely cloud-native clearing and custody system designed for today’s complex, global market. Clear Street’s proprietary prime brokerage platform adds significant efficiency to the market, while focusing on minimizing risk, redundancy, and cost for clients. Our goal is to create a single source-of-truth platform for every asset class, in every country, and in any currency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;By combining highly-skilled product and engineering talent with seasoned finance professionals, we’re building the essentials to compete in today’s fast-paced markets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are seeking an experienced Tax Associate Director (or Director) to lead tax matters across our UK, EMEA, and APAC operations. Based out of our London office in the United Kingdom, this is a high-impact individual contributor role within a fast-growing fintech business and will report locally to the UK Finance Director. The individual will act as a strategic leader responsible for managing corporate tax compliance and reporting, transfer pricing, planning and advisory and risk management across the UK, EU and APAC regions to strengthen the overall global tax and, more broadly, finance functions for the Company and support the needs of a rapidly growing organization.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are looking for someone who is excited to join a fast-paced organization and contribute to building a best-in-class Tax function as the Company continues to scale across businesses and geographies.&amp;nbsp; The team is lean and the scope of the role is broad and so the position offers significant opportunities for leadership and growth.&amp;nbsp; You will serve as the primary tax authority for a complex, multi-jurisdictional enterprise, advising senior business leaders, managing external advisors, and partnering with financial, legal, HR, and product teams to ensure tax efficiency, compliance and strategic alignment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Tax compliance and reporting:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Manage end-to-end tax compliance cycle including, but not limited to, the preparation and/or review and filing of corporate income tax returns, VAT/GST and/or withholding taxes using local external advisors, where appropriate.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Oversee the calculation and review of current and deferred tax provisions under IFRS / US GAAP for regional entities. &lt;/li&gt;
