&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://foundation.mozilla.org/en/&quot;&gt;Mozilla Foundation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;is a non-profit building a better technology future — powered by people, open by design, fueled by imagination.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We deliver people-first alternatives to today’s extractive systems. We build side by side with developers, innovators and advocates, united in the belief that a better technology future is not only possible — it’s ours to create!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mozillafoundation.org/en/meet-mozilla/nabiha-syed/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our CEO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; is increasingly focused outward on the Board, funders, partners, and public conversations that will shape the Foundation’s next chapter. This newly created Chief of Staff role exists to extend the CEO’s reach inside the organization and make that outward focus possible.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Reporting directly to the CEO, you’ll serve as the CEO’s strategic partner, internal proxy and trusted extension of their leadership. You’ll hold the CEO’s strategic agenda, translate the CEO’s priorities into organizational alignment, represent the CEO internally where needed, and make decisions on the CEO’s behalf within clearly delegated authority. You’ll determine what reaches the CEO, prepare the CEO for consequential moments, and escalate only what requires the CEO’s judgment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;As a member of the Executive Leadership Team, you’ll partner strategically with other members of the ELT and work closely with the CEO’s Executive Program Manager to make sure the CEO’s time, priorities, and commitments stay aligned and moving.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You’ll also partner with the Foundation’s Investment Committee and its technical and strategic advisors, keeping their focus on the right questions, their recommendations aligned with the Foundation’s strategic priorities, and decisions moving efficiently from evaluation to funding.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Here’s what you’ll likely be focused on for the &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;first 6 months&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Building a strong working partnership with the CEO, aligning on priorities, ways of working and clearly defining the scope of your delegated authority.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Establishing a trusted partnership with each member of the Executive Leadership Team, learning their priorities, pressures and ways of working.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Developing a deep, cross-functional understanding of the Foundation’s work and how each function connects to the CEO’s priorities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Translating the CEO’s priorities into a concise, clear set of strategic outcomes that leaders understand and can use to guide the decisions they own, with a current view of what’s changing and which decisions are approaching.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Defining with the CEO what truly requires their attention, and ensuring issues reach them decision-ready, with context, options and a recommendation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Getting up to speed with the Investment Committee and its advisors, and helping keep their focus on the right questions so decisions move efficiently from evaluation to funding.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As the Chief of Staff to Mozilla Foundation’s CEO, you will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Serve as the CEO’s thought partner in developing, pressure-testing and refining strategic priorities, synthesizing executive insight and external developments to anticipate what will need to be known or decided in the next 30, 60 and 90 days.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Direct the CEO’s time toward strategy, external relationships, development, Board leadership and the Foundation’s highest-consequence decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Filter rather than forward, so significant shifts in strategy, material risks, major budget decisions and Board-level matters reach the CEO early, with context, options and a recommendation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Maintain a current view of the CEO’s top priorities, identify where work is drifting from strategic intent, and surface conflicts in priorities, resources or attention before they become emergencies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Enable the Executive Leadership Team to operate as one team around the CEO’s priorities, so the right issues reach the ELT at the right level and decisions and commitments are followed through.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Partner with ELT members on cross-functional issues that need CEO-level alignment but not the CEO’s direct involvement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Represent the CEO’s position in internal discussions and make decisions on the CEO’s behalf within delegated authority, bringing anything beyond it back to the CEO promptly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Ensure the CEO enters every Board meeting, funder and partner conversation, speech and public engagement fully prepared, with concise briefings, organizational context and answers to likely questions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Identify external opportunities that warrant the CEO’s attention, and ensure commitments the CEO makes externally translate into clear internal follow-through.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Steward alignment between the Investment Committee’s work and the Foundation’s strategy: keep its technical and strategic advisors focused on the right questions, surface gaps, risks or competing views, and bring forward matters that need the CEO’s judgment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What this role is not&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This is a role of influence. It exists to ensure the CEO can lead effectively through the Executive Leadership Team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The Chief of Staff does not manage the Executive Leadership Team or run the Foundation’s operations. Each executive leader owns execution and decisions within their area.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This role does not make decisions beyond the authority the CEO has delegated. Anything outside that authority returns to the CEO.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This role does not have any direct reports and also doesn’t manage the CEO’s calendar, scheduling or administrative support.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Professional Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Significant, verifiable experience as a strategic partner at CEO or executive-team level, with a track record of leading high-stakes work and turning ambiguity into structure and action.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Experience working across multiple legal entities is a plus, including navigating differences, building influence, and coordinating work across entities where relevant.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A proven record of driving complex, cross-functional priorities from idea to execution by defining outcomes, ownership, milestones and decision points.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Exceptional judgment and discretion, including handling confidential information and navigating complex executive dynamics with integrity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to influence without formal authority, build trust across functions and at the most senior levels, and give direct feedback with care.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Outstanding written and verbal communication, with experience distilling complex information into decision-ready briefs, recommendations, presentations and executive communications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Strong analytical and strategic problem-solving skills: you frame the right question, gather the right information, test assumptions and recommend a practical path forward.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Disciplined prioritization, with the agility to move between long-term priorities and time-sensitive issues without losing the thread.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Direct experience supporting Board governance, fundraising or other high-stakes external relationships at an executive level.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A track record of doing high-impact work out of the spotlight, measuring your success by the CEO’s and the team’s, and acting in the best interests of the CEO and the organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A demonstrated commitment to Mozilla Foundation’s mission and to building an open, accessible and trustworthy internet.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The ability to work across time zones and occasionally outside standard working hours for Board meetings, major events or urgent organizational needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comfortable traveling for Board meetings, leadership gatherings and major events.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We Are Excited To See Any Additional Experience With:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Senior roles in nonprofit, philanthropic, technology or public-interest organizations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Supporting or advising investment, grantmaking or funding committees.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A few things that are true about how we work at Mozilla Foundation. Here&#39;s a summary along with our expectation of how these should show up in this role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Move toward the hard thing&lt;/strong&gt;: you surface conflicts in priorities, resources or attention early, and give the CEO and executives direct, actionable input, including what they may not want to hear. You disagree constructively in the room, not afterward, and you don’t wait for someone else to raise it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay curious and current&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;you stay close to what executives are seeing and what’s happening in our fields and communities, and turn it into the context the CEO needs. You pressure-test assumptions, including your own.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work in the open&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;you document decisions and the reasoning behind them, so executives and teams can follow how and why priorities are set. You favor shared channels over side conversations wherever appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Focus and finish&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;you keep the CEO’s agenda focused on what matters most, make deliberate choices about what does and doesn’t need the CEO, and make sure decisions and commitments are seen through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flex with purpose&lt;/strong&gt;: you move between long-term priorities and time-sensitive issues as context shifts, and adapt how you work with each executive. Flexibility isn’t about being agreeable; it’s staying responsive while holding to the mission and the CEO’s priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead with care&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;you hold a high bar for the work while treating people as whole humans. You extend good faith to fellow executives, respect that each owns their area, and talk directly to the person who can solve the problem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Salary and Benefits Information&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mozilla Foundation is dedicated to fair and equitable compensation for our staff. We aim to pay a competitive and market-based salary based on the responsibilities and requirements of the role. We do not ask for, or take into account, salary histories in our offer process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The starting salary ranges for this role are listed below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Germany: €206,448.00 – €232,253.22&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UK: £181,764.00 – £204,483.81&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Canada: $356,400.00 – $400,948.65&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;US: $264,000.00 – $296,999.00&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also offer the following benefits:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extended Sick Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global Employee Assistance Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement Plan contributions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid Time Off: 20 days annual leave + sick days and your birthday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company Holidays + EOY Shutdown&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional Development budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Top up program for Pregnancy and Parental leaves&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits are subject to change at any time at the discretion of Mozilla Foundation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Mozilla Foundation Hiring Practices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mozilla understands that valuing diverse creative practices and forms of knowledge are crucial to and enrich the company’s core mission. We encourage applications from everyone, including members of all equity-seeking communities, such as (but certainly not limited to) women, racialized and Indigenous persons, persons with disabilities, and persons of all sexual orientations and gender identities and expressions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will ensure that individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodation to participate in the job application or interview process, to perform essential job functions, and to receive other benefits and privileges of employment. Please contact us to request accommodation at -----
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-REMOTE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Strategic Account Based Marketing Manager with vertical experience in Financial Services to design and execute highly targeted, data-driven ABM programs for our top strategic accounts—driving pipeline growth, accelerating deals, and increasing customer lifetime value. This role will focus on high-impact campaigns aligned to the Financial Services industry, leveraging industry-specific insights to personalize the buyer journey and deepen executive engagement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on, strategic role that blends Financial Services vertical expertise, ABM strategy and execution, and cross-functional leadership. The ideal candidate brings a deep understanding of Financial Services industry pain points, collaborates closely with sales and marketing teams, and thrives in a high-growth, customer-centric environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial Services Vertical-Centric ABM Campaigns: Lead the design, execution, and optimization of 1:1 and 1:few ABM campaigns for strategic accounts—tailoring messaging, content, and engagement strategies to Financial Services industry-specific challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration: Partner with sales, field marketing, campaigns, and product marketing teams to ensure campaigns are aligned with account objectives, vertical GTM strategies, and buyer personas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-Driven Insights &amp;amp; Reporting: Use tools like 6sense, Salesforce, and Tableau to monitor engagement, pipeline impact, and ROI. Translate insights into clear campaign optimizations and business recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive Engagement: Collaborate with sales leaders to develop executive-level programs that drive alignment and trust with C-level buyers in Financial Services.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ABM Innovation &amp;amp; Enablement: Drive new tactics such as themed call blitzes, strategic gifting, and multi-channel personalization. Enable sellers with tailored playbooks and outbound messaging aligned to industry pain points.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentorship &amp;amp; Best Practices: Support junior ABM teammates by sharing playbooks, insights, and vertical knowledge to scale successful programs across regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Budget Management: Manage and optimize ABM budgets, ensuring effective use of resources and clear tracking of program performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;10+ years of B2B field marketing experience, with at least 5+ years focused on ABM and/or strategic account marketing in enterprise tech or SaaS environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Proven vertical marketing expertise—ideally in Financial Services—with the ability to speak to industry-specific trends, buyer needs, and GTM motions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Advanced proficiency in ABM platforms (6sense, Demandbase), Salesforce CRM, and analytics tools such as Tableau.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of the customer journey, multi-touch attribution, and end-to-end campaign development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Excellent project management and communication skills, with a collaborative approach to working across sales, marketing, and executive stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience enabling sales teams with tailored messaging and account-based strategies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Team mentorship or leadership experience is a plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to travel up to 50%. This includes time in London with our Sales team and also across our main hubs in the EMEA region for events / meetings with local Field Marketing teams, as required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Success Metrics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Pipeline contribution and acceleration from strategic vertical accounts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Engagement and conversion within targeted industries&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Stakeholder alignment and satisfaction (particularly sales and vertical leaders)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;ROI and efficiency of ABM program spend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Internal adoption of ABM best practices and frameworks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Opportunities for Growth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;This is a high-visibility role with a strong path toward ABM leadership, vertical strategy, or demand generation ownership. You’ll have a direct impact on shaping how Pure Storage grows in high-potential industries—and how we build lasting relationships with our most important customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-REMOTE&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT FROM US:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: We celebrate those who think critically, like a challenge, and aspire to be trailblazers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: We give you the space and support to grow along with us and to contribute to something meaningful. We have been named Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in Technology™, Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in the Bay Area™, and certified as a Great Place to Work®!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;: We build each other up and set aside ego for the greater good.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And because we understand the value of bringing your full and best self to work, we offer a variety of perks to manage a healthy balance, including flexible time off, wellness resources, and company-sponsored team events. Check out &lt;a href=&quot;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/&quot;&gt;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/ &lt;/a&gt;for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ACCOMMODATIONS AND ACCESSIBILITY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates with disabilities may request accommodations for all aspects of our hiring process. For more on this, contact us at &lt;a ---------- if you’re invited to an interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR COMMITMENT TO A STRONG AND INCLUSIVE TEAM:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re forging a future where everyone finds their rightful place and where every voice matters. Where uniqueness isn’t just accepted but embraced. That’s why we are committed to fostering the growth and development of every person, cultivating a sense of community through our Employee Resource Groups and advocating for inclusive leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everpure is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, sexual stereotypes, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or any other characteristic legally protected by the laws of the jurisdiction in which you are being considered for hire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us and bring your best.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring your bold.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pure and simple.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Ogilvy &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ogilvy has been creating impact for brands through iconic, culture-changing, value-driving ideas since the company was founded by David Ogilvy more than 75 years ago. It builds on that rich legacy through Borderless Creativity—innovating at the intersection of intelligence, imagination and influence, with experts across advertising, sports &amp;amp; entertainment, PR &amp;amp; social, consulting, and health collaborating seamlessly across more than 120 offices spanning 90 countries. Ogilvy was named &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ogilvy.com/ideas/ogilvy-brings-home-network-year-2026-cannes-lions-international-festival-creativity&quot;&gt;Network of the Year&lt;/a&gt; at the 2026 Cannes Lions International Festival of Creativity and&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ogilvy.com/ideas/ogilvy-tops-warc-effective-100-creative-100-4th-straight-year&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;e2c78315-ff05-4544-925f-9288319dea2c&quot;&gt;ranks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;as the #1 global agency network for creative excellence and effectiveness by WARC for the fourth consecutive year, signifying its ability to deliver creative solutions that drive unreasonable impact for clients and communities. Ogilvy is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.ogilvy.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;39833259-880d-4fd8-930f-0d84b1c14850&quot;&gt;Ogilvy.com&lt;/a&gt;, and follow us on&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/ogilvy/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;735e393e-6e8a-4ca8-804a-74f1bd8166b6&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/ogilvy&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d10960ce-761b-48c5-81d5-0a7c4cc6013a&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/ogilvy/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;92ffcb70-6ca7-4d9a-88d5-c130e36e6c4f&quot;&gt; Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/ogilvy/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;3bd2010d-00a2-401b-8cfb-7e8c24deac52&quot;&gt; Facebook.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&amp;nbsp;in a single company –&amp;nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&amp;nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://wpp.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;7f087527-f491-4cb6-a79d-3b4a67d1ec89&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qui sommes-nous ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous sommes une agence de publicité, de marketing et de communication.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ogilvy est une des filiales du Groupe WPP, ce qui fait de nous la plus internationale de toutes les agences de communication françaises.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;David Ogilvy, notre fondateur, a un parcours atypique et peu scolaire. Entrepreneur dans l’âme, c’est son travail, son talent et sa vision qui lui ont permis de devenir l’un des plus grands communicants des années 60. Il a, d’ailleurs, beaucoup inspiré la série Mad Men.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Il a fondé la maison Ogilvy en 1948, en plein cœur de New-York avant de se développer aux États-Unis et à l’international.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En plus d’avoir bâti un empire, il a aussi réussi à transcender notre vision des produits, des marques et notre façon de les raconter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;70 ans plus tard, nous continuons de transmettre son héritage avec un seul but : « &lt;em&gt;Making brands matter ».&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TA DREAM TEAM &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌈&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au sein de l’équipe Créative et sous la responsabilité du Directeur de Création, &lt;strong&gt;tu travailleras aux côtés de directeurs artistiques et de créatifs confirmés qui t&#39;accompagneront dans ton développement. &lt;/strong&gt;Tu participeras à la conception et à la réalisation de projets créatifs 360°.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous recherchons avant tout un profil avec une vraie sensibilité artistique, un regard graphique affirmé et une forte appétence pour la création d&#39;images.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;À ce titre, tu auras pour missions :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participer aux réunions de travail : briefs, moodboards, points créa, PPM, présentations clients, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participer directement au processus de création sur plusieurs projets publicitaires : élaboration de campagnes print, TV, web, déclinaisons graphiques multi-supports, mises en page, identités visuelles, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Imaginer et développer des concepts visuels et des univers graphiques singuliers sur différents supports : key visuals, outdoor, brand content, social media, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explorer, proposer et développer des pistes artistiques, des partis pris graphiques, des références et des territoires iconographiques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concevoir et réaliser des visuels en maîtrisant toute la chaîne de création : recherche, composition, génération d&#39;images par IA, retouche et finalisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expérimenter les nouveaux outils d&#39;intelligence artificielle générative pour repousser les possibilités de création visuelle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Atouts du stage :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu travailleras sur une très grande variété de grandes marques françaises et internationales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu seras impliqué(e) dans toutes les étapes de la création, de la recherche artistique à la réalisation des visuels, avec la possibilité d&#39;explorer de nouvelles approches créatives et de nouveaux outils.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WANTED&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💎&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;De formation supérieure en arts graphiques, direction artistique, design ou beaux-arts, bac +3 à bac +5.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une vraie fibre artistique, un œil, une sensibilité graphique et une envie de créer des images.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une solide culture visuelle, artistique, photographique et publicitaire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosité, ouverture d&#39;esprit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Envie de challenges et audace créative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellente maîtrise des logiciels de PAO : Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Très bonnes bases en création de visuels par IA générative : maîtrise des outils, capacité à orienter les résultats, affiner les images et obtenir un rendu visuel abouti.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonne maîtrise des techniques de retouche, de composition et de traitement de l&#39;image.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;La maîtrise de l&#39;anglais est un plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un portfolio présentant tes réalisations est indispensable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous serons particulièrement attentifs à ton univers graphique, à ton regard et à ta capacité à créer des images.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NOTRE PROCESS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤝🏻&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un entretien avec le Directeur de Création et/ ou 1 ou 2 membre(s) de l’équipe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un catch up call RH : Validation des key points et culture fit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Un conseil pour tes entretiens : sois toi-même !&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Ogilvy, our people are at the heart of what we do: a creative agency that sparks game-changing ideas across culture and business through collaboration, integrity, and a celebration of self-expression.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in building powerful teams with purpose - and we relentlessly curate transformative initiatives that make our commitment to fairness, and equity a reality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ultimate mission is to leave a positive impact on the world, creating a better future for all, while supporting and uplifting the global communities we serve.&amp;nbsp; This is central to our mantra of Borderless Creativity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Ogilvy is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any assistance seeking a job opportunity, or if you need reasonable accommodation with the application process, please contact us at ----- Please note that this contact is only for candidates who are requesting accommodation. Emails for other purposes, including application status requests, will not receive a response.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AlixPartners&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At AlixPartners, we solve the most complex and critical challenges by moving quickly from analysis to action — when it really matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We create value that has a lasting impact on companies, their employees and their communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By understanding, respecting and acknowledging the needs of our employees, clients and communities, AlixPartners actively fosters an inclusive environment. We firmly believe in the value that diversity of experience brings, and we are committed to continuously improving our initiatives, policies and practices. We commit to creating space for authenticity, growth and equality for everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AlixPartners has adopted a hybrid working model to offer flexibility and support our employees&#39; work-life integration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role as Strategic Finance Business Partner (France), you can expect a fast-paced, hands-on position in finance, working with the local French Leadership on driving the country’s performance as well as with the wider strategic finance team for the EMEA region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be a trusted strategic finance partner to the French Country Leader and Managing Director &amp;amp; Partner group, translating financial data into actionable insights and proactively challenging business decisions to support sustainable and profitable growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In supporting the finance function, you will work closely with colleagues in accounting and other Corporate Services functions (HR, Legal, IT, Business Development, etc.) in our fast-moving, rapidly growing company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ideally, you are an experienced business partner with a strong customer focus and the ability to build and maintain interpersonal relationships. You will work closely with the French leadership team and the wider Managing Director &amp;amp; Partner group and successfully handle demanding financial topics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are joining at an exciting time and will help modernize the finance function and support the company&#39;s long-term success. This role plays an important part in our strong growth, and you will have the opportunity to help shape it and build your own finance career at AlixPartners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Strategic Finance Business Partner – France is a full-time position with hybrid working arrangements, based in our Paris office. The role reports to the EMEA Head of Strategic Finance. Your responsibilities also include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proactive coordination with the French Country Leader and Managing Director &amp;amp; Partners to provide financial expertise and support, focusing on company growth, improving profitability and strengthening working capital management to reduce DSOs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Acting as a trusted advisor to senior leadership, offering proactive financial insights, recommendations and constructive challenge on key business and operational decisions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preparation and ownership of annual budgets and monthly forecasting processes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Supporting business planning and capacity planning, including financial analysis to improve resource allocation and profitable revenue growth&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Providing the financial resources needed to ensure strategic business development, client retention and increased client profitability within country, service and industry groups&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Close collaboration with the engagement analyst team to ensure a continuous flow of information on project-related challenges, or specific issues, and to support their resolution and discussion&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identifying revenue risks arising from significant working capital or engagement challenges and responding appropriately&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Supporting the Managing Director &amp;amp; Partner group on the running of their projects, including pricing, project set-up, WIP and AR management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proactively challenging stakeholders on engagement economics, fee structures, profitability and financial risks, and driving appropriate corrective actions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preparing the monthly financial management information (MI), including insightful commentary and analysis&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Developing and implementing dashboards, KPIs and regular performance-review routines across clients, engagements and Managing Director &amp;amp; Partners, translating analysis into clear business recommendations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monitoring performance against long-term strategic and short-term operational plans and supporting the Country Leader in defining the measures needed to achieve agreed financial targets&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Carrying out ad hoc analyses as needed to maximize profitability in terms of revenue and working capital&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in strategic finance, FP&amp;amp;A or finance business partnering with senior stakeholders, ideally in the professional services or consulting sector&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A strong foundation in accounting and financial controlling, combined with relevant professional experience; seniority and scope of experience will be assessed against the role requirements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Advanced proficiency in MS Office, with a particular focus on Excel and PowerPoint&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ability to stay calm and focused under pressure&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong analytical and organizational skills with great attention to detail&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven ability to influence and constructively challenge experienced stakeholders, including senior business leaders&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong commercial acumen, with the ability to turn complex financial analyses into practical, actionable recommendations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A proactive, hands-on, solutions-oriented mindset and the confidence to take ownership of financial performance topics&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A mindset that prioritizes continuous improvement, supporting personal development, colleague development and the optimization of business processes and interactions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ability to grasp the big picture while considering company-wide implications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A collaborative team player who values transparency and takes a straightforward approach&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Knowledge of SAP S/4 HANA Cloud, SAP Analytics Cloud (finance systems) or a similar ERP system for enterprise services is preferred&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ability to build a comprehensive understanding of the company over time and find new ways to expand value creation for our firm&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to a positive work environment, the company offers a comprehensive compensation package with an excellent performance program. AlixPartners is an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will be considered for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, veteran status or disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;À propos de WPP Media&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP est le leader mondial des services de communication et de transformation créative pour les plus grandes marques.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media est l&#39;unité opérationnelle média de WPP, réunissant médias, data, technologies et partenariats pour délivrer une personnalisation créative à grande échelle. Connectés via notre plateforme d&#39;IA marketing pionnière &lt;strong&gt;WPP Open&lt;/strong&gt; et alimentés par &lt;strong&gt;Open Intelligence&lt;/strong&gt;, nos collaborateurs permettent aux annonceurs de comprendre avec précision l&#39;impact et la performance de leurs investissements médias.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pour des raisons de clarté et d&#39;accessibilité, nous avons choisi de ne pas utiliser l&#39;écriture inclusive dans nos communications. WPP Media est fermement engagé en faveur de la diversité : nous valorisons l&#39;inclusion et l&#39;égalité des chances, en considérant l&#39;ensemble des candidatures sans distinction d&#39;identité de genre, d&#39;origine ethnique, de religion ou de handicap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nos valeurs fondamentales :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be Extraordinary :&lt;/strong&gt; Cultiver un leadership collectif qui inspire des idées transformatrices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create an Open environment :&lt;/strong&gt; Créer un équilibre fondé sur la confiance mutuelle, l&#39;écoute et l&#39;épanouissement des équipes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead with Optimism :&lt;/strong&gt; Stimuler activement l&#39;apprentissage et le développement pour faire grandir l&#39;organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Le Rôle:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au sein de l’entité &lt;strong&gt;Data, Tech &amp;amp; Analytics (DTA)&lt;/strong&gt; de WPP Media, vous rejoignez le pôle Consulting, une équipe agile dédiée à l&#39;accélération technologique et à la valorisation de la data au service des stratégies marketing de nos clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que &lt;strong&gt;Manager Data &amp;amp; Tech Consulting&lt;/strong&gt;, vous jouez un rôle pivot à la croisée du conseil stratégique, de l&#39;avant-vente et de l&#39;innovation. Véritable pont entre les enjeux business des annonceurs et l&#39;expertise technique, votre mission est d&#39;écouter, diagnostiquer, vulgariser et prescrire les meilleures solutions data &amp;amp; tech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous intervenez comme un partenaire stratégique de confiance auprès des directeurs marketing clients ainsi que des équipes conseil et expertises médias internes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Vos Missions Principales:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Diagnostic stratégique &amp;amp; Conseil client :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyser les besoins marketing et médias des clients (annonceurs nationaux et internationaux) et identifier leurs opportunités de transformation data (activation, mesure, attribution, qualification d&#39;audience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduire des diagnostics de maturité data et recommander des feuilles de route adaptées aux objectifs business des marques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vulgariser des concepts techniques complexes auprès d&#39;interlocuteurs non spécialistes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Avant-vente, Prescription &amp;amp; Développement d&#39;offres :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Détecter proactivement les opportunités de valorisation des expertises DTA auprès des équipes conseil de l&#39;agence et lors de briefs clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concevoir les propositions de valeur adaptées en piochant dans le catalogue de solutions technologiques WPP (notamment la suite WPP Open et les agents IA) ou en élaborant des offres de conseil sur-mesure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rédiger les propositions commerciales, cadrer les devis (temps de conseil, outils) et porter la soutenance en clientèle lors de pitchs et de rendez-vous stratégiques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Coordination transverse &amp;amp; Synergie technique :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assurer la passerelle entre le besoin d&#39;affaires du client et les équipes techniques internes (Data Scientists, ingénieurs et développeurs de l&#39;équipe DTA).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cadrer les projets en phase d&#39;initiation et veiller à ce que les solutions déployées répondent parfaitement aux attentes initiales de l&#39;annonceur.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborer étroitement avec les équipes d&#39;activation média (Search, Social, Display, Programmatique) pour interconnecter la data et la performance de campagne.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Profil Recherché:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expérience :&lt;/strong&gt; 5 à 8 ans d&#39;expérience dans une fonction de conseil data, de chef de projet digital/martech, de consultant avant-vente ou de stratégie média, idéalement acquise en cabinet de conseil digital, en agence média ou chez un acteur adtech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Posture Conseil &amp;amp; aisance relationnelle :&lt;/strong&gt; Excellentes capacités d&#39;écoute, de pédagogie et de conviction. Vous savez instaurer une relation de confiance avec des interlocuteurs de niveau Direction et porter un discours commercial à forte valeur ajoutée.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture Data &amp;amp; Marketing Digital :&lt;/strong&gt; Très bonne compréhension globale de l&#39;écosystème de la data publicitaire. Vous maîtrisez le vocabulaire sans avoir besoin de manipuler les outils techniques au quotidien.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Esprit de synthèse &amp;amp; présentation :&lt;/strong&gt; Maîtrise avancée de la conception de présentations percutantes pour traduire des problématiques techniques en opportunités business concrètes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Langues :&lt;/strong&gt; Français courant et pratique professionnelle fluide de l&#39;anglais à l&#39;écrit comme à l&#39;oral (échanges réguliers avec nos réseaux internationaux et certains clients paneuropéens).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Avantages &amp;amp; vie chez WPP Media:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cadre de travail :&lt;/strong&gt; Un campus moderne et dynamique à Levallois-Perret, doté d&#39;espaces collaboratifs, d&#39;espaces extérieurs et de services de restauration d&#39;entreprise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organisation du travail :&lt;/strong&gt; Politique hybride flexible (jusqu&#39;à 2 jours de télétravail par semaine).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accès aux technologies de pointe :&lt;/strong&gt; Accès direct et formation aux innovations de pointe du groupe (suite WPP Open, solutions d&#39;IA générative).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engagement solidaire :&lt;/strong&gt; Possibilité de participer à des missions d&#39;intérêt général via notre programme &lt;em&gt;We care and we act&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Processus de recrutement:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Premier Contact (RH) :&lt;/strong&gt; Échange préliminaire téléphonique ou visio avec l&#39;équipe Talent Acquisition pour faire le point sur votre parcours et vos attentes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entretien Métier :&lt;/strong&gt; Rencontre approfondie avec le Responsable du pôle Data &amp;amp; Tech Consulting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mise en situation &amp;amp; Entretien Direction :&lt;/strong&gt; Cas pratique axé sur la posture de conseil, la pédagogie et la compréhension business, suivi d&#39;un échange avec la Direction DTA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Staffbase&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We inspire people to achieve great things together. Our mission is to help organizations unlock the power of inspirational communication with the first &lt;strong&gt;AI-native Employee Experience Platform&lt;/strong&gt;. Our&lt;strong&gt; industry-leading and award-winning agentic AI communications channels&lt;/strong&gt; - intranet, employee app and email solutions - create engaging experiences that connect and empower employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Chemnitz, Germany and New York City, with offices in Berlin, London, Sydney, Tokyo, Prague, and Minneapolis–St. Paul, our diverse team of 550+ employees supports 1,500+ customers—reaching over 14 million employees—in transforming their employee experience.&lt;br&gt;We are proud to be a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Unicorn&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;company—privately valued at over $1 billion—demonstrating strong growth, innovation, and lasting impact in our industry. Together, we’re shaping the future of workplace communication.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;As a Staff Engineer on the Search team, you&#39;ll take on one of our most important platform challenges: making every employee able to find what they need, and get a trustworthy answer, across Staffbase and the tools around it. Today search spans people, posts, pages, files and connected integrations, and it increasingly feeds AI-generated answers. You&#39;ll define how retrieval, ranking and grounded answers work at that scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Your north star is a search platform that finds the right thing, fast, for the right person. It must respect permissions on every query, work in every language our customers use, and give answers that cite their sources. You&#39;ll build the core, set the quality bar, and decide where we use proven techniques and where we experiment, all on a mature, multi-tenant platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;This is a role for someone who wants to drive, not just deliver. You&#39;ll shape the direction of an open-ended problem, and you&#39;ll measure your work with real relevance data, not gut feeling.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Our tech stack includes Kotlin, Java, OpenSearch/Elasticsearch, MongoDB, React, TypeScript, Terraform, Docker and Playwright, plus LLM and embedding services for retrieval, reranking and summarisation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;The Search team sits at the heart of how employees find information at Staffbase. We own the full path from query to result: indexing and embeddings, hybrid keyword and semantic retrieval, ranking and reranking, typeahead, and the AI summaries that answer questions with citations. Search is also a core source of knowledge for Navigator, our AI assistant, and the main way it grounds its answers in company content.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;That means two big things. First, we make results relevant: understanding the query, retrieving the right candidates, ranking them well, and doing it in the user&#39;s language. Second, we make search safe and fast: every result respects the user&#39;s access rights, every tenant stays isolated, and the fast path stays fast. We don&#39;t ship relevance changes on a hunch. We run offline evaluations, golden query sets and online signals, and we change one thing at a time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Working with skilled and similar-minded professionals in a team that values diversity and inclusivity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;We aim to create a flexible and agile work environment that promotes the well-being and work-life balance of our employees&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;We are enthusiastic about technology and committed to using it to improve the world&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;We follow the &quot;You build it, you run it&quot; approach and take pride in it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Define and drive the search and retrieval strategy: hybrid (BM25 + vector) retrieval, reranking, query understanding and rewriting, chunking and embedding choices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Build and evolve the core ingestion and query pipeline, from sync and indexing to ranked results and AI summaries with citations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Own search quality: build evaluation tooling and golden sets (including unanswerable and permission-varying queries), define relevance metrics, and turn them into decisions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Protect the non-negotiables at scale: permission-aware retrieval, tenant isolation, multilingual handling, and graceful degradation when a dependency is slow or down&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Balance latency, quality and cost, for example what runs on the fast path versus what is allowed on the slow path&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Make search observable: tracing, relevance dashboards, and a clear way to debug why a result did or did not appear&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Lead technical strategy and architecture, and document key decisions so others can build on them&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Take ownership of major technical decisions, proactively addressing bottlenecks and ensuring product quality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Work with Product and Design to turn user problems into measurable search improvements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Contribute to technical roadmaps with engineering leadership, and coordinate with teams that feed or consume search (content, integrations, Navigator)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Mentor and guide engineers through code reviews, design discussions and experiment reviews&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Foster a culture of ownership, technical excellence and continuous improvement with teams that feed or consume search (content, integrations, Navigator)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need to be successful&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Proven track record as a Staff Engineer or Technical Lead with strong leadership and problem-solving skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Proven experience building production search or retrieval systems (OpenSearch, Elasticsearch, Solr or similar), including relevance tuning, analyzers, and index design&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with modern retrieval: vector/kNN search, hybrid fusion (e.g. RRF), cross-encoder reranking, chunking and embeddings; ideally RAG or LLM-grounded answers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;A measurement mindset: you&#39;ve built or used relevance evaluation (recall, MRR, nDCG, golden sets, LLM-as-judge with human checks) and can tell a real improvement from noise&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of multi-tenant architecture and permission-aware retrieval, with good judgment on security and isolation in search&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with latency-sensitive systems: budgets, timeouts, caching, fallbacks and degradation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Extensive experience with Kotlin/Java (or Go) on the backend; comfortable with React/TypeScript on the frontend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Knowledge of architecture and design patterns, and the judgment to make trade-offs and weigh their long-term impact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Strong communication skills, able to explain relevance and ranking trade-offs to technical and non-technical stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Experience working with Product and Design leaders to deliver customer value in an Agile environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Passion for building high-quality software&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Passion for diversity and inclusion, and the ability to foster a culture where everyone&#39;s voice is heard&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Multilingual search (analyzers, language detection, cross-language retrieval)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Query understanding: rewriting, expansion, typeahead and spell correction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Prompt-injection and data-poisoning awareness in RAG systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with LLM observability and evaluation tooling&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll get&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Competitive Compensation&lt;/em&gt; - we offer attractive salary packages including LTIP (unit-based Long Term Incentive Plan)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Flexibility &lt;/em&gt;- we offer flexible working time models and the option of hybrid work, and support this with a yearly flex work allowance of €1560&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Recharge&lt;/em&gt; - with 31 vacation days annually (incl. one floating holiday), plus pro rata fully paid Fridays off during August&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Support&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;-&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;we offer offering a company pension scheme&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Volunteers Day&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;- you’ll get one day off per year for supporting a social project&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://imgur.com/a/kIbq0q5&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

Help Build Europe's Hypersonic Capability
&nbsp;
At Hypersonica, we’re redefining what’s possible in European defence technology. We exist to deliver speed, resilience, and technological independence at a pace that sets a new standard. We are a small, elite team working on problems that matter, and solving them fast.
&nbsp;
By joining Hypersonica, you’re not stepping into a predefined role. You’re joining a talent dense environment where every individual shapes the direction of the company. Our philosophy is to hire a small number of exceptional people with broad, deep technical capability, strong judgement, and the ability to operate autonomously.
&nbsp;
We hire for talent, not rigid boxes. This role represents a business need, but the way it evolves will be shaped by the individual. If you’ve achieved what others said was impossible, or you bring a unique combination of skills that doesn’t fit a traditional mould, we want to hear from you. The work you do here directly contributes to Europe’s technological independence.What you'll do 


Own the system architecture of Hypersonica's Electronic Warfare (EW) capability, ensuring electronic support (ES), electronic attack (EA), and electronic protection (EP) functions operate as a coherent and mission-effective system.&nbsp;






Define, maintain, and manage EW system requirements, ensuring full traceability from operational needs through system architecture, subsystem allocation, verification, and validation.&nbsp;






Lead the development of EW system architectures, performance budgets, interface definitions, and mission integrations across airborne platforms and payloads.&nbsp;






Conduct threat, signal, and electromagnetic environment analyses to assess system effectiveness against representative adversary capabilities and operational conditions.&nbsp;






Lead the integration of RF sensors, receivers, transmitters, antenna systems, signal processing functions, mission computers, and platform interfaces into a coherent operational capability.&nbsp;






Define and oversee system-level modelling, simulation, laboratory testing, ground trials, and flight trials, using evidence-based analysis to drive design improvements and risk reduction.&nbsp;






Produce and maintain critical systems engineering artefacts including system specifications, interface control documents (ICDs), verification strategies, test plans, and design review materials.&nbsp;






Apply model-based systems engineering (MBSE) principles to ensure traceability between requirements, architectures, analyses, verification activities, and operational outcomes.&nbsp;






Identify and mitigate system-level risks, particularly around electromagnetic performance, interoperability, survivability, cybersecurity, verification, and platform integration.&nbsp;






Act as the technical authority for EW system engineering, working across RF, software, hardware, mission systems, cybersecurity, safety, and platform engineering disciplines to deliver robust operational capability.&nbsp;


Who you are 



An experienced Systems Engineer with&nbsp;8+ years of experience delivering complex Electronic Warfare, RF, mission systems, avionics, aerospace, defence, or other mission-critical systems.&nbsp;






Strong background in systems architecture, requirements development, requirements decomposition, verification, and validation throughout the engineering lifecycle.&nbsp;






Deep understanding of Electronic Warfare concepts, including electronic support (ES), electronic attack (EA), electronic protection (EP), threat systems, and electromagnetic spectrum operations.&nbsp;








Experience integrating RF sensors, receivers, transmitters, antennas, signal processing systems, and mission computers into operational platforms.&nbsp;






Strong knowledge of electromagnetic environments, system performance analysis, modelling, simulation, and test methodologies.&nbsp;






Familiar with MBSE approaches and capable of applying systems engineering rigour to complex, multidisciplinary defence programmes.&nbsp;






Experienced supporting major design reviews, platform integration activities, flight trials, qualification programmes, and operational capability development.&nbsp;






Technically credible across multiple disciplines, capable of influencing decisions, challenging assumptions, and driving technical direction confidently.&nbsp;






Comfortable operating within fast-moving, high-accountability environments where ambiguity is high and execution speed matters.&nbsp;






Motivated by solving nationally significant defence challenges and building capabilities that directly contribute to European security and technological independence.&nbsp;



What we offer 



A mission-driven environment with the opportunity to work on one of Europe’s most consequential defence challenges, with direct impact on sovereign capability and security.&nbsp;






Daily collaboration with top experts across engineering, operations, and defence, with real opportunity to learn from the best, contribute, and grow.&nbsp;






High ownership and autonomy; no time tracking, no micromanagement, just clear objectives and accountability for outcomes.&nbsp;






A fast-paced environment where good ideas are implemented quickly, and feedback from testing and operational activities drives real decisions.&nbsp;






A culture that values clarity, integrity, and excellence, and supports people who take initiative and push boundaries responsibly.&nbsp;






Competitive compensation and real share options aligned to responsibility and impact, not tenure or hierarchy.&nbsp;



Security and Eligibility Requirement 
Due to the nature of the work done at Hypersonica, applicants must be an EU/Nato/German citizen and be eligible for Security Clearance.&nbsp;
At Hypersonica, every hire raises the bar. We are deliberately small, intensely capable, and deeply mission-driven. If this role feels like a strong fit, or if you believe you bring something exceptional that goes beyond the description, we encourage you to apply.
&nbsp;
Hypersonica is an equal-opportunity employer and assesses candidates solely on merit, capability, and potential.
&nbsp;
You can apply directly to this role or reach out to Nathan Sweeney, Head of Talent. We review every application and aim to respond to all candidates within two weeks, whether the answer is yes or no.Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Grafana Labs is the company behind Grafana Cloud, the fully managed observability platform trusted by more than 10,000 organizations to ensure reliability, resolve incidents faster, and optimize telemetry at scale. Built on open source and open standards and designed for interoperability across any stack, Grafana Cloud brings AI to observability and observability to AI, giving teams (and their agents) unified visibility so they can see, understand, and act on all their disparate data, wherever it lives, and move at the speed of their ambitions. Customers, including Anthropic, Bloomberg, NVIDIA, Microsoft, and Salesforce, rely on Grafana Labs. We are a 100% remote company with team members across 40+ countries, backed by leading investors including Lightspeed Venture Partners, Sequoia Capital, GIC, Coatue, J.P. Morgan, CapitalG, and Lead Edge Capital. Learn more at &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://grafana.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;grafana.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt; and follow us on &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/grafana-labs/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt; and &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/grafana&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re scaling fast and staying true to what makes us different: an open-source legacy, a global collaborative culture, and a passion for meaningful work. Our team thrives in an innovation-driven environment where transparency, autonomy, and trust fuel everything we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You may not meet every requirement, and that’s okay. If this role excites you, we’d love you to raise your hand for what could be a truly career-defining opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a remote opportunity and we would be interested in applications from Germany, UK, Ireland and Spain.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grafana Cloud is our composable observability platform that integrates metrics, logs, and traces with Grafana. It allows our customers to leverage the best open source observability software – including Prometheus, Mimir, Loki, and Tempo – without the overhead of installing, maintaining and scaling their own observability stack&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Observability department is focused on enabling developers to understand the health and performance of their applications and infrastructure in any environment by providing tools to instrument their code, ingest observability data into Grafana Cloud and visualize and explore it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The OpenTelemetry SDKs team&#39;s mission is to make sure our users succeed in instrumenting their software with OpenTelemetry. We work closely with the &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/open-telemetry/community#special-interest-groups&quot;&gt;OpenTelemetry SIGs&lt;/a&gt; to make OpenTelemetry SDKs and instrumentation libraries a success. Members of this team are experts in at least one programming language and have a broad knowledge of various other programming languages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will focus on a language-specific implementation of &lt;a href=&quot;https://opentelemetry.io/docs/languages/python/&quot;&gt;OpenTelemetry in Python&lt;/a&gt;, with an emphasis on &lt;a href=&quot;https://opentelemetry.io/blog/2024/otel-generative-ai/&quot;&gt;OpenTelemetry for Generative AI&lt;/a&gt;. You will get to work in an upstream-first approach, helping accelerate the OpenTelemetry project while bringing the innovations to Grafana labs products and offerings.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a company we are remote-first and global, we embrace people of different experiences and backgrounds to build diverse teams where every person brings a unique perspective to the software. We are looking for Engineers that are passionate about communicating with data and providing seamless experiences for our customers to join our growing team! Engineers at Grafana also have the opportunity to contribute to Open Source communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Grafana Labs, ICs have a dedicated career path and do not have to become managers to progress in their career. Staff Software Engineers at Grafana have a large amount of experience across multiple areas.&amp;nbsp; They are able to estimate, plan, coordinate and deliver large tasks spanning multiple systems.&amp;nbsp; They actively coach and mentor other team members in their team and are able to identify and resolve issues with technology and product processes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will bring your software engineering expertise to develop improvements to the OpenTelemetry Python SDK and instrumentation libraries, with a strong focus on AI applications and agent workflows. This is a hands-on role for someone with deep Python expertise and an interest in AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate in open-source communities. You will develop and maintain the OpenTelemetry Python SDK and instrumentation libraries, working with maintainers and other vendors on specifications, APIs, and implementation decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build Python instrumentation for AI agents. Build instrumentation that connects agent runs, model calls, and tool execution, including across asynchronous code. Contribute to evolving OpenTelemetry conventions for generative AI, with care for sensitive data and metric cardinality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve Python SDK performance. Use profiling and benchmarks to evaluate implementation approaches with the upstream community. Make sound tradeoffs around runtime overhead, compatibility, and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be visible as an OpenTelemetry expert. Teach others, promote best practices around OpenTelemetry, semantic conventions, and various technologies and frameworks. Both within Grafana Labs and in the broader OpenTelemetry community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the technical direction and vision of the team, and contribute to business conversations on the OpenTelemetry strategy at Grafana Labs. Own projects from an ambiguous problem through design, implementation, testing, documentation, and release.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner in an open and respectful way. Lend your knowledge and skills to our GTM, Product and Support teams. Join customer conversations, investigate instrumentation issues, and turn what you learn into fixes and practical guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we are remote-first and our engineering organization is largely remote, we provide guidance and meet regularly using video calls, so high agency and good communication skills are a must.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes You a Great Fit:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Grafana Labs, Staff Engineers are defined by the impact they have and the people they enable. You take ownership of complex problems, set technical direction, and help others deliver improvements that matter to customers and the OpenTelemetry community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in software development, with strong proficiency in Python and experience debugging production software, language internals, libraries, and asynchronous code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An interest in AI applications and agent systems, and curiosity about how to instrument and troubleshoot them. Prior experience building AI systems is helpful, but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in open-source communities. You are eager to become an active member of the OpenTelemetry community, collaborate with maintainers and users, and keep learning across languages, frameworks, and the wider observability ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with observability tooling such as Grafana, Prometheus, and OpenTelemetry, alongside experience with cloud-based software or systems engineering. You understand production environments and can assess operational risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience working on open source observability projects, ideally in OpenTelemetry or Prometheus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Python instrumentation techniques, profiling, runtime diagnostics, or asynchronous context propagation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a hands-on technical leadership role, setting technical direction and leading project teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience instrumenting AI frameworks or agent workflows, or working with OpenTelemetry semantic conventions for generative AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to or maintaining Open Source projects, with evidence of successful pull requests and community collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rust experience is a plus for exploring potential Python SDK performance improvements, including Rust-backed implementations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Rewards:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the UK, the compensation range for this role is&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;GBP 107,000 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;- GBP 134,000&lt;/span&gt;. Actual compensation may vary based on level, experience, and skillset as assessed throughout the interview process. All of our roles include Restricted Stock Units (RSUs), giving every team member ownership in Grafana Labs&#39; success. We believe in shared outcomes—RSUs help us stay aligned and invested as we scale globally.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;*Compensation ranges are country specific. If you are applying for this role from a different location than listed above, your recruiter will discuss your specific market’s defined pay range &amp;amp; benefits at the beginning of the process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You’ll Thrive at Grafana Labs:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;100% Remote, Global Culture -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;As a remote-only company, we bring together talent from around the world, united by a culture of collaboration and shared purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scaling Organization&lt;/strong&gt; – Tackle meaningful work in a high-growth, ever-evolving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transparent Communication&lt;/strong&gt; – Expect open decision-making and regular company-wide updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation-Driven&lt;/strong&gt; – Autonomy and support to ship great work and try new things.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Open Source Roots&lt;/strong&gt; – Built on community-driven values that shape how we work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empowered Teams&lt;/strong&gt; – High trust, low ego culture that values outcomes over optics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career Growth Pathways&lt;/strong&gt; – Defined opportunities to grow and develop your career.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Approachable Leadership&lt;/strong&gt; – Transparent execs who are involved, visible, and human.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passionate People&lt;/strong&gt; – Join a team of smart, supportive folks who care deeply about what they do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In-Person onboarding &lt;/strong&gt;- We want you to thrive from day 1 with your fellow new ‘Grafanistas’ to learn all about what we do and how we do it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Balance is Key&lt;/strong&gt; - We operate a global annual leave policy of 30 days per annum. 3 days of your annual leave entitlement are reserved for Grafana Shutdown Days to allow the team to really disconnect. &lt;em&gt;*We will comply with local legislation where applicable.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;Grafana Labs is an equal opportunities employer. We welcome applications from everyone regardless of race, colour, nationality, origin, caste, sex, gender reassignment identity or expression, sexual orientation, age, religion or belief, disability, veteran status, genetic information, pregnancy, maternity, marital, family or carer status, or any other characteristic which is protected by local law. We believe that equality and diversity build a strong organisation, and we work hard to ensure that is the foundation of our organisation as we grow.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Grafana Labs may utilize AI tools in its recruitment process to assist in matching information provided in CVs to job postings. The recruitment team will continue to review inbound CVs manually to identify alignment with current openings.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;For information about how your personal data is used once you’ve applied to a job, check out our &lt;a href=&quot;https://grafana.com/legal/applicant-and-candidate-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
