&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Workato&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;Workato is the leading Control and Execution Platform for Enterprise AI — the neutral platform enterprises trust to put AI to work across their business. Workato unifies data, applications, and processes into a single platform so AI can reliably orchestrate business processes in production at enterprise scale. Built on more than a decade of running mission-critical processes for over half the Fortune 500 — including Nasdaq, Amazon, Cisco, Vodafone, Atlassian, and Lucid Motors — Workato turns over 14,000 enterprise systems AI needs to act on into one governed execution layer. For more information, visit &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.workato.com/&quot; data-tooltip-link-label=&quot;undefined&quot;&gt;workato.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;Ultimately, Workato believes in fostering a &lt;strong&gt;flexible, trust-oriented culture that empowers everyone to take full ownership of their roles&lt;/strong&gt;. We are driven by &lt;strong&gt;innovation &lt;/strong&gt;and looking for&lt;strong&gt; team players &lt;/strong&gt;who want to actively build our company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;But, we also believe in &lt;strong&gt;balancing productivity with self-care&lt;/strong&gt;. That’s why we offer all of our employees a vibrant and dynamic work environment &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot; href=&quot;http://www.workato.com/careers&quot;&gt;along with a multitude of benefits&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; they can enjoy inside and outside of their work lives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;If this sounds right up your alley, please submit an application. We look forward to getting to know you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;Also, feel free to check out why:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.businessinsider.com/47-enterprise-startups-to-bet-your-career-on-in-2020-2019-12&quot;&gt;Business Insider&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; named us an “enterprise startup to bet your career on”&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.forbes.com/cloud100/#a57477b5f941&quot;&gt;Forbes’ Cloud 100&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; recognized us as one of the top 100 private cloud companies in the world&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot; href=&quot;https://www2.deloitte.com/us/en/pages/technology-media-and-telecommunications/articles/fast500-winners.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;Deloitte Tech Fast 500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; ranked us as the 17th fastest growing tech company in the Bay Area, and 96th in North America&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot; href=&quot;https://qz.com/work/2053446/the-best-companies-for-working-from-home/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;Quartz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; ranked us the #1 best company for remote workers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We seek an exceptional &lt;strong&gt;Senior Go Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join the Workato Genie team. In this role, you will be responsible for developing mission-critical features and services for the Workato platform, including AI chatbot dispatching and balancing synchronous and asynchronous AI execution. In this role, y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;ou will also be responsible to:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build high-performance gateways and routing components&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build server-side infrastructure for logging and monitoring&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work closely with Infra and SRE teams to ensure high availability and scalability requirements are addressed&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate closely with the AI team to design and implement innovative features for a new AI assistant, ensuring cutting-edge performance and user experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contribute at all phases of the development lifecycle&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Write well-designed, testable, efficient code&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Evaluate and propose improvements to the existing system&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support continuous improvement by investigating alternatives and technologies and presenting these for architectural review&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications / Experience / Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BS/MS degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related subject&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;8+ years of industry experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong experience with Go language at backend (4+ years)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent debugging, analytical, problem-solving, and social skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Good understanding of all building blocks of large web applications: databases, load balancers, application servers, message brokers, caching, monitoring, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with building and scaling distributed, highly available systems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in Ruby on Rails is a plus&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contributions to open-source projects are a big plus&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Understanding of possible bottlenecks in a code and a solution in general&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At least basic knowledge of Kubernetes concepts and configuration&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with Docker and other isolation technologies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with Redis-based caching&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with public cloud infrastructure providers (AWS/Azure/Google Cloud)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in related fields (DevOps, ML, DBA, Enterprise applications, etc)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with third-party REST APIs at scale (request throttling, batch processing, etc)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills / Personal Characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Readiness to work remotely with teams distributed across the world and timezones&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Spoken English (at a level enough to pass technical interviews and work with colleagues)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Open to new technologies and willing to experiment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Full-cycle product feature delivery mindset (from design to production and maintenance).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(REQ ID: 2941)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Clear Street:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Clear Street’s mission is to give every sophisticated investor access to every asset, in every market, through a unified platform built for speed, transparency and scale.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;We give our clients the technology, tools, and service once reserved for the largest institutions, rebuilt with modern infrastructure. Our single, cloud-native, end-to-end capital markets platform powers investor growth today and is transforming how they can interact with markets tomorrow.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://clearstreet.io/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://clearstreet.io&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1766243799031000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2TBe5KeG89pR0V5dJX88v8&quot;&gt;https://clearstreet.io&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Regulatory Reporting Engineering team at Clear Street is a small team with a great deal of responsibility. We work closely with stakeholders to ensure that we meet all our financial and regulatory obligations in a timely fashion. Our goal is to make the lives of our stakeholders easier by leveraging innovative technology to create automated solutions for their workflows. As Clear Street grows into more product lines and geographical regions, every member of the team will have an opportunity to have an immense impact on the firm as a whole.&amp;nbsp; Join our team and be part of a dynamic environment where you can make a significant contribution, collaborate with talented professionals, and work with cutting-edge technology to drive operational excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Lead Software Engineer on the Regulatory Reporting Engineering team, you will play an integral role in automating our Compliance &amp;amp; Finance regulatory processes. You&#39;ll build on your analytical skills to create solutions that process large amounts of data from our data warehouse to generate clean, correct reporting, including building out reconciliations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will partner with key stakeholders across the Compliance, Finance, and Treasury teams&amp;nbsp; to understand regulatory/financial obligations and business requirements, and translate them into clean designs and scalable solutions. As the tech lead in the team, you will provide technical guidance, prioritizing work, perform hands-on design and development and code review,&amp;nbsp; as well as evolve our technical standards and best practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech Stack:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Python, SQL, Snowflake, Retool, Docker, Kubernetes, Argo, Metaplane, REST APIs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have at least three (3) years of software design and development experience including CI/CD, source code control, testing, and quality management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are highly proficient in Python,&amp;nbsp; SQL, database design, and have experience working with data warehouses like Snowflake to generate complex solutions at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a self-starter with a sense of urgency and an eagerness to learn and explore new technologies as appropriate to solve business problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a strong communicator who can interact in a clear and concise manner with non-technical business stakeholders, product managers as well engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can troubleshoot and logically assess problems and determine solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience working in the post-trade automation space designing and architecting systems that deliver solutions to complex data problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience generating complex financial industry regulatory reports like EMIR, MFID,&amp;nbsp; SFTR, CPR, K Factor etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We Offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Clear Street, we offer competitive compensation packages, company equity, pension, gender neutral parental leave, and full medical and dental insurance. Our belief has always been that we are better as a business when we are all together in person. As such, we are requiring employees to be in the office a minimum of three days per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our top priority is our people. We’re continuously investing in a culture that promotes collaboration. We help each other through challenges and celebrate each other&#39;s successes. We believe that modern workplaces succeed by virtue of having high-performance workforces that are diverse — in ideas, in cultures, and in experiences. We put in the effort to make such a workplace a daily reality and are proud to be an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Locus Robotics, we build AI-powered systems and intelligent robots that keep global supply chains running. Our platform combines advanced AI, real-time decision-making, and autonomous robotics to help leading companies improve efficiency, scale operations, and adapt to constant change.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Locus Robotics is a place to do meaningful work with real-world impact, where your ideas move quickly from concept to deployment. We invest in our people, encourage continuous learning, and give you the opportunity to grow your career while building technology that is used every day at global scale.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As an Applied AI Scientist, Simulation &amp;amp; Reinforcement Learning, you&#39;ll own the simulator behind SDL, our programme building a world-first, reinforcement-learning-driven orchestration framework for people and robots. That framework needs a simulator that is trustworthy enough to develop, tune and validate it before it touches a live warehouse.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will take over day-to-day ownership of our discrete-event simulation (built on SimPy), make it measurably closer to reality, and use it as the training and evaluation ground for learning-based policies. Simulation comes first; reinforcement learning grows to be the larger part of the role as the simulator matures. You&#39;ll compare your simulations against live operational data from some of the world&#39;s largest fulfilment sites, and your work will decide what is validated and shipped to fleets of robots in customer sites worldwide.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is not a notebook role. The simulator you own is the foundation that decides what ships to customer sites worldwide. You will work in a small, collaborative team where research meets production, as part of Applied Data Science (ADS), reporting to Oscar Mendez.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; This is a remote position based in the United Kingdom. Candidates must reside in the UK.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Right to Work:&lt;/strong&gt; Candidates must have the legal right to work in the UK. Locus Robotics is unable to provide visa sponsorship for this position, now or in the future.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Own the simulator&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and develop our SimPy-based discrete-event simulator, including its logic, design choices and the fragile areas that need care.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pay down technical debt: improve test coverage, code quality, reproducibility and developer tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the experiment infrastructure around the simulator: orchestration, study management, reporting and automated runs across benchmark sites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate and maintain site data (e.g. distance files, configs) needed to simulate customer warehouses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support scenario testing and sensitivity analysis for our order-engine and orchestration teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tune and close the sim2real gap&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, measure and reduce the sim-to-real gap against real site data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run parameter optimisation and tuning studies (e.g. Optuna), and diagnose anomalies and non-determinism.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model warehouse processes such as congestion, picker behaviour and queueing at the right level of fidelity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate results and confidence clearly to engineering, product and operations stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use Optimization, RL &amp;amp; DL to tune the simulator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grow into reinforcement learning&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn the simulator into a proper RL environment (Gymnasium/Gym-style interfaces) with fast, repeatable, scalable training runs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, train and evaluate RL policies, starting with guidance generation, and benchmark them against current heuristic algorithms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guard against overfitting to simulator artefacts, and design experiments that show what transfers to the real world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prototype, evaluate and productionise learning-based components alongside the wider ML, MLOps and OE teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current with RL, multi-agent systems and simulation research, and assess what is applicable to Locus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to internal technical papers, patents and, where appropriate, publications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A PhD in Computer Science, AI/ML, Robotics, Mathematics, Physics, Operations Research or a related quantitative field, or MSc and 5+ years of industry experience applying AI/ML or simulation to real-world problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building, extending or validating simulators, ideally discrete-event simulation (SimPy or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience with reinforcement learning and training simulation-based agents, including simulation for RL and Gym-style environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Python and software engineering fundamentals: testing, code review, maintainable and reproducible code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rigorous experimental and statistical thinking: benchmarking, tuning, ablations, uncertainty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in robotics, logistics, warehouse or other operations-heavy domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Publications in major AI, ML, robotics or vision venues (e.g. NeurIPS, ICML, ICLR, AAAI, RSS, CoRL, ICRA, IROS, CVPR, ICCV, ECCV).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent English communication skills, both written and verbal, with the ability to engage diverse audiences effectively and explain uncertain results clearly to technical and non-technical audiences in a multidisciplinary environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The expected base salary range for this role i&lt;strong&gt;s&lt;/strong&gt; GBP 70,000 - 120,000&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;based on external market data, plus bonus and equity. Actual offers will depend on factors such as the candidate&#39;s experience, education, training, key or critical skills, geographic location, and current market and business conditions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Information&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Locus Robotics is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Application Fraud Detection Notice: To help maintain a fair and secure hiring process, Locus Robotics may use AI-assisted and other automated tools to detect suspected fraud, misrepresentation, or misuse of the application process. Hiring decisions are not made solely by automated means unless otherwise disclosed where required by law.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It is unlawful in Massachusetts to require or administer a lie detector test as a condition of employment or continued employment. An employer who violates this law shall be subject to criminal penalties and civil liability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help make the world more hospitable &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The hospitality industry is uniquely human, and it deserves technology that’s just as inspiring as the people behind it. At Mews, we’re transforming the industry with a platform that helps hotels run smarter, move faster and create better guest experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work with smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do. You’ll have autonomy and the trust to make good decisions and move quickly. And you’ll enjoy a real sense of purpose as you see the impact of what we’re building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re motivated by ownership, curiosity and meaningful impact, and are driven to deliver consistent high performance, you’ll feel at home here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let&#39;s get into the specifics. It’s impossible to capture every nuance of a role – especially at a rapidly growing company like Mews – but if we had to distil it into a job description (which we do because this is a job description), it would be this:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11&quot; data-local-id=&quot;93795b139292&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Analytics Engineer to lead the data architecture behind our most business-critical financial work: billing, regulatory reporting (&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;EMI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;), &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;SOX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; compliance, financial forecasting and executive reporting. You&#39;ll design the data solutions that finance, payments and audit teams depend on, set the standards for how analytics work ships, and mentor others on the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;400&quot; data-local-id=&quot;04e5a5743e87&quot;&gt;This is a shape-the-team role. You&#39;ll have real influence over how we work, what we build and the pace we move at. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We expect you to use AI fluently where it adds leverage in modeling, code review and debugging, and to apply clear judgment on where it doesn&#39;t.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;663&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8a127a4eec79&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;69983cc5-7a69-4c5e-8cb0-2d1476fbd536&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;683&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f86dd91255b3&quot;&gt;Lead the architecture and development of high-impact data models in dbt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;759&quot; data-local-id=&quot;637843ae65c8&quot;&gt;Architect data solutions across business-critical financial workflows, including billing, regulatory reporting (&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;EMI&lt;/span&gt;), &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;SOX&lt;/span&gt; compliance, financial forecasting and executive reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;943&quot; data-local-id=&quot;328036a130de&quot;&gt;Mentor analytics engineers and review code to uphold standards across the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1026&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3cadb74519a9&quot;&gt;Find and fix performance bottlenecks across the data stack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1089&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ea6a753ebf9a&quot;&gt;Translate business problems into clean, efficient data solutions in close partnership with stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1197&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6ac1ef55faf8&quot;&gt;Set team-wide standards for documentation, CI/CD, observability and testing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1277&quot; data-local-id=&quot;84f45985e13a&quot;&gt;Set the team&#39;s norms for where AI belongs in our workflow, from model development to code review, and where human oversight stays non-negotiable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1426&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bfbd44915343&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;31d514bd-be3b-41a0-8411-e3530a1faabd&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1442&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ebab218e4ac8&quot;&gt;5+ years in analytics engineering or a similar role, with a track record of designing data models that hold up to cross-functional use.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1581&quot; data-local-id=&quot;cf5dc9cd98d7&quot;&gt;Deep, hands-on expertise with dbt, SQL and Python on a modern data platform (Databricks or equivalent).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1688&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5907f55d915c&quot;&gt;Strong grasp of pipeline orchestration, testing frameworks and the practices that keep them healthy at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1801&quot; data-local-id=&quot;766324799f66&quot;&gt;Comfortable setting technical direction, mentoring engineers and working closely with finance, payments and audit stakeholders. You can explain a trade-off clearly and influence the decision that follows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2009&quot; data-local-id=&quot;94d52040e4ec&quot;&gt;You use AI hands-on in your day-to-day technical work and can show specific examples of how it has changed the way you build, review or debug data models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2167&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d29af94c37b5&quot;&gt;You catch AI&#39;s errors before anything ships, including hallucinations, overconfident answers and plausible-but-wrong code, and you have a clear sense of where human oversight stays non-negotiable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Spain&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€65.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€85.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Czechia&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;1 008 000 Kč&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;1 320 000 Kč CZK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;UK&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£60,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£72,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;France&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€54.500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€65.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary ranges are provided in good faith and reflect current market conditions and internal pay structures. Final compensation may be adjusted based on funding, budget constraints, or exceptional candidate qualifications, but will remain within reasonable proximity to the stated range.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This salary disclosure is provided in compliance with applicable pay transparency legislation. We are committed to equal pay practices and prohibit salary history inquiries during our recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If the location you&#39;re applying from wasn&#39;t originally advertised for this role, salary range information is available upon request at any point during the application/interview process - your recruiter will be able to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our success is powered by our incredible people, supported by benefits that help them thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No matter where you’re based, you’ll enjoy:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited paid holiday (yes, really)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in our company share program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave (6 months fully paid for primary caregivers, 2 months for secondary, available after one year of service)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual Learning budget of €300 (and more for high performers) to support your development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly &quot;EDGE&quot; time to Explore, Develop, Grow, and Elevate yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A work from anywhere policy with flexibility to work abroad for a few weeks each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation options, available after one year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, hybrid working options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A home office setup budget to make your workspace your own and a monthly work-from-home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Claude tokens, so you can automate workflows and build smarter, more efficient ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Local benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll receive additional benefits that vary by location, from healthcare and retirement plans to team events, socials and other perks. Ask us about it during your interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunities employer. We value teams that reflect the diversity of the customers and communities we serve. Different perspectives make better ideas, stronger products and a more welcoming company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also believe transparency is important when deciding if you&#39;re the right fit. Mews is an ambitious, high-pressure environment of continuous learning and high standards. Success here requires resilience, adaptability and a willingness to solve difficult problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A few things that define how we work:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High autonomy means high responsibility. People are expected to take ownership and drive outcomes. There isn’t a detailed playbook for everything, and that’s part of what makes the work challenging – and rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change is constant. We’re growing quickly and adapting as we scale. Teams, processes and priorities continue to evolve, and only people who stay curious and agile will thrive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re remote-first, not relationship-free. Flexibility is core to how we work, but strong relationships still matter. Our teams are global, so we need expert collaborators and communicators to help us move forward together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI is an integral part of our processes. It’s not here to steal people’s jobs, but to amplify efficiency and productivity. We’re motivated to proactively use the technology to seek out better ways of working and share our findings with the rest of the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If there&#39;s anything we can do to support you during the application process, let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don&#39;t discriminate on the basis of race, religion, colour, nationality, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One final thing: don&#39;t hold back. If you don&#39;t meet 100% of the criteria in this job description but you&#39;re certain you could make a big impact, apply. Everyone should have equal access to opportunities, and we&#39;re committed to providing an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If Mews sounds like the kind of environment where you&#39;d thrive, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Join our investment team as a Data Analyst as we build a next-generation AI-enabled research and decision-support platform. You&#39;ll work alongside portfolio managers, analysts, and engineering teams to develop innovative solutions that connect research, investment, and portfolio data. This is an opportunity to experiment, move quickly, and shape the future of our technology in a collaborative, entrepreneurial environment.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;h2&quot; data-ccp-parastyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;6276946b-3a03-5ea4-89aa-c44ea587e84f|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[469777841,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,335551547,&amp;quot;1033&amp;quot;,335559740,&amp;quot;240&amp;quot;,201341983,&amp;quot;0&amp;quot;,335559739,&amp;quot;0&amp;quot;,201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;24&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;h2&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;h2&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;99&amp;quot;,134233118,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,134233117,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Normal&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute investment data strategies to improve the accessibility, quality, and usability of research and portfolio information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain data pipelines, databases, and data models that integrate information from multiple platforms, including Microsoft Fabric, SharePoint, and other internal systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use Python, SQL, and modern data engineering tools to automate data processing, analytics, and workflow optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with data, technology, and AI engineering teams to integrate portfolio, trading, performance, and research data sources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design AI-powered solutions that enable intelligent access to investment research, meeting notes, and decision-making history.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiment with and implement emerging AI technologies, including large language models, retrieval-augmented generation (RAG), semantic search, document processing, and AI agents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop practical applications, dashboards, and user-friendly tools that help investment professionals analyze data, monitor companies, and prepare for meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rapidly prototype, test, and refine solutions based on user feedback, then transition successful concepts into scalable, production-ready applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with portfolio managers and analysts to identify opportunities for data and AI-driven improvements and translate business needs into technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;h2&quot;&gt;What You Bring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;12&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Demonstrated builder mindset with a focus on rapidly developing, testing, and iterating practical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;12&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Strong programming skills in Python and SQL, with experience in application development, automation, or data-focused projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;12&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Passion for AI technologies, including large language models (LLMs), AI agents, and AI-powered application development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;12&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Excellent problem-solving abilities and a willingness to learn new technologies and tackle unfamiliar challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;12&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Self-motivated and able to take ownership of projects while working independently with minimal supervision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;12&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Experience with Microsoft data and analytics platforms such as Microsoft Fabric, Azure, and Power BI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;12&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Knowledge of SharePoint, Microsoft Graph, Microsoft 365 integrations, and enterprise data ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;12&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Understanding of data engineering concepts, including ETL pipelines, database design, APIs, cloud services, and application development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;12&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Familiarity with modern AI development tools such as LLM APIs, RAG architectures, vector databases, and agent frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;12&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Experience with software development best practices, including Git, testing, AI coding assistants, collaboration, and continuous learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;The expected base salary range for this position is £55,000 -&amp;nbsp;£70,000&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt; The midpoint &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;represents&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt; our general market target for a fully qualified and experienced individual performing the role. Actual starting salary may fall below or above the midpoint depending on the candidate&#39;s relevant experience, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt; and qualifications, as well as internal equity considerations. Further questions may be directed to the HR team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightRest SCXW78418936 BCX8&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightRest SCXW78418936 BCX8&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID #LI-SM1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;At Connor, Clark &amp;amp; Lunn Financial Group, we’re &quot;invested in our greatest asset, you&quot;. Our shared goals reflect what matters most to our people:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your community: we foster belonging through collaboration, inclusion and flexibility. Enjoy social events, volunteering and a strong commitment to corporate social responsibility. Our flexible work practices are designed to support work-life balance and provide employees with flexibility in where and how they work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your growth: we prioritize your development with meaningful work, continuous learning budgets, paid study days and support for professional designations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognizing you: your contributions are rewarded with competitive total compensation, retirement savings support, wellness credits, enhanced parental leave, and comprehensive health benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;For a closer look at how you can build your career with us, we invite you to explore &lt;a href=&quot;https://cclfg.cclgroup.com/careers/working-at-ccl/&quot;&gt;cclgroup.com&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;We are committed to providing an inclusive, accessible recruitment and selection process. We welcome and encourage applications from people with disabilities. Accommodations are available on request for candidates taking part in all aspects of the recruitment and selection process. Please contact &lt;a ---------- if you require accommodation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;AI may be used to support certain stages of our screening &amp;amp; recruitment process. These tools support, but do not replace, human judgment and decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW142035299 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW142035299 BCX0&quot;&gt;Resolve to Save Lives (RTSL)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; is a global health organization that partners locally and globally to create and scale solutions to the world’s deadliest &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;health threats. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Millions of people die from preventable health threats. We collaborate to close the gap between proven, life-saving solutions and the people who need them. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Since 2017, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;we’ve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; worked with governments and other partners in more than 60 countries to save millions of lives. We work toward a future where people live&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;longer, healthier lives, communities flourish, and economies thrive. This is an ambitious vision, and it inspires us and our partners to make progress every day.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW70040856 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Resolve to Save Lives (RTSL) works with governments and partners to strengthen and transform primary health care (PHC) to improve health and save lives. Our approach focuses on making PHC more prioritised, proactive and accountable for outcomes, and strengthening how care is organised, delivered, financed and measured. Drawing on expertise across RTSL&#39;s portfolio, we bring together solutions in health system resilience and epidemic readiness, digital health and data-driven decision-making, performance measurement and improvement, and sustainable health financing. We apply these capabilities to address priority health challenges, including cardiovascular health, maternal survival and sexual and reproductive health, while strengthening health systems to deliver more equitable, effective and resilient care. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW70040856 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Position Purpose&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Technical Advisor, Clinical Services &amp;amp; Health Systems Transformation will provide senior-level technical expertise to strengthen how health services are organised, managed and delivered, with an initial focus on improving maternal survival and reproductive health outcomes. Drawing on deep clinical experience and specialized expertise in health systems strengthening, systems thinking, and change management, the role leads complex technical initiatives and supports governments and country teams in identifying systemic barriers to quality care, designing and implementing practical improvements, and strengthening the institutional capabilities needed to sustain results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Director, Maternal &amp;amp; Reproductive Health, the Senior Technical Advisor works across RTSL&#39;s technical programmes to translate evidence and programme learning into effective service delivery improvements. The role exercises significant independent technical judgment in developing and adapting implementation approaches, guides multidisciplinary teams and partners through complex health system challenges, and contributes expertise and learning to strengthen RTSL&#39;s broader approaches to more proactive, reliable, and accountable health care.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Location: &lt;/strong&gt;100% Remote with travel as stated. Eligible for candidates based in the US, UK, Nigeria, Ethiopia, Rwanda, India, France and DRC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duration:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time employment for a fixed term of 24 months.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW70040856 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Core Duties and Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health Systems and Service Delivery Transformation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply systems thinking and health systems transformation approaches to identify and address systemic barriers to quality health care, drawing on service delivery assessments and analysis of health system performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide strategic and technical advice to national and subnational governments on health system and service delivery reforms, supporting the translation of national policies and priorities into effective service delivery models and implementation approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide expert technical guidance to governments and country teams on redesigning clinical care pathways, referral systems, workflows and service delivery models to improve the quality, reliability and continuity of care.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate findings from maternal death reviews, routine performance data and other sources into prioritised, feasible improvements in clinical care, service delivery and wider health system capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide multidisciplinary collaboration with technical specialists across clinical care, digital health, financing and measurement to develop integrated solutions to complex, priority service delivery challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Change Management and Institutional Strengthening&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development and adaptation of change management and implementation approaches to enable government and health facility teams to introduce, adapt and sustain improvements in service delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide strategic accompaniment and coaching to strengthen government leadership, management and institutional capabilities, including decision-making processes, performance management, accountability mechanisms and continuous improvement practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and guide practical implementation approaches, including change management plans, improvement processes, team-based coaching and mechanisms to address barriers to implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote government ownership and sustainability by embedding improved practices, management routines and accountability processes within existing health systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Implementation and Technical Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide senior technical guidance to country programmes and government partners, supporting the design, implementation and adaptation of health system and service delivery improvements, identifying emerging challenges, and recommending course corrections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with country teams, government counterparts and implementing partners to identify priorities, address operational challenges and support effective programme delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical leadership on country assessments, programme design and implementation planning, ensuring interventions respond to demonstrated system bottlenecks and country priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning, Evidence and Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide the application of data, implementation learning, and performance measurement to assess the effectiveness of service delivery changes, identify emerging challenges, and inform course correction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document and synthesise implementation experience, developing practical tools, approaches and lessons that can be adapted and applied across countries and other priority health areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clinical qualification in medicine, nursing, midwifery or a related health profession, with experience in clinical service delivery. An advanced degree in public health, health systems, health management or a related field is desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 10 years of relevant experience in clinical service delivery, health systems strengthening and service delivery transformation, including substantial experience in low- and middle-income countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience working with government institutions and health service managers to strengthen institutional capabilities, embed new ways of working and sustain improvements beyond individual projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using routine performance data, quality improvement methods, and implementation learning to inform technical decisions, assess results, and adapt interventions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Abilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in applying systems thinking, change management and health systems transformation approaches to diagnose complex service delivery challenges, design practical solutions, and achieve measurable improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of leading or supporting the implementation of complex health service delivery reforms, including changes to clinical pathways, care models, management practices or health system processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep, nuanced understanding of clinical quality and patient safety, including the organisational, workforce and system factors that influence the reliability and effectiveness of frontline health services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical leadership, facilitation, coaching, problem-solving, and relationship management skills, with the ability to influence stakeholders, navigate resistance to change and work effectively across clinical, technical and management teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, with the ability to translate complex health systems challenges into clear, actionable recommendations and to influence diverse technical, clinical, government and management stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel internationally, approximately 30%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Resolve to Save Lives prides itself on cultivating a supportive, connected remote team doing work that matters. We do everything possible to ensure our employees are connected and set up for success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The salary range&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;for applicants based in the US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; is $120,000 to $135,000 annually. The exact offer will be determined by various factors, such as the candidate&#39;s skills and experience relative to the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;For applicants based outside the US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;, salaries are set according to national labor rates for the international NGO sector.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;In addition to a competitive salary, Resolve to Save Lives provides a generous package of benefits, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Health insurance for you and your dependents&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:450,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:75}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Contributions toward retirement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:450,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:75}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Paid annual leave and sick leave, in addition to public holidays&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:450,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:75}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Two paid, week-long organization-wide breaks at mid-year and end-of-year&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:450,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:75}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Professional development and home office setup benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:450,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:75}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Up-to-date computer equipment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:450,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:75}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:450,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:75}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Anticipated Application Deadline:&lt;/strong&gt; 27 November 2026 (&lt;em&gt;This position may close earlier if a high volume of applications is received before the stated deadline&lt;/em&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot;&gt;RTSL believes its programs are strengthened when they are developed and supported by individuals with diverse life experiences whose understanding of social and cultural issues can help make our work and workforce more inclusive. We encourage applications from and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot;&gt;provide&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot;&gt; equal employment opportunities to all qualified applicants without regard to race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, ancestry, sexual orientation, national origin, age, disability, marital status, organ donor status, or status as a veteran. Resolve to Save Lives &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot;&gt;complies with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot;&gt; all applicable US EEO laws.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW142035299 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW142035299 BCX0&quot;&gt;Resolve to Save Lives (RTSL)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; is a global health organization that partners locally and globally to create and scale solutions to the world’s deadliest &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;health threats. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Millions of people die from preventable health threats. We collaborate to close the gap between proven, life-saving solutions and the people who need them. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Since 2017, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;we’ve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; worked with governments and other partners in more than 60 countries to save millions of lives. We work toward a future where people live&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;longer, healthier lives, communities flourish, and economies thrive. This is an ambitious vision, and it inspires us and our partners to make progress every day.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW70040856 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Resolve to Save Lives (RTSL) works with governments and partners to strengthen and transform primary health care (PHC) to improve health and save lives. Our approach focuses on making PHC more prioritized, proactive and accountable for outcomes, and strengthening how care is organized, delivered, financed and measured. Drawing on expertise across RTSL&#39;s portfolio, we bring together solutions in health system resilience and epidemic readiness, digital health and data-driven decision-making, performance measurement and improvement, and sustainable health financing. We apply these capabilities to address priority health challenges, including cardiovascular health, maternal survival and sexual and reproductive health, while strengthening health systems to deliver more equitable, effective and resilient care. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW70040856 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Position Purpose&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Director, Maternal &amp;amp; Reproductive Health will provide strategic and technical leadership for RTSL&#39;s portfolio to reduce preventable maternal deaths and improve sexual and reproductive health outcomes. The role will lead the development and implementation of a multi-country program that strengthens government capabilities to identify and address barriers to quality care, translate data into action, and deliver measurable improvements in health outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Director will have overall accountability for the strategy, resources, quality, performance, and results of the maternal survival and reproductive health portfolio, leading a multidisciplinary team and working closely with governments, technical partners, and colleagues across RTSL to design, implement and scale evidence-informed approaches. The role requires deep expertise in sexual, reproductive and maternal health, strong program leadership, and the ability to translate technical evidence into practical, sustainable health system improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Location: &lt;/strong&gt;100% Remote with travel as stated.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duration:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time employment for a fixed term of 24 months.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW70040856 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Core Duties and Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Leadership&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;and Portfolio Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the strategic direction, priorities and implementation approach for RTSL&#39;s maternal survival and reproductive health portfolio, exercising delegated authority to make program investment, resource allocation, and partnership decisions within approved organizational parameters and in alignment with country priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee a multi-country portfolio, with accountability for program planning, budget development and management, resource allocation, performance and delivery against strategic objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and manage a multidisciplinary team, establishing clear responsibilities and performance expectations, overseeing staffing and talent development, addressing performance and capacity gaps, and building the capabilities needed for sustained program delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership and Program Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide expert technical leadership across maternal survival and sexual and reproductive health, including maternal death surveillance and response, quality maternal care, family planning, and adolescent pregnancy prevention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development and adaptation of evidence-informed approaches that connect data-driven learning with targeted improvements in clinical care, service delivery and wider health system capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide the design and implementation of country programs, identifying opportunities to strengthen government leadership, institutional capabilities and sustainable approaches to improving health outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive innovation and collaboration across RTSL&#39;s technical teams, drawing on expertise in PHC delivery, digital health, measurement and financing to address priority health system bottlenecks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Engagement and Strategic Partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead senior-level engagement with Ministries of Health and national partners to identify priorities, shape country strategies and secure government ownership of programs and results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and manage strategic partnerships with donors, multilateral agencies, technical institutions and implementing partners, identifying opportunities for collaboration, investment and program expansion, and representing RTSL in high-level technical and policy discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance, Learning and Accountability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain overall accountability for portfolio performance and results, establishing clear performance expectations and monitoring mechanisms, and using evidence and implementation learning to inform strategic decisions, address delivery challenges, and adapt approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the generation, synthesis and dissemination of evidence and practical learning to inform policy, program improvement and scale-up across countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced degree in medicine, public health, sexual and reproductive health, obstetrics and gynecology, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 15 years of relevant global health experience, including substantial technical and leadership experience in sexual, reproductive and maternal health in low- and middle-income countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience developing and leading complex, multi-country programs, including strategic planning, budget oversight and accountability for results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience engaging senior government officials, donors and international partners, with the ability to build relationships and influence strategic decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Abilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognized technical expertise in maternal survival and reproductive health, with a strong understanding of evidence-based interventions, health service delivery and health system strengthening.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead and develop multidisciplinary teams and manage programs across different countries and organizational functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of data-driven program improvement, implementation challenges and approaches to translating evidence into sustainable results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent strategic thinking, judgement, communication and leadership skills, with the ability to navigate complex political and operational environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English required; proficiency in French desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel internationally, approximately 30% during program start-up and up to 25% thereafter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Resolve to Save Lives prides itself on cultivating a supportive, connected remote team doing work that matters. We do everything possible to ensure our employees are connected and set up for success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The salary range&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;for applicants based in the US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; is $150,000 to $170,000 annually. The exact offer will be determined by various factors, such as the candidate&#39;s skills and experience relative to the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;For applicants based outside the US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;, salaries are set according to national labor rates for the international NGO sector.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;In addition to a competitive salary, Resolve to Save Lives provides a generous package of benefits, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Health insurance for you and your dependents&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:450,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:75}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Contributions toward retirement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:450,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:75}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Paid annual leave and sick leave, in addition to public holidays&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:450,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:75}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Two paid, week-long organization-wide breaks at mid-year and end-of-year&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:450,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:75}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Professional development and home office setup benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:450,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:75}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Up-to-date computer equipment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:450,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:75}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:450,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:75}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Anticipated Application Deadline:&lt;/strong&gt; 27 November 2026 (&lt;em&gt;This position may close earlier if a high volume of applications is received before the stated deadline&lt;/em&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot;&gt;RTSL believes its programs are strengthened when they are developed and supported by individuals with diverse life experiences whose understanding of social and cultural issues can help make our work and workforce more inclusive. We encourage applications from and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot;&gt;provide&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot;&gt; equal employment opportunities to all qualified applicants without regard to race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, ancestry, sexual orientation, national origin, age, disability, marital status, organ donor status, or status as a veteran. Resolve to Save Lives &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot;&gt;complies with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot;&gt; all applicable US EEO laws.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

